ons", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002501882", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002501882', 11697, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-supreme-villagio', 'Supreme Villagio', 'supreme-villagio', 'b-supreme-universal', 'Somatane', '₹2.89 Cr - ₹3.31 Cr', '₹2.89 Cr', '["4 BHK"]', 'Ready to Move', 'Residential', 'October 2028', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9bf131e2-193e-4b27-b4cf-f1b812dec769/gallery/mvtqm8n6-ek1abx.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9bf131e2-193e-4b27-b4cf-f1b812dec769/gallery/mvtqm8n6-ek1abx.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Supreme Villagio is a gated villa community by Supreme Universal in Somatane, off the old Mumbai-Pune highway, about 10 minutes from Dehu Road. After its sold-out first phases of 3 BHK townhouses and 5 BHK twin villas, the next phases bring 4 BHK townhouses and 4 BHK twin villas, all ground plus two storeys with a top terrace and a private garden. The 4 BHK townhouses have about 2,000 to 2,200 sq ft of carpet area and 3,400 to 4,000 sq ft of usable area including the terrace and garden, from ₹2.89 crore all inclusive; the 4 BHK twin villas have about 2,400 to 2,450 sq ft of carpet area and 3,800 to 4,900 sq ft of usable area, from ₹3.31 crore all inclusive, and add a maid''s room with its own toilet and walk-in wardrobes. About 65% of the land is open space, including a 3.5-acre central boulevard landscaped by Site Concepts International under Singapore-based design director Mark Mahan, with a mini forest, maze garden, bird nesting pavilion, blossom, butterfly and spice-and-herb gardens, a yoga lawn and deck, jungle gym, reflexology park, fitness plaza, multipurpose sports court, jogging loop, meditation deck, barbecue court and party lawn, and a pool with a kids'' pool. The ready-to-use Club Villagio has a double-height lobby, mini theatre, indoor games, banquet hall, community workspace and café, gym and yoga room and a kids'' play area. Homes have laminated wooden flooring in the master bedroom, vitrified tiles elsewhere, a modular kitchen with hob, chimney and water purifier, gypsum false ceilings and a video door phone, and the community has managed security, CCTV, access control and concierge services. Nigdi is about 15 minutes away, Baner and Balewadi about 30 and Hinjewadi about 35. Phase III is registered with MahaRERA as P52100055048, with RERA possession in October 2028, and Phase IV as PR1263032502135.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Ready to Move"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100055048"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹2.89 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "October 2028"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Somatane, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100055048", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Somatane Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100055048', 14450, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-24-kalpavriksha', '24 Kalpavriksha', '24-kalpavriksha', 'b-sathe-gandhi-builders', 'Aundh', '₹1.70 Cr - ₹1.75 Cr', '₹1.70 Cr', '["3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1a3387cb-9d2b-44cb-9935-98aa9db7d093/gallery/mttxavd9-66pajv.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1a3387cb-9d2b-44cb-9935-98aa9db7d093/gallery/mttxavd9-66pajv.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Sathe 24 Kalpavriksha is a boutique residential project by Sathe Gandhi Builders in Baner, Pune, offering just 24 exclusive 3 BHK residences, priced between ₹1.70 Cr and ₹1.75 Cr. It''s located along the Baner-Pashan Link Road, close to Parihar Chowk, Westend Mall, Jupiter Hospital, and Balewadi High Street, with good connectivity to Aundh, Hinjewadi IT hub, and the Mumbai-Pune Expressway. Premium amenities include a swimming pool, plunge pool, rooftop garden, panoramic city-view deck, EV charging provision, and 24×7 CCTV security with video door phones. The RERA ID for the project is PR1260002502854.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002502854"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.70 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Aundh, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002502854", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Aundh Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002502854', 16190, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-the-arista', 'The Arista', 'the-arista', 'b-the-skies-group', 'Pimple Nilakh', '₹1.87 Cr - ₹4.25 Cr', '₹1.87 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', 'August 2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a6dc0c88-7cbe-43d4-9bc3-4158339ebef6/gallery/mvghnbi8-2g2sm4.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a6dc0c88-7cbe-43d4-9bc3-4158339ebef6/gallery/mvghnbi8-2g2sm4.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'The Arista by Cristallo Infra LLP is a single-tower residential project in Vishal Nagar, Pimple Nilakh, Pune 411027, on a land parcel of about 0.66 acre (around 27,000 sq ft). It offers 3 BHK apartments of 1,210 to 1,605 sq ft carpet, 4 BHK apartments of 1,669 to 1,994 sq ft carpet, and duplex Sky Villas of 2,153 sq ft (3 BHK) and 2,704 sq ft (4 BHK) carpet. Listed prices start around Rs 1.87 crore and go up to about Rs 4.25 crore, subject to charges, so confirm current rates with the sales team. Amenities include a rooftop infinity-edge pool, gymnasium, yoga deck, mini theatre, mini squash court, multipurpose court, party lawn, indoor games area, children''s play area and a library and co-working space. The project is close to Kalewadi Main Road (about 0.5 km), Hopscotch Pre School and Sakhi Nursing Home (about 0.2 km each), Fortuna Business Center (about 1.2 km) and Kokane Chowk (about 2.5 km). It is registered with MahaRERA under number P52100055954, with RERA possession in August 2027. Download the brochure or book a site visit through Pune Home.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100055954"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.87 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "August 2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Pimple Nilakh, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100055954", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Pimple Nilakh Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100055954', 15454, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-avani-amara', 'Avani Amara', 'avani-amara', 'b-avani-housing', 'Mundhwa', '₹75 L - ₹1.30 Cr', '₹75 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f64dd8a4-68e0-46c6-aebf-1d8e29be3e5e/gallery/mvtitxir-2deba1.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f64dd8a4-68e0-46c6-aebf-1d8e29be3e5e/gallery/mvtitxir-2deba1.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Avani Amara is a residential project by Avani Housing, developed with Bansall, in Keshav Nagar, Mundhwa, Pune, opposite the Godrej substation (Sr. No. 9 to 14/1/49). Spread over about 2 acres, it has five connected towers of ground plus 20 floors with 2 and 3 BHK homes that the developer calls Signature Homes. Wing A has 2 BHK homes of 800 to 802 sq ft and 3 BHK homes of 1,054 to 1,055 sq ft, and Wing B has compact 2 BHK homes, with a bedroom and a study room, of 609 to 638 sq ft. These are total carpet areas, including the balcony. All-inclusive prices start at ₹75 lakh for a 2 BHK and ₹1.30 crore for a 3 BHK. More than 30 amenities are spread across landscaped zones and the rooftop: a clubhouse, swimming pool with deck, multipurpose sports court, open-air gym and fitness club, yoga and meditation zone, jogging track, climbing walls, children''s and toddlers'' play areas, a dog park, party lawn with buffet and barbecue areas, amphitheatre seating, a stargazing area, co-working hub, library and crèche. Homes have 1600 x 800 mm vitrified tiles, a branded biometric lock on the main door, UPVC sliding windows, AC points in the living room and every bedroom and 5 A generator backup, and the project adds rainwater harvesting, a sewage treatment plant, a heat pump for central hot water, solar lighting in common areas and provision for EV charging. Kharadi is about 4 km away, Hadapsar 5.3 km, Koregaon Park 6.5 km, Pune Station 9.5 km and Pune Airport 11 km. The project is registered with MahaRERA (PR1260002501370).', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002501370"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹75 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mundhwa, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002501370", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mundhwa Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002501370', 12315, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-godrej-skyline', 'Godrej Skyline', 'godrej-skyline', 'b-godrej', 'Mundhwa', '₹3.49 Cr - ₹6.09 Cr', '₹3.49 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '30 November 2029', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/283be8d7-6cdf-4f53-bbba-1663780189d7/gallery/mvtc7kar-64xaj6.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/283be8d7-6cdf-4f53-bbba-1663780189d7/gallery/mvtc7kar-64xaj6.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Godrej Skyline is a luxury residential development by Godrej Properties in Koregaon Park Annexe, Mundhwa, Pune, on a 3.75-acre land parcel at the corner of a 30 m and an 18 m wide road. Four towers rise to B + G + UG + 5 podium levels + 29 floors, and each tower holds only one home type: Towers 1 and 4 are entirely 3 BHK with just three homes per floor, and Towers 2 and 3 are entirely 4 BHK with just two homes per floor. Towers 1 and 2 form the Luxury series, with imported marble in the living, dining and bedrooms, TOTO fittings and 3 BHK homes of 1,549 to 1,586 sq ft and 4 BHK homes of 2,397 sq ft. Towers 3 and 4 form the Windsor series, with 3 BHK homes of 1,349 to 1,363 sq ft and 4 BHK homes of 1,808 to 1,811 sq ft (total RERA area, including balconies). All-inclusive prices start at ₹3.49 crore for a Windsor 3 BHK, ₹4.05 crore for a Luxury 3 BHK, ₹4.69 crore for a Windsor 4 BHK and ₹6.09 crore for a Luxury 4 BHK. Living and dining rooms run up to 32 ft 10 in wide in the Tower 2 4 BHKs, and both 4 BHK towers have a servant room with its own toilet. Every 3 BHK gets two car parks and every 4 BHK three, all tandem or independent (no mechanised or stack parking), with EV-enabled bays and about 40% of the parking space kept for visitors. Amenities are spread over a landscaped E-deck and a sky level linking all four towers: a swimming pool, leisure and kids'' pools, a temperature-controlled sky pool, sky gym, squash and indoor badminton courts, a paddle and half-basketball court, spa, mini theatre, library and sky workspace. Trump World Centre is about 4 minutes away, Magarpatta Cyber City 11 minutes, Kalyani Nagar 14 minutes and EON IT Park 18 minutes. The project is registered with MahaRERA (PM1260002400007, registered 20 September 2024) with a proposed completion date of 30 November 2029, and is IGBC pre-certified Gold (August 2024).', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002400007"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹3.49 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "30 November 2029"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mundhwa, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002400007", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mundhwa Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002400007', 25871, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-raheja-vistas', 'Raheja Vistas', 'raheja-vistas', 'b-k-raheja-corp', 'Mahalunge', '₹93 L - ₹2.80 Cr', '₹93 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f6a3ff23-1594-4885-803c-779ac7881160/gallery/mvu15tc7-243ai.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f6a3ff23-1594-4885-803c-779ac7881160/gallery/mvu15tc7-243ai.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Raheja Vistas is a 7.5-acre residential project by K Raheja Corp Homes near Mahalunge Circle in Mahalunge, West Pune, about 1.5 km from Hinjewadi. It is part of K Raheja Corp''s integrated township across Mahalunge, Maan and Hinjewadi, which gives residents access to a 7.5-acre landscaped central park, a riverside promenade and a high-street retail zone in the making, with Global Indian International School inside the township. Seven towers of G+2+24 floors hold 7 or 8 homes per floor, each tower with 4 lifts, in a neoclassical design by principal architects RSP Design Consultants (India), and about 75% of the land is left open. The 2 BHK homes measure about 680, 765 and 911 sq ft and start at ₹93 lakh, ₹1.10 crore and ₹1.30 crore; the 3 BHK homes measure about 1,111 and 1,298 sq ft, from ₹1.60 crore and ₹1.95 crore, with a 1,472 sq ft 3 BHK duplex from ₹2.25 crore; and the 4 BHK homes measure about 1,360, 1,530 and 1,824 sq ft, from ₹1.90 crore, ₹2.20 crore and ₹2.80 crore. Areas are RERA carpet plus balcony, and prices are all-inclusive starting prices for the first floor; maintenance, floor rise and preferential location charges are extra. More than 40 amenities are spread over 2.6 acres on the podium and ground level, with two clubhouses: a half-Olympic pool with a kids'' pool and jacuzzi, a gym, an indoor sports arena, two squash courts, a badminton court, pickleball and futsal courts, cricket nets, a skating rink, golf putting, cycling and jogging tracks, a spa, an indoor yoga space and yoga deck, a stargazing deck, an amphitheatre, an outdoor cinema, outdoor working pods, a banquet hall, guest rooms, a rooftop party lounge, a crèche and a pet park. Homes are Vaastu compliant, with decks, video door phones and kitchen smoke detectors, and the towers have air-conditioned lobbies, CCTV, controlled access, fire protection and DG backup in the common areas. Solar panels, rainwater harvesting and full wastewater treatment are planned, and the project has applied for IGBC Gold pre-certification. Delhi Public School is 350 m away and Global Indian International School 700 m, Baner about 4 km, the Mumbai-Pune Expressway 3.8 km and Wakad 6.6 km. Towers 1 and 2 are registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002501597 by the promoter KRC Queens Private Limited, with possession committed by the developer for December 2029; the registration''s completion date is 31 July 2031.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002501597"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹93 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mahalunge, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002501597", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mahalunge Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002501597', 13676, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-privia-naimish', 'Privia Naimish', 'privia-naimish', 'b-privia-group', 'Chikhali', '₹85 L - ₹1.50 Cr', '₹85 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/52142406-0fa2-45cb-9d60-c8bb6404417c/gallery/mumd4yga-7wpi5s.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/52142406-0fa2-45cb-9d60-c8bb6404417c/gallery/mumd4yga-7wpi5s.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Privia Naimish on Spine Road, Pimpri-Chinchwad is a premium residential project offering spacious 2 & 3 BHK homes with Jodi options, designed for modern urban living. Strategically located near key hubs, it features an integrated commercial zone and two-level lifestyle amenities including a sky lounge, open gym, and children’s play area. With superior construction quality, smart layouts, and excellent connectivity, Privia Naimish delivers a perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and community.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100078327"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹85 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Chikhali, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100078327", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Chikhali Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100078327', 10611, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-supreme-towers', 'Supreme Towers', 'supreme-towers', 'b-supreme-universal', 'Mundhwa', '₹3.30 Cr - ₹11.50 Cr', '₹3.30 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK", "5 BHK", "6 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', 'December 2028', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2a5z-4zeh0n.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2a5z-4zeh0n.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Supreme Towers is a luxury residential project by Supreme Universal, with Sukhwani Realty, in Koregaon Park Annexe, Mundhwa, Pune, near The Westin. Two towers stand on a 3-acre land parcel, each with a basement, ground and podium level and 32 residential floors, and a Cloud Walk sky bridge on level 33 links them. A typical floor has just four homes, two 3 BHK and two 4 BHK. The 3 BHK homes measure 1,427 sq ft (1,292 sq ft carpet plus 134 sq ft of balconies) and the 4 BHK homes 2,178 sq ft (1,937 sq ft carpet plus 241 sq ft), with a 25 ft living and dining room, a 25 ft 6 in balcony and a servant room with its own toilet. Larger 5 and 6 BHK homes of 2,626 and 2,854 sq ft and 4 BHK duplexes of 4,356 sq ft, which the brochure calls Sky Palaces, are also offered. Prices start at ₹3.30 crore for a 3 BHK, ₹5.16 crore for a 4 BHK, ₹6.50 crore for a 5 BHK, ₹7 crore for a 6 BHK and ₹11.50 crore for a 4 BHK duplex, with floor rise, corpus and maintenance charged extra. Amenities spread over four levels and about 1 lakh sq ft: a rooftop lap pool, Vista sky bar, stargazing deck and outdoor cinema; a jacuzzi, spa, gymnasium, yoga deck and residents'' lounge on the Cloud Walk; a kids'' pool, aqua gym, play area, crèche, amphitheatre and jogging path on the podium; and gardens, a practice court and a multipurpose hall at ground level. Homes have imported marble in the living and dining room, Hansgrohe and Duravit fittings, air conditioning in the living room and every bedroom, a modular kitchen with hob and chimney and DG backup of up to 5 kVA, and the building offers valet parking and a concierge desk. Tower 1 is sold out and Tower 2 is on sale. The towers are registered with MahaRERA as P52100053868 (Tower 1) and P52100056095 (Tower 2), with a RERA completion date of June 2029; the developer expects possession in December 2028.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100056095"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹3.30 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK, 6 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "December 2028"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mundhwa, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100056095", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mundhwa Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100056095', 23125, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-atlantis', 'Atlantis', 'atlantis', 'b-kesar-group', 'Bhosari', '₹1.26 Cr - ₹2.01 Cr', '₹1.26 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn3uf-bwnu6a.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn3uf-bwnu6a.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Atlantis is a residential and retail project in Sector 7, Pradhikaran, Indrayani Nagar, Bhosari, developed by Kesar Group with Tulsi Promoters India and Atharva Buildcon. Above shops on the ground, mezzanine and part of the first floor, it offers 3 and 4 BHK homes that the developer calls villaments, with a typical floor of two 4 BHK and six 3 BHK homes. The 3 BHK homes measure about 1,123 sq ft and the 4 BHK homes about 1,460 sq ft, and the first floor has 3 BHK garden flats of about 1,869 and 1,911 sq ft that come with large private terraces. Agreement values start at ₹1.26 crore for a 3 BHK, ₹1.63 crore for a 4 BHK and ₹1.96 crore for a garden flat; with stamp duty, registration and GST, the total packages are about ₹1.41 crore, ₹1.83 crore and ₹2.20 crore. Every 3 BHK gets two covered car parks and every 4 BHK three. The more than 25 amenities include a swimming pool with an infinity edge and a kids'' pool, a multifunctional gym, a barbecue lounge, indoor games and a multipurpose hall, and a rooftop with a stargazing deck, party deck, yoga deck, exercise station, senior citizens'' seating court and children''s play area. Homes have 800 x 1200 mm tiles throughout, a digital smart lock on the main door, Jaquar or Kohler fittings, AC points in the living room and master bedroom and three-track aluminium sliding windows, and the common areas run on solar panels with generator backup for the lifts. The project is close to the Nashik-Pune highway, Bhosari MIDC, the PIECC exhibition centre and Talawade IT Park, and is registered with MahaRERA (P52100078626).', '["Gymnasium", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area", "Yoga Deck"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100078626"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.26 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Bhosari, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100078626", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Bhosari Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100078626', 11212, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-vision-ekaan', 'Vision Ekaan', 'vision-ekaan', 'b-vision-group', 'Bhosari', '₹78 L - ₹87 L', '₹78 L', '["2 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/8c495758-2bab-434b-bfe8-b7dc50ffdca6/gallery/mumj9ack-3vho0m.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/8c495758-2bab-434b-bfe8-b7dc50ffdca6/gallery/mumj9ack-3vho0m.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Vision Ekaan in Moshi, Pimpri Chinchwad, offers thoughtfully designed 2 BHK homes for families and first-time buyers looking for comfort at a value-driven price. Moshi is a fast-growing residential hub with good connectivity to the Pune-Nashik Highway, major IT and industrial belts, schools, hospitals and daily conveniences. The 2 BHK layouts focus on efficient space planning, good ventilation and natural light, backed by lifestyle amenities for a well-rounded community living experience. Whether you''re buying to live in or to invest, Vision Ekaan is a strong option in one of Pune''s most promising micro-markets.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002601743"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹78 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Bhosari, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002601743", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Bhosari Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002601743', 10483, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-shreenidhi', 'Shreenidhi', 'shreenidhi', 'b-shreenidhi-developers', 'Baner', '₹99 L - ₹1.37 Cr', '₹99 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3c41b097-0b1d-403a-aa12-8e604481316d/gallery/mtvftbrc-cmg6cv.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3c41b097-0b1d-403a-aa12-8e604481316d/gallery/mtvftbrc-cmg6cv.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Shreenidhi in Pashan offers premium 2 & 3 BHK residences thoughtfully planned across a 1-acre land parcel with a modern tower, combining elegant design, quality amenities, and excellent city connectivity. Starting at ₹99 Lakhs onwards, the project is ideal for homebuyers seeking comfortable and upscale living in one of Pune’s prime residential locations.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002500378"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹99 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Baner, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002500378", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Baner Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002500378', 12014, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-santiago-skyworld-2-0', 'Santiago Skyworld 2.0', 'santiago-skyworld-2-0', 'b-santiago-on-sector-7-road', 'Bhosari', '₹1.47 Cr - ₹2.11 Cr', '₹1.47 Cr', '["3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/2be1e665-b28e-4bf5-a42f-348a3a0fa8ff/gallery/mvu2wo4q-g2u1r4.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/2be1e665-b28e-4bf5-a42f-348a3a0fa8ff/gallery/mvu2wo4q-g2u1r4.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Santiago Skyworld 2.0 is a new 12-storey residential tower with ground-floor shops by Santiago on Sector 7 Road, Indrayani Nagar, Bhosari, in the Pradhikaran area of Pimpri-Chinchwad, and the second Skyworld project after Santiago Skyworld on Spine Road. It has only six homes per floor, all 3 BHK, which the developer calls 3 bed suites: homes of 1,332, 1,348 and 1,375 sq ft from ₹1.47 crore agreement value, and garden flats of 1,471 to 1,956 sq ft from ₹1.59 crore. Every home has three balconies plus a separate dry balcony, a private aangan at the entrance, a spacious designer kitchen and Vastu-compliant planning, and comes with two covered car parks. The building has two high-speed branded lifts and a wide staircase, a first-floor amenity level with a swimming pool, an indoor gym, indoor games, a library and a co-working space, and rooftop amenities with open views. The ground-floor commercial shops suit retail, showrooms and offices. The developer gives travel times of about 2 minutes to shopping malls, 5 minutes to COEP University, the PCMC court, Star Bazaar, schools, colleges and hospitals, and 10 minutes to more than ten hotels, with Spine Road and the highways close by; it also points to an upcoming IIM campus and metro station about 5 minutes away. Possession is planned for December 2028. The gallery shows artist''s impressions from the developer''s Santiago Skyworld brochure.', '["Gymnasium", "Library", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.47 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Bhosari, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Bhosari Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 11061, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-kosha', 'Kosha', 'kosha', 'b-konbil-group', 'Koregaon Park', '₹5.91 Cr - ₹12.85 Cr', '₹5.91 Cr', '["4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1fb3b136-50b8-4324-8729-93f941e2b964/gallery/mvu3597y-eky877.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1fb3b136-50b8-4324-8729-93f941e2b964/gallery/mvu3597y-eky877.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Kosha is a luxury tower of 4.5 BHK homes on South Main Road, Koregaon Park, near Blossom Boulevard, by Konbil Group and Chandra Prabha Developers through Hydepark Developers LLP. With only four residences per floor and 3.9-metre floor-to-ceiling heights, it offers three kinds of home, each with four bedrooms and a house-help room: 4.5 BHK residences of about 2,257 to 2,943 sq ft of carpet area with long sit-outs; garden residences on the first floor with private gardens, quoted at about 3,582 to 4,398 sq ft; and duplex sky villas on the 20th and 21st floors with open-to-sky gardens and terraces, quoted at about 4,372 to 5,423 sq ft. On the current price sheet, bare-shell homes start at ₹5.91 crore for a 2,257 sq ft residence, ₹9.83 crore for a garden residence and ₹12.85 crore for a sky villa (agreement value, before GST, stamp duty and registration). Amenities spread across three levels include a swimming pool with a poolside deck, a gym, sauna, yoga deck, café, business centre, banquet hall, card room, senior citizens'' garden and landscaped recreation spaces, and a 360-degree skywalk around the building, with a grand entrance lobby and concierge. The tower has four levels of covered parking, high-speed elevators, slab-to-slab aluminium windows with high-performance glass, DG backup for the entire apartment, a BMS and control room, CCTV, access control at each common entrance, automatic biometric door locks and sprinklers and smoke detectors in every home. German Bakery, Osho Garden and Malaka Spice are within five minutes, The Westin, Conrad, Marriott Suites and Kalyani Nagar within ten, Poona Club and the Symbiosis institutes within fifteen, and Magarpatta, Hadapsar IT Park and The Bishop''s School within twenty. The project is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002500453.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Concierge"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002500453"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹5.91 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Koregaon Park, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002500453", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Koregaon Park Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002500453', 26181, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-hiranandani-krisala-township', 'Hiranandani Krisala Township', 'hiranandani-krisala-township', 'b-hiranandani', 'Darumbre', '₹75 L - ₹1.12 Cr', '₹75 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f6112baa-0481-401b-8910-ec78b165019e/gallery/mruxuv87-8c5g2i.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f6112baa-0481-401b-8910-ec78b165019e/gallery/mruxuv87-8c5g2i.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Hiranandani Mamurdi is a luxurious residential project offering 2 & 3 BHK apartments with 50+ premium amenities, designed by the renowned architect Arco. Located in Pune’s sought-after western suburbs, it combines eco-friendly landscapes with modern living. Backed by the trusted Hiranandani Group, this development ensures an exceptional lifestyle and promising investment opportunities.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002502438"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹75 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Darumbre, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002502438", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Darumbre Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002502438', 10000, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-gaikwad-unico', 'Gaikwad Unico', 'gaikwad-unico', 'b-gaikwad-corp', 'Ravet', '₹1 Cr - ₹1.20 Cr', '₹1 Cr', '["3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e90f1de0-1d98-411c-b4ef-e535dce471e7/gallery/mv54jco0-7zkd55.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e90f1de0-1d98-411c-b4ef-e535dce471e7/gallery/mv54jco0-7zkd55.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Gaikwad Unico in Ravet, Pune, is a premium residential project by Gaikwad Corp offering spacious 3BHK apartments with carpet areas ranging from 970 to 1200 sq. ft. Designed for modern families, these well-planned homes feature smart layouts, quality finishes, and ample natural light. The project also boasts a range of lifestyle amenities catering to all age groups, ensuring comfort, convenience, and a balanced living experience in a fast-developing neighborhood.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100080562"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100080562", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100080562', 10309, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-the-reserve-mundhwa', 'The Reserve', 'the-reserve-mundhwa', 'b-the-skies-group', 'Mundhwa', '₹2.35 Cr - ₹5.35 Cr', '₹2.35 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', 'December 2029', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bf83785b-7b34-4206-a1c4-1a538a8ce57a/gallery/mvu1aoaa-1tal46.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bf83785b-7b34-4206-a1c4-1a538a8ce57a/gallery/mvu1aoaa-1tal46.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'The Reserve is a low-density residential project by Lohia Jain Malpani Properties (promoter LJM Estate LLP, in association with Kodre Realty) at Pingale Wasti, Mundhwa, near the Mundhwa Passport Seva Kendra, in the stretch better known as Koregaon Park Annexe. Spread over 4.25 acres, it has three towers of 20 residential floors above two basement parking levels and a stilt floor, built with an earthquake-resistant RCC frame, aluminium formwork and AAC blocks, and a 3.30 m floor-to-floor height. The homes are 3 BHK apartments of 1,243, 1,413 and 1,417 sq ft from ₹2.35 crore, 4 BHK residences of 2,482 and 2,698 sq ft from ₹4.70 crore, which the brochure calls 4.5 BHK because each adds a servant''s room with its own toilet, and a select few 4 BHK duplexes of 2,696 sq ft at ₹5.35 crore. All prices are all-inclusive packages covering stamp duty, registration and GST; areas are the total carpet areas on the developer''s cost sheet. More than an acre of open space at ground level is kept free of vehicles, and amenities are spread across the ground, podium and terrace: a swimming pool, a gymnasium of over 2,000 sq ft, an open gym, a yoga pavilion, a glass pavilion, a multi-sports area and box cricket, a banquet hall with an attached garden, an amphitheatre, a kids'' play area, seating pods, a barbecue area, acupressure and jogging tracks, senior citizens'' sit-outs and rooms for drivers. Homes have 1200 x 1800 mm vitrified tile flooring, a fully loaded modular kitchen with a granite platform, powder-coated windows with double-glazed glass, Grohe or equivalent fittings, a shower panel in the master bathroom, a digital lock on the main door, a video door phone and three-level access control. Green features include a sewage treatment plant, rainwater harvesting, solar hot water in the master bathroom, a bore-water treatment plant, a garbage chute and EV charging points. The brochure places the offices of Bajaj Finance, Bharat Forge, Google and Poonawalla Fincorp within about 200 m, and Kopa mall and Koregaon Park''s cafés and restaurants less than a kilometre away, with Kalyani Nagar, Kharadi, Magarpatta and SP Infocity a short drive away. The project is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002400065, with 290 homes; the developer is targeting possession in December 2029, and the RERA completion date is 30 April 2030.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002400065"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹2.35 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "December 2029"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mundhwa, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002400065", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mundhwa Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002400065', 18905, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-zenone', 'Zenone', 'zenone', 'b-zenone-developers', 'Wakad', '₹1.03 Cr - ₹3.56 Cr', '₹1.03 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "5 BHK"]', 'Ready to Move', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/30617edf-80e6-434b-adbb-2f306acea067/gallery/mtgwb4eh-bqushf.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/30617edf-80e6-434b-adbb-2f306acea067/gallery/mtgwb4eh-bqushf.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Zenone in Wakad is a contemporary mixed-use development spread across 2.25 acres, featuring 3 residential towers and 1 commercial tower, with Phase 1 already completed. The project boasts a Basement + Ground + 12-floor elevation, 3 high-speed elevators, and thoughtfully designed amenities and open spaces spanning 8,500 sq. ft.—offering a well-connected and modern lifestyle in a thriving Pune neighborhood.', '["Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Ready to Move"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100053350"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.03 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 5 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100053350", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100053350', 13642, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-venkatesh-vanaya', 'Venkatesh Vanaya', 'venkatesh-vanaya', 'b-venkatesh-buildcon-on-old-mundhwa-road', 'Kharadi', '₹1.02 Cr - ₹1.43 Cr', '₹1.02 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6dcdd53e-530b-446c-a6c8-123ef894a217/gallery/mvu457zd-a1y6oz.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6dcdd53e-530b-446c-a6c8-123ef894a217/gallery/mvu457zd-a1y6oz.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Venkatesh Vanaya is a 10-acre residential project by Venkatesh Buildcon on Old Mundhwa Road, near Oxygen Park in Kharadi, with 4, 3 and 2 BHK homes in 21-storey towers above four levels of parking. The 2 BHK homes have about 777 to 849 sq ft of total carpet area and start at ₹1.02 crore, the 3 BHK homes about 1,107 to 1,203 sq ft from ₹1.43 crore, and the 4 BHK homes in wing D about 1,732 to 1,944 sq ft, including 3 BHK plus service-quarter layouts; areas include balconies and dry balconies, and prices are lump-sum agreement values, with stamp duty, GST, registration, floor rise and preferential location charges extra. More than 25 amenities are planned around a tropical landscape: a swimming pool with a kids'' pool, a clubhouse, gym, yoga room, meditation studio, Zumba and aerobics room, co-working lounge, business centre, reading lounge, crèche, indoor games, multipurpose hall, hobby and art zone and acoustic room, with a multipurpose court, box cricket, pickleball court, outdoor gym, amphitheatre, party lawn, multipurpose lawn with a stage, kids'' play area, jogging track, acupressure pathway and senior citizens'' sit-out outside. Homes have 600 x 1200 mm or 800 x 800 mm vitrified flooring, aluminium or UPVC sliding windows with mosquito nets, a digital lock on the main door, Jaquar or Kohler fittings, concealed copper wiring with AC points in the living room and all bedrooms, a video door phone and Kone or Otis lifts, and the towers are built with aluminium formwork. E-Space IT Park is 1.7 km away, Zensar 2.2 km, EON IT Park and Panchshil Tech Park 3.5 km and the World Trade Centre 3.6 km, with Phoenix Avenue of Stars 2.8 km, Ramwadi metro station 3.3 km and Pune airport 6.1 km. Four phases are registered with MahaRERA: PR1261012601304 (wings K and L), PR1261012601206 (wings I and J), PR1261012601229 (wing H) and PR1261012601264 (wing D); the promoter is SVBPL Homes Pvt. Ltd.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1261012601304"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.02 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kharadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1261012601304", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kharadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1261012601304', 13092, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-petals-tathawade', 'Petals', 'petals-tathawade', 'b-pashankar-developers', 'Tathawade', '₹59.49 L - ₹91 L', '₹59.49 L', '["1 BHK", "2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n4xe-3dqfkr.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n4xe-3dqfkr.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Petals by Pashankar Developers is a residential project at Sr. No. 27/1, near Raghunandan Lawns, Nimbalkar Nagar, Tathawade, about 400 m from Dange Chowk and 100 m from the Aundh-Ravet BRTS road. Six wings, A to F, of basement, ground and seven floors hold 147 homes in five layouts: 1 BHK of 438 and 490 sq ft, 2 BHK of 679 and 806 sq ft and 3 BHK of 963 sq ft. The 1 BHK of 490 sq ft is offered at ₹59.49 lakh with an allotted car park and the 2 BHK of 806 sq ft at ₹91 lakh, both all inclusive. Rooftop terraces have landscaped gardens, open gym equipment and gazebo sit-outs, and the project has a Ganesh mandir, a children''s play area and a senior citizens'' area. Homes get a main door with an automated electronic lock with fingerprint access, 1600 x 800 mm vitrified tiles, a black granite kitchen platform with a stainless steel sink, powder-coated aluminium sliding windows with mosquito nets, Jaquar or equivalent fittings with hot and cold mixers, concealed copper wiring with Legrand or equivalent switches and AC provision in the master bedroom. The building has 24-hour CCTV and security, a designer entrance gate with a security cabin, a lift with generator backup, solar water heating, a sewage treatment plant and a multi video door phone system. Ravet is about 5 minutes away, the Mumbai-Pune highway about 6, JSPM College of Engineering about 7, Aditya Birla Memorial Hospital about 10, Phoenix Marketcity Wakad about 11 and Hinjewadi IT Park about 15 to 17 minutes. The developer gives completion as February 2027, and the project is registered with MahaRERA as P52100051579.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100051579"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹59.49 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100051579", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100051579', 13582, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-dream-delmont', 'Dream Delmont', 'dream-delmont', 'b-dream-works-realtors', 'Bavdhan', '₹1.07 Cr - ₹1.53 Cr', '₹1.07 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv33n-92xe2v.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv33n-92xe2v.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Dream Delmont is a residential project by Dream Works Realtors in Bavdhan Budruk, Pune, near Arihant College and about two minutes from Chandni Chowk. It has five towers of up to 24 floors on about 4 acres, with four homes on each floor. It offers 2 BHK homes of 825 sq ft from ₹1.07 crore and 3 BHK homes of 1,110 sq ft from ₹1.53 crore (all-in prices), where the areas are carpet plus balcony (731 and 1,003 sq ft of carpet). About 40,000 sq ft is given to landscaping and amenities: a swimming pool with an infinity edge, a star-gazing deck, an outdoor movie lounge, an amphitheatre with a stage, a BBQ lounge and al-fresco dining, an orchard and herb garden, a temple, a meditation court, yoga and outdoor exercise stations, a gym, a multipurpose court and a podium kids'' play area. Homes get 800 x 1600 mm vitrified flooring, uPVC windows, Grohe or equivalent bathroom fittings and a video door phone. The Mumbai-Bengaluru highway is about a minute away and Kothrud about seven minutes, according to the developer. The project is registered with MahaRERA as P52100054736, with a RERA completion date of March 2029.', '["Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100054736"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.07 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Bavdhan, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100054736", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Bavdhan Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100054736', 12969, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-sai-kripa-commercial', 'Sai Kripa Commercial', 'sai-kripa-commercial', 'b-sai-nisarg-landmark', 'Ravet', '₹1.33 Cr', '₹1.33 Cr', '["Commercial"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/31cd26d0-3555-4bdf-8c1e-7a840afda71b/gallery/mvuiy6vl-a7nd8u.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/31cd26d0-3555-4bdf-8c1e-7a840afda71b/gallery/mvuiy6vl-a7nd8u.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Sai Kripa Commercial is the retail floor of Sai Kripa, Krishna Rama Developer''s building on Plot No. 415, Sector 29, Ganesh Nagar, Ravet, in the Pradhikaran area of Pimpri-Chinchwad. Eight shops, numbered 01 to 08, line the ground floor behind glass shopfronts facing a 10.5 m road, with 5 m driveways down both sides of the building. Each shop is a 40 ft deep, 10 ft wide unit, and the developer''s cost sheet gives its size as 555 sq ft. The developer pitches the shops at cafés, boutiques, pharmacies and everyday essentials. Footfall comes from students at PCCOE and the D. Y. Patil schools and colleges, families in Pradhikaran''s residential sectors (the developer cites more than 6,000 homes nearby), commuters using Akurdi railway station and the 36 households in the 3 BHK homes upstairs, which are sold separately as Sai Kripa. PCCOE, D. Y. Patil Dnyanshanti School, DMart Ravet, Global Hospital and Akurdi railway station are about 5 minutes away, the old Mumbai-Pune highway and NH-48 about 10 and Chinchwad station about 12. The building has high-speed lifts, an EV charging point and solar power generation. A shop is ₹1.33 crore agreement value, or ₹1.49 crore including 5% GST, 7% stamp duty and registration. Possession is planned for December 2030 (RERA completion date April 2031). MahaRERA PM1260002500965.', '["EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002500965"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.33 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Commercial"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002500965", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002500965', 24000, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-aspire-puravankara', 'Purva Aspire', 'aspire-puravankara', 'b-puravankara', 'Bavdhan', '₹1.18 Cr - ₹1.32 Cr', '₹1.18 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b635d410-6c97-449e-9f8d-75ef5b27ddfe/gallery/mtsjumbe-34870y.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b635d410-6c97-449e-9f8d-75ef5b27ddfe/gallery/mtsjumbe-34870y.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Purva Aspire is a residential project by Puravankara at the foothills of the NDA hills in Bavdhan, Pune, on a 2.5-acre land parcel with two towers of basement, ground, podium and 17 storeys. Its 2 and 3 BHK homes are built around the developer''s Twin Living idea: an indoor living room plus an outdoor lounge, with covered and open balconies, cross ventilation and plenty of daylight. The 2 BHK Grand has about 828 sq ft of usable area (about 719 sq ft RERA carpet) and is priced from ₹1.18 crore, a 928 sq ft 2 BHK is priced from ₹1.32 crore, and the 3 BHK Grand and Luxe have about 1,153 and 1,453 sq ft of usable area (about 984 sq ft RERA carpet). Drinking water is purified in a central treatment plant and supplied straight to the kitchen tap, the clubhouse includes an Oxygen Club supplied with oxygen-optimised fresh air, and homes can be fitted with the BluNex Life intelligent-home package for app and voice control of lighting, cooling and security. Amenities include a swimming pool, yoga pavilion, landscaped central courtyard, gym, indoor games, library and multipurpose hall, with covered car parking, rainwater harvesting and a sewage treatment plant that recycles water for flushing and gardening. The Mumbai-Pune-Bangalore highway (NH 48) is about 5 minutes away, and Hinjewadi IT Park, Baner and Balewadi are close by. The project is registered with MahaRERA (P52100017650).', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100017650"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.18 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Bavdhan, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100017650", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Bavdhan Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100017650', 14251, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-pride-world-city-boston', 'Pride World City Boston', 'pride-world-city-boston', 'b-pride-purple', 'Charoli', '₹72.99 L - ₹77.99 L', '₹72.99 L', '["2 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/0345fcc0-f941-42e3-b0ca-79fe7ceba616/gallery/mvv3stv8-aigzir.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/0345fcc0-f941-42e3-b0ca-79fe7ceba616/gallery/mvv3stv8-aigzir.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Pride World City Boston is a cluster of compact 2 BHK homes in Pride Group''s 400-acre Pride World City township at Charholi Budruk in north-east Pune. Planned on about 8.5 acres as ten towers of 23 floors with around 1,800 homes, it is registered with MahaRERA so far in two phases: P52100049648 for towers A, B and C and P52100078307 for towers D, E and F. It offers two 2 BHK sizes, 673 sq ft from ₹72.99 lakh and 726 sq ft from ₹77.99 lakh (carpet area, developer''s 2026 prices). Every 2 BHK has two balconies, an L-shaped living and dining room and an open dry balcony. The towers stand on two landscaped podiums with panoramic views, there are two clubhouses including The Boston Club, and the 50-plus amenities include a football court on the podium, children''s play areas, jogging tracks, a gym and indoor games; parking is fully covered, in a multilevel car park.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100049648"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹72.99 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Charoli, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100049648", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Charoli Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100049648', 10845, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-celestia-heights', 'Celestia Heights', 'celestia-heights', 'b-prapti-buildcon', 'Punawale', '₹67.98 L - ₹95.00 L', '₹67.98 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "Office"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1c2a076f-5560-471a-b74d-4b10d2c36256/gallery/mvu4lfz8-ec7cds.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1c2a076f-5560-471a-b74d-4b10d2c36256/gallery/mvu4lfz8-ec7cds.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Celestia Heights is a residential project by Prapti Buildcon on Kate Wasti Road in Punawale, beside the Kate Wasti forest, with two towers of two basements, ground and 14 storeys. It offers 2 BHK homes of about 747 to 782 sq ft from ₹68 lakh and 3 BHK homes of about 1,044 to 1,049 sq ft from ₹95 lakh (agreement value; about ₹76 to ₹80 lakh and ₹1.07 crore with stamp duty, GST and registration), with an aangan at the entrance of each 3 BHK, two 4th-floor 3 BHK garden homes with private gardens of about 404 and 422 sq ft, and two 527 sq ft 1 BHK homes on the refuge floors. Commercial offices of about 400 to 700 sq ft on the 1st and 2nd floors start at ₹90 lakh. Areas are RERA carpet plus balcony. Amenities include a clubhouse with a gym, hobby room and business centre, a billiards lounge and indoor games, a lawn sitting area, gazebo seating and a barbecue area, and on the top terrace a kids'' play area, sand pit, acupressure pathway, viewing deck, stargazing zone and walking and jogging track. The site is about a kilometre from Laxmi Chowk and about two from Wipro Circle and Hinjewadi Phase 1, close to the 65 m ring road, Life Republic and the Mumbai-Bengaluru highway at the Punawale underpass. The project is registered with MahaRERA as PM1260002602252, with possession expected in 2030.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002602252"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹67.98 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, Office"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002602252", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002602252', 16994, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-skyway-elite', 'Skyway Elite', 'skyway-elite', 'b-skyway-builder-and-developers', 'Akurdi', '₹76 L - ₹1.03 Cr', '₹76 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bb0d8689-c959-429c-9ab4-183d2095c8a6/gallery/mv0nnnmq-37o9ge.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bb0d8689-c959-429c-9ab4-183d2095c8a6/gallery/mv0nnnmq-37o9ge.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Skyway Elite in Punawale, Pune offers 2 and 3 BHK flats in one of West Pune’s fastest-growing residential areas. Punawale is known for good connectivity to Hinjewadi and the highway, and it costs less than Wakad, Hinjewadi or Balewadi. It suits first-time buyers and upgraders who want modern, well-planned homes with good everyday convenience. Buyers can ask the builder for current pricing, floor plans and possession details.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002601911"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹76 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Akurdi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002601911", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Akurdi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002601911', 10425, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-vtp-codename-never-before-east', 'VTP Codename Never Before East', 'vtp-codename-never-before-east', 'b-vtp-group', 'Manjari Khurd', '₹3.60 Cr - ₹4.82 Cr', '₹3.60 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3080c1b4-ff23-4ee0-8a58-455bad35d65d/gallery/mvhz2nod-wvqip.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3080c1b4-ff23-4ee0-8a58-455bad35d65d/gallery/mvhz2nod-wvqip.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'VTP Codename Never Before East is an upcoming VTP Luxe project of duplex ''villas in the sky'' in VTP''s Township Codename Pegasus, New Kharadi, East Pune, near the township''s West Gate and the Mula-Mutha riverside road. The tentative master plan shows two 34-storey towers (T1 and T2) with 17 lower and 17 upper villa levels. Homes come in four duplex types: Privé Villa and Privé Villa Max (3 BHK, about 1,835 and 2,044 sq ft carpet) and Aristo Villa and Aristo Villa Max (4 BHK with a servant room, about 2,453 and 2,531 sq ft). Every villa has a private lift, a double-height living room of about 21 ft, a puja area, marble flooring in the living and dining, a whirlpool bath in the master washroom and smart home controls. Each tower has a grand drop-off and a double-height entrance lobby, and every floor a double-height lift lobby. Amenities include a private clubhouse, swimming pool, steam and sauna, gym, putt-putt golf, box cricket, kids'' play area, a multipurpose court, open-air badminton and pickleball courts, an open-air event lawn and generous parking for large cars. Residents also get township facilities such as high-street shopping, a school, sports academies and landscaped zones. Indicative prices start at about ₹3.60 Cr. The project is in pre-launch: it is not yet registered with MahaRERA and no possession date has been announced.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹3.60 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Manjari Khurd, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Manjari Khurd Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 19618, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-18-aangan', '18 Aangan', '18-aangan', 'b-four-pillars', 'Maan', '₹1.89 Cr', '₹1.89 Cr', '["3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6bc773eb-7656-403b-99d7-978a3cfe26e6/gallery/mvu2ee0x-d824tw.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6bc773eb-7656-403b-99d7-978a3cfe26e6/gallery/mvu2ee0x-d824tw.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', '18 Aangan is a gated enclave of just 18 independent 3 BHK row houses by Four Pillars in Maan, off Maan Road near Hinjewadi Phase 1 and the Rajiv Gandhi Infotech Park, with Rising Spaces as strategic partner. Each row house has its own entrance, a private car porch, front and rear gardens (side gardens on the end units) and three levels: the living and dining room, kitchen, utility and a bedroom on the ground floor, two bedrooms and a balcony on the first floor, and open terraces on the terrace floor, under a glass-topped staircase that brings daylight into the home. Homes have about 1,110 to 1,263 sq ft of RERA carpet area including balconies (about 1,190 sq ft for the typical units 2 to 11), and about 2,070 to 2,470 sq ft of net sale area including the share of gardens, terrace and parking; prices start at ₹1.89 crore. The houses are Vastu-conscious, with no one living above or below, and each has its own solar panels and EV charging point. The enclave is laid out along 30-foot internal concrete roads behind a designer entrance gate, a 7-foot perimeter wall and 24/7 security, with a leisure swimming pool, an open pagoda, a lawn, a children''s play area, a senior citizens'' sit-out, indoor games, a temple, walkways, DG backup, in-ground road lighting and roadside planting. From Maan Road, Infosys Circle in Phase 1 and the IT companies of Hinjewadi Phases 1, 2 and 3 are a short drive away, and the Mahalunge-Hinjawadi IT Park bridge leads across the Mula river to Mahalunge, Balewadi and Baner. The project is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002501338 by the promoter Four Pillars.', '["Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area", "EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002501338"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.89 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Maan, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002501338", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Maan Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002501338', 17027, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-aarambh', 'Aarambh', 'aarambh', 'b-adi-realtors', 'Balewadi', '₹99 L', '₹99 L', '["2 BHK"]', 'Ready to Move', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/uWtUJyzOstqZeclQtHvZOYivrkFxSlpcBtUzkk5j.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/uWtUJyzOstqZeclQtHvZOYivrkFxSlpcBtUzkk5j.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/5oObZb7synV62rPVYqZAbCYsgqNubnGbhVrvmYj8.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/cu7T1exp3WjBAuIjjcAQclhBnDwVt0x1lCTQkwlS.webp"]', 'Adi Aarambh by Adi Realtors is a small boutique project in Balewadi, Pune: one tower with 12 residential units on about 0.14 acres, and around 7 storeys. The 2 BHKs are roughly 800 sq ft. The project is RERA registered (P52100079803), with possession scheduled for August 2026. That date has already passed, so check the current RERA status and the actual handover timeline before committing. Amenities look basic (water supply, power backup, covered parking), so the appeal is mainly the Balewadi location rather than lifestyle facilities', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Ready to Move"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100079803"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹99 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Balewadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100079803", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Balewadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100079803', 12375, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-skyone-walhekarwadi', 'Skyone', 'skyone-walhekarwadi', 'b-nawani-developers', 'Walhekarwadi', '₹85 L - ₹1 Cr', '₹85 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', 'December 2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bdc6357f-5214-4ad0-83d5-d0ed962f20b4/gallery/mvuq5ckd-f5ryas.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bdc6357f-5214-4ad0-83d5-d0ed962f20b4/gallery/mvuq5ckd-f5ryas.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Skyone is a boutique residential project by Nawani Developers on Ravet Road in Walhekarwadi, Chinchwad, near Rajyog Petrol Pump, on a plot of about a quarter of an acre. Its two buildings now launching, B and C, have just 36 homes on six floors above basement and ground-floor parking, and every flat gets a covered car park. B building has four 2 BHK homes on each floor, of 800 and 817 sq ft, at ₹85 lakh and ₹87 lakh all-inclusive; C building has two 3 BHK homes on each floor, of 957 sq ft, at ₹1 crore all-inclusive. Areas are the MahaRERA carpet area plus the open and dry balconies. Each 2 BHK has a living room of about 15''6" x 10''6" opening onto a 15''6" x 6''7" balcony, a kitchen with a utility area and a 13''6" master bedroom, and the compact 3 BHK has a 16''1" x 15''9" living and dining room and a 16'' x 5'' balcony. Amenities include a jogging track, a children''s play area, a meditation area, a landscaped garden and tree plantation, a designer entrance lobby, solar water, rainwater harvesting, a grey water treatment plant, a video door phone and power backup for the lift, pumps and common areas. Homes have an earthquake-resistant RCC frame with AAC block walls, 800 x 800 mm vitrified tiles, a granite kitchen platform, Jaguar or equivalent fittings and Polycab or RR cables. The developer places Chinchwad railway station, the Aundh-Ravet BRTS road, the Mumbai-Pune Expressway, schools, colleges, hospitals and D-Mart within 5 to 10 minutes. Skyone is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002601495, with possession in December 2027.', '["Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area", "Yoga Deck"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002601495"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹85 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "December 2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Walhekarwadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002601495", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Walhekarwadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002601495', 10625, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-pride-world-city-valencia', 'Pride World City Valencia', 'pride-world-city-valencia', 'b-pride-purple', 'Charoli', '₹92.49 L - ₹1.23 Cr', '₹92.49 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/05a6436f-a09f-4e07-b08c-56a0a8c5842b/gallery/mvv3sqqo-a3jvco.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/05a6436f-a09f-4e07-b08c-56a0a8c5842b/gallery/mvv3sqqo-a3jvco.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Pride World City Valencia is the newest cluster of Pride Group''s 400-acre Pride World City township at Charholi Budruk in north-east Pune, launched in October 2026. The 5.9-acre cluster is planned with five residential towers, a clubhouse with a swimming pool and a retail high street; its first MahaRERA registration, PM1260002602441, covers towers D and E, each with 28 habitable floors and eight homes a floor. It offers 2 BHK homes of 817 sq ft from ₹92.49 lakh and 3 BHK homes of 1,113 sq ft from ₹1.23 crore, all-inclusive with parking and government taxes; the sizes are usable carpet area, RERA carpet of 641 and 962 sq ft plus balconies. Every home faces east or west and comes with home automation, a Yale digital lock, a video door phone, a semi-modular kitchen with hob and chimney, and Jaquar or Grohe fittings. The master plan lists more than 40 amenities, including a swimming pool and kids'' pool, a clubhouse and party lawn, pickleball courts, a MUGA court, a jogging track, a yoga and open gym area, an amphitheatre and a biodiversity park. MahaRERA possession is 31 December 2031.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002602441"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹92.49 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Charoli, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002602441", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Charoli Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002602441', 11320, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-pride-world-city-miami', 'Pride World City Miami', 'pride-world-city-miami', 'b-pride-purple', 'Charoli', '₹91 L - ₹2.74 Cr', '₹91 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/04909256-14e7-4e23-86d1-a9759eb8e02c/gallery/mvv3sryq-g451jy.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/04909256-14e7-4e23-86d1-a9759eb8e02c/gallery/mvv3sryq-g451jy.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Pride World City Miami is a cluster of 2, 3 and 4.5 BHK homes in Pride Group''s 400-acre Pride World City township at Charholi Budruk in north-east Pune. On about 10 acres, it is planned as nine towers of 23 floors with about 1,200 homes, many facing the hills, and is registered with MahaRERA in two phases: P52100077670 for towers A6, A7 and B1, due in December 2028, and PR1260002502081 for the newer towers A4 and A5, due in April 2030. The A-series towers have 2 BHK homes of 785 to 795 sq ft from ₹91 lakh and 3 BHK homes of 1,059 to 1,161 sq ft from ₹1.20 crore; the B-series towers have larger 3 BHK homes of 1,472 to 1,488 sq ft from ₹1.76 crore and 4.5 BHK homes of 2,260 sq ft from ₹2.74 crore (usable carpet areas, developer''s July 2026 prices). Homes come with smart home automation, wooden flooring in the master bedroom, designer balconies with LED false ceilings, a Yale digital lock, a video door phone, Jaquar or Grohe and Toto or Kohler fittings, and piped gas. More than 40 amenities include a swimming pool with lap, family and kids'' pools and a jacuzzi, a futsal court, box cricket, pickleball, a MUGA court, a gym, a forest trail, a temple and a pet zone.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100077670"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹91 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Charoli, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100077670", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Charoli Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100077670', 11592, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-palladio-presidential-towers', 'Palladio Presidential Towers', 'palladio-presidential-towers', 'b-palladio-developers', 'Hadapsar', '₹1.35 Cr - ₹2.60 Cr', '₹1.35 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/765c8240-3fed-4d70-b271-5ecbd6547ee4/gallery/mvv5vy43-31pt59.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/765c8240-3fed-4d70-b271-5ecbd6547ee4/gallery/mvv5vy43-31pt59.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Palladio Presidential Towers is a new residential project by Vilas Javdekar Developers (VJ), in association with Tupe Developers, in Sector 2 of the Hadapsar Central community beside Leisure Town, east of Amanora Park Town and Magarpatta City in Hadapsar. Six towers, T1 to T6, are planned with up to 38 or 39 habitable floors and about 1,000 homes; Phase 1, registered with MahaRERA as PM1260002602526 with 490 homes, launches towers T1, T2, T5 and T6 up to the 20th and 21st floors. It offers 2 BHK homes of 828 to 963 sq ft, 3 BHK homes of 996 to 1,282 sq ft and 4 BHK homes of 1,532 to 1,542 sq ft (RERA carpet plus enclosed and open balconies), six to a floor with four passenger lifts and a fire lift. Launch price ranges are ₹1.35 to 1.45 crore for a 2 BHK, ₹1.60 to 2.20 crore for a 3 BHK and ₹2.60 to 2.75 crore for a 4 BHK. Amenities are spread over the ground, podium and terrace levels, with a 26,000 sq ft, three-level President''s Club holding a banquet hall, co-working lounges, a library, a mini theatre, a squash court, gyms, yoga studios and a spa, while the gardens add sports courts, a jogging track, a pet park, play areas and sky decks. Homes come with imported marble flooring in the living, dining, kitchen and attached balcony, wooden flooring in the bedrooms, full home automation with a smart door lock, Jaquar thermostatic showers, UPVC windows and glass balcony railings. A 2 BHK gets one car park, a 3 BHK two and a 4 BHK three. The RERA completion date for Phase 1 is December 2032.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002602526"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.35 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Hadapsar, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002602526", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Hadapsar Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002602526', 16304, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-tulip-infinity-evana-commercial', 'Tulip Infinity Evana Commercial', 'tulip-infinity-evana-commercial', 'b-tulip-realty', 'Punawale', '₹20.50 L - ₹4.08 Cr', '₹20.50 L', '["Shop", "Office"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/5709b783-9c9c-4c60-b4ed-4cef6de35826/gallery/mvwi01g5-1gw9fi.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/5709b783-9c9c-4c60-b4ed-4cef6de35826/gallery/mvwi01g5-1gw9fi.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Tulip Infinity Evana Commercial is the shops-and-offices part of Tulip Infinity Evana at Rasikwadi, Punawale, Pune, by Varma Corp (the new name of the Tulip Group) with S.M. Group. It fills the podium along the project''s main-road frontage, under the same MahaRERA registration, P52100078470, with a completion date of 30 October 2029, and sits about 200 metres from the Mumbai-Bengaluru highway service road near the Pawana river bridge at Ravet. The ground floor has 36 shops in an L-shape along two roads, each with a mezzanine above it and a 1-metre walkway in front. Shops on offer in October 2026 measure 369 to 1,652 sq ft of carpet area, counting the mezzanine. Floors one to four hold offices of 205 to 1,517 sq ft carpet with glazed fronts, a commercial lobby, three lifts and common washrooms on each floor, and most offices have their own toilet. The developer quotes about ₹35,000 per sq ft for shops and ₹10,000 to ₹14,000 per sq ft for offices, on carpet area and plus taxes, so a 369 sq ft shop starts at about ₹1.29 Cr and a 205 sq ft office at about ₹20.5 lakh before GST and stamp duty. The homes in the four towers above are listed separately as Tulip Infinity Evana.', '["Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100078470"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹20.50 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Shop, Office"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100078470", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100078470', 10000, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-vitthal-nirvana', 'Vitthal Nirvana', 'vitthal-nirvana', 'b-vissionary-developers', 'Nigdi', '₹1.40 Cr - ₹1.44 Cr', '₹1.40 Cr', '["3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/934ae67a-4206-4655-b43b-e446319056a8/gallery/mvuqeigv-choo9y.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/934ae67a-4206-4655-b43b-e446319056a8/gallery/mvuqeigv-choo9y.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Vitthal Nirvana is a residential project by Vissionary Developers on Plot 12, Sector 24, Nigdi Pradhikaran, near Geeta Pavbhaji and opposite Axis Bank, on a 24 m wide road. It is a seven-storey building with just 14 three-bedroom homes, two on each floor, above covered car parking on the ground floor. The two 3 BHK layouts have carpet areas of about 1,052 and 1,086 sq ft and cost ₹1.40 crore and ₹1.44 crore (agreement value), or about ₹1.57 crore and ₹1.62 crore with stamp duty, GST and registration. The rooftop has a gazebo, a senior citizens'' sitting area, a barbecue corner and a small stage and screening area. Homes get 4 x 2 ft vitrified flooring, three-track aluminium sliding windows with granite sills, Cera or Jaguar bathroom fittings, Legrand or L&T switches, a video door phone and glass railings on the balconies, and the building has an Otis lift with battery backup and rainwater harvesting.', '["Rainwater Harvesting", "Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.40 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Nigdi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Nigdi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 13299, 'Verified', 'Pune');
