Prime Education & IT Belt", "Direct Builder Sales Partnership"]', 'P52100052972', 12400, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-one-place', 'One Place', 'one-place', 'b-mittal-brothers-on-pan-card-club-road', 'Baner', '₹1.32 Cr - ₹1.70 Cr', '₹1.32 Cr', '["Office"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/0XOU0FPWX7DDG0G0jsLZKZMg3GaWP9p33quYv3LM.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/0XOU0FPWX7DDG0G0jsLZKZMg3GaWP9p33quYv3LM.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/elqlVrqhkL41pdaytkeF0xK9oc0oitS9ZctMJKZz.webp"]', 'One Place Baner (listed as New Unicon One Place) is a commercial development by Mittal Brothers on Pan Card Club Road, Baner, Pune. It offers 104 offices and 75 shops, so it suits small and mid-sized businesses more than large corporate occupiers. The surrounding area has restaurants, malls and medical centres, which covers day-to-day needs for staff and visitors. Baner itself is a well-established IT and business hub in Pune’s western corridor with good road connectivity, and a later phase of the project (Phase III) is also listed under RERA. Listing sites give different details, so confirm the current RERA status, possession, pricing and rent with the developer or a broker before deciding.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100019584"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.32 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Office"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Baner, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100019584", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Baner Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100019584', 33673, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-tej-one-fc-road', 'Tej One FC Road', 'tej-one-fc-road', 'b-tejraj-group', 'Deccan Gymkhana', '₹2.00 Cr - ₹3.50 Cr', '₹2.00 Cr', '["Commercial", "Office"]', 'Under Construction', 'Commercial', 'Ready to Move', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/039e0489-632a-4fe2-9173-0fb7f39f299c/gallery/mvwj9k0v-1pknb2.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/039e0489-632a-4fe2-9173-0fb7f39f299c/gallery/mvwj9k0v-1pknb2.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/QQmMk6MksfNeJOsNyWH7z6Sry9x5MXzEGBPiWPLv.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp"]', 'Tej One FC Road is an ultra-prestigious commercial boutique address positioned at Goodluck Chowk on Ferguson College (FC) Road, Deccan Gymkhana, Pune. Offering Grade-A corporate offices, premium retail frontages, and robotic automated parking.', '["Iconic Goodluck Chowk FC Road Address", "Robotic Automated Car Parking", "Grade-A Corporate Glass Facade", "High Rental Yield Prime Heritage Zone", "Zero Buyer Brokerage Mandate"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100035004"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹2.00 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Commercial, Office"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "Ready to Move"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Deccan Gymkhana, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100035004", "Goodluck Chowk FC Road Location", "Bespoke Corporate Commercial Asset"]', 'P52100035004', 31000, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-garve-the-cullinan', 'Garve the Cullinan', 'garve-the-cullinan', 'b-garve-group', 'Pimple Nilakh', '₹68 L - ₹2.39 Cr', '₹68 L', '["Office", "Shop"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/eb5f46da-c60b-4969-834b-26d3f953ba50/gallery/msw2inrx-2gkm3l.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/eb5f46da-c60b-4969-834b-26d3f953ba50/gallery/msw2inrx-2gkm3l.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Garve The Cullinan in Pimple Nilakh is a premium commercial landmark by Garve, offering world-class showrooms, high-street retail, and futuristic office spaces designed to blend luxury, functionality, and innovation. Strategically located in a thriving business hub, it ensures excellent visibility, seamless connectivity, and strong footfall, making it a prestigious address for entrepreneurs, corporate leaders, and investors seeking growth and long-term value.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Co-working Lounge", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Covered Parking", "Concierge", "EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100078994"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹68 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Office, Shop"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Pimple Nilakh, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100078994", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Pimple Nilakh Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100078994', 27868, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-asap-tishya', 'ASAP Tishya', 'asap-tishya', 'b-asap-spaces', 'Aundh', '₹3.30 Cr - ₹4.21 Cr', '₹3.30 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4.5 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6f179efc-b2df-49a3-b42b-b7335719d627/gallery/mvwhgwmc-fz80rc.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6f179efc-b2df-49a3-b42b-b7335719d627/gallery/mvwhgwmc-fz80rc.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'ASAP Tishya, branded "Tishya – The Beginning", is a boutique residential tower by ASAP Spaces on Ashiyana Park Lane No. 2 in Aundh, Pune, near Baner Road. It holds just 12 homes on six residential floors, two to a floor: six 3 BHK homes of 1,667 sq ft total carpet area (2,251 sq ft saleable) and six 4.5 BHK homes of 2,183 sq ft total carpet area (2,947 sq ft saleable), where the half is a servant room with its own toilet. On the current price sheet, agreement values start at ₹3.30 crore for a 3 BHK and ₹4.21 crore for a 4.5 BHK, with two car parks for a 3 BHK and three for a 4.5 BHK. Homes get Italian marble in the living, dining, kitchen and bathrooms, wooden flooring in the bedrooms, ROCA sanitaryware with GESSI fittings, Tostem aluminium windows, heat-pump hot water, a smart main-door lock with video calling and pre-wired CAT 6A and fibre conduits. The ground floor has a main lobby, a kids'' play area, a party lawn and a multipurpose lounge, and the project adds a BBQ and café zone, a gym, sky lounges and green zones on each residential floor, a car-wash bay, EV charging provision and solar power for common areas. The tower is designed by VDA Designs, and the brochure gives its MahaRERA registration as PR1260002500977.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area", "EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002500977"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹3.30 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4.5 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Aundh, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002500977", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Aundh Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002500977', 19796, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-excellaa-virtu', 'Excellaa Virtu', 'excellaa-virtu', 'b-excellaa-realty', 'Pimple Nilakh', '₹1.27 Cr - ₹1.37 Cr', '₹1.27 Cr', '["3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1f3df788-7035-4e21-8487-a66424ab8f1f/gallery/mvwl1o7c-1x2u56.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1f3df788-7035-4e21-8487-a66424ab8f1f/gallery/mvwl1o7c-1x2u56.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Excellaa Virtu is a nearly complete project of exclusive 3 BHK homes on Jagtap Dairy Road in Vishal Nagar, Pimple Nilakh, Pune, by Excellaa Realty as part of its Gold Collection. It is registered with MahaRERA as P52100054268, and both the RERA date and the developer''s commitment for possession are December 2026. The building has two wings joined at the centre in a butterfly plan, with eight homes on each floor, two lifts and two staircases. Homes come in two sizes: 1,005 sq ft (932 sq ft carpet plus a 74 sq ft balcony) and 1,091 sq ft (1,027 plus 64). Both layouts have two master suites with attached bathrooms, a walk-in wardrobe, a private patio off the living and dining room, an L-shaped kitchen and AC points in every bedroom. Agreement values are ₹1.27 Cr and ₹1.37 Cr, or about ₹1.42 Cr and ₹1.54 Cr with stamp duty, registration and GST. The roof holds 25 amenities, including a climatised pool with a kids'' pool and deck, a glass-walled gym, a bonfire sky lounge, a sky lawn, an amphitheatre, a fenced junior play area, indoor games, working pods and herbal and aromatic gardens.', '["Gymnasium", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100054268"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.27 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Pimple Nilakh, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100054268", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Pimple Nilakh Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100054268', 12600, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-excellaa-tott', 'Excellaa TOTT', 'excellaa-tott', 'b-excellaa-realty', 'Maan', '₹89 L - ₹1.21 Cr', '₹89 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3977a54a-a81a-4bb1-ba5d-bf1a6808e2ac/gallery/mvwmbtqx-aken1v.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3977a54a-a81a-4bb1-ba5d-bf1a6808e2ac/gallery/mvwmbtqx-aken1v.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Excellaa TOTT, launched under the name Codename TOTT ("Talk of the Town"), is a pre-launch residential project by Excellaa Realty on the 45-metre Hinjawadi–Maan Road in Maan, west of Hinjewadi Phase 1, Pune. Spread over more than 10 acres, the master layout shows seven buildings (A to G) around a large central open space with a clubhouse and swimming pool, more open spaces, and the Excellaa Highstreet shopping strip along the main road. It offers 2 BHK homes of 725 and 825 sq ft and 3 BHK homes of 1,000 and 1,100 sq ft (carpet area) in three layouts each, every one with a work-from-home nook, and the 3 BHK homes have three toilets. All-inclusive prices are ₹89 to 99 lakh for a 2 BHK and ₹1.21 to 1.37 crore for a 3 BHK, and the developer promises more than 50 lifestyle amenities. The developer''s distance chart puts Nexus Care Hospital 370 m away, MIS International School 1 km, Infosys Phase 1 2.5 km, the HCL and Wipro campuses 2.6 km, Hinjewadi Phase 2 2.9 km and Grand Highstreet Mall 3.4 km. Excellaa Realty reports a 34-year legacy, more than 22 projects and over 4,500 families. No MahaRERA registration number has been shared yet.', '["Clubhouse", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹89 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Maan, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Maan Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 12275, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-the-vantage-wakad', 'The Vantage', 'the-vantage-wakad', 'b-kuber-properties', 'Wakad', '₹1.07 Cr - ₹2.69 Cr', '₹1.07 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a92fc5ac-8421-4852-af64-88fdc835cc3c/gallery/mvv3umst-naexw.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a92fc5ac-8421-4852-af64-88fdc835cc3c/gallery/mvv3umst-naexw.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'The Vantage is a residential and commercial project by Kuber Properties in Wakad, behind Hotel Tip Top International near the Mumbai-Bengaluru highway, on an 18 m access road towards Bhumkar Wasti Road. The architect''s master plan shows four residential towers of two basements, a podium and 13 floors, and a commercial building with retail at the entrance. It offers 2 BHK homes of 857 sq ft from ₹1.08 crore and 3 BHK homes of 1,198 sq ft at ₹1.48 crore, plus duplex homes on the 12th and 13th floors: 3 BHK duplexes of 1,639 sq ft at ₹2.17 crore and 4 BHK duplexes of 2,050 sq ft at ₹2.69 crore. Prices are agreement values including infrastructure charges (about ₹1.21 crore to ₹3.01 crore with stamp duty, GST and registration), and areas are usable area, RERA carpet plus balcony. The terrace amenity floor has a children''s play area, an open gym and yoga deck, a senior citizens'' plaza, a lawn and a party lawn, gazebos, a sand pit, a BBQ area, a sit-out and a stargazing deck, and 10% of the site is kept as open space on the ground. The project is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002601066.', '["Gymnasium", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area", "Yoga Deck"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002601066"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.07 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002601066", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002601066', 12543, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-sukhwani-gemz', 'Sukhwani Gemzs', 'sukhwani-gemz', 'b-prime-properties', 'Maan', '₹1.03 Cr - ₹1.30 Cr', '₹1.03 Cr', '["2 BHK", "2.5 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a3cccdc6-45e5-43ed-9364-4fc12208ec47/gallery/mwbwzfz9-39rbi.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a3cccdc6-45e5-43ed-9364-4fc12208ec47/gallery/mwbwzfz9-39rbi.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Sukhwani Gemzs is a low-density residential project by Prime Properties, a Sukhwani Group company, on Thakar Nagar Road in Maan, near Hinjewadi. It is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002601952. The 4,250 sq m (about 1.05 acre) parcel holds the homes and a separate amenity parcel, with about 4,500 sq ft of open space for amenities, parking on three levels (basement, ground and podium) and no MHADA component. It offers Vaastu-compliant 2 BHK homes of 730 sq ft, 2.5 BHK homes of 860 sq ft with a flex room, and 3 BHK homes of 923 sq ft (RERA carpet plus balconies), at all-inclusive prices of ₹1.03 crore, ₹1.21 crore and ₹1.30 crore. The all-inclusive price covers GST, stamp duty, registration, the corpus fund, two years'' maintenance, legal and society charges and parking. Amenities include a clubhouse, a gym, a multipurpose court, a children''s play area, sitout zones, walking paths and landscaped open space. Homes get 600 x 1200 mm vitrified tiles, a digital main-door lock and video door phone, a separate dry balcony with a sink, a granite kitchen platform and inverter provision. The brochure puts MIS School 1.1 km away, Elpro International School 2.6 km, Ruby Hall Clinic Hinjawadi 3.7 km, Grand Highstreet 4.4 km and the Wipro, TCS and Infosys campuses 5.2 to 6.4 km away. Possession is planned for June 2030.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002601952"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.03 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 2.5 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Maan, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002601952", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Maan Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002601952', 14109, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-pristine-amore', 'Pristine Amore', 'pristine-amore', 'b-pristine-properties', 'Kalyani Nagar', '₹4.25 Cr - ₹10 Cr', '₹4.25 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4.5 BHK", "5 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9e955491-de5d-45c8-a1e5-b959ff896266/gallery/mwbxwt43-7q82bw.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9e955491-de5d-45c8-a1e5-b959ff896266/gallery/mwbxwt43-7q82bw.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Pristine Amore is a luxury residential project by Pristine Properties on Late Sopanrao Trimbakrao Mulik Road in Kalyani Nagar, opposite Cerebrum IT Park. It is registered with MahaRERA as PR1261012600653, with Pristine Landmark Spaces LLP as the promoter, and possession is planned for December 2030. Designed by UHA London, the 4.12-acre master layout shows about 300 homes in five wings: A and B with four homes a floor and C, D and E with two; the Wing B plan set marks Wings C and D as future development. The wings rise to 24 floors above three basements, ceilings are 3.35 m high and there is no MHADA component. Wing B offers 3 BHK homes of 1,659 and 1,681 sq ft, 4.5 BHK homes (four bedrooms and a servant room) of 1,975 and 2,003 sq ft, 3,247 sq ft 5 BHK homes on the refuge floors, and duplexes on the 22nd and 23rd floors: 4 BHK of 2,720 to 2,746 sq ft and 5 BHK of 3,472 to 3,485 sq ft. Sizes are RERA carpet plus balconies, and quoted prices start at ₹4.25 crore. Amenities sit on three levels: a rooftop infinity pool, spa, salon and screening room on the terrace; a podium lawn, gym, Pilates and dance studios, library and crèche on the third floor; and, on the second floor, an emergency room, consultation room, pharmacy and physiotherapy centre backed by 24x7 nursing and ambulance service. A high street of showrooms and shops sits at the base.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1261012600653"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹4.25 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4.5 BHK, 5 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kalyani Nagar, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1261012600653", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kalyani Nagar Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1261012600653', 25617, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-pristine-amore-highstreet', 'Pristine Amore Highstreet', 'pristine-amore-highstreet', 'b-uha-london', 'Kalyani Nagar', '₹4.75 Cr - ₹23.56 Cr', '₹4.75 Cr', '["Showroom", "Shop"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/fe3bba83-c3a1-4ebc-a7d3-38119f5f80bd/gallery/mwbxypu9-f14zae.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/fe3bba83-c3a1-4ebc-a7d3-38119f5f80bd/gallery/mwbxypu9-f14zae.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Pristine Amore Highstreet is the retail podium of Pristine Amore, a Pristine Properties project on Late Sopanrao Trimbakrao Mulik Road in Kalyani Nagar, opposite Cerebrum IT Park. It fronts the 18 m Cerebrum Road and an 18 m driveway, shares the homes'' MahaRERA registration (PR1261012600653) and has the same December 2030 possession date. The ground floor holds showrooms 1 to 24, each with a mezzanine; the current price list offers ten of them, from 1,315 to 4,005 sq ft (ground-floor carpet plus mezzanine), at ₹6.64 crore to ₹23.56 crore. Shops 28 to 51 sit on the level above the mezzanines (the price list calls it the first floor, the drawings the 2nd floor), and the list offers eleven sizes from 944 to 3,260 sq ft at ₹4.75 crore to ₹13.67 crore. The brochure pitches the spaces at restaurants, fashion, jewellery and automotive brands, and at larger stores or offices, with high-street visibility across several levels. Above the shops are about 300 homes in five wings designed by UHA London, with their own healthcare floor, podium lawn and rooftop amenities, so the high street has a resident catchment on site. The brochure''s location map also shows Cerebrum IT Park, DMart, Kopa Mall, Brahma Suncity, Cybage and the Kalyani Nagar and Ramwadi metro stations nearby.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Rainwater Harvesting"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1261012600653"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹4.75 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Showroom, Shop"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kalyani Nagar, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1261012600653", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kalyani Nagar Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1261012600653', 50317, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-que-101', 'QUE 101', 'que-101', 'b-unique-properties', 'Dhanori', '₹80.03 L - ₹2.77 Cr', '₹80.03 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK", "5 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/991a2afa-8abc-43d8-a7a9-e2374e67d2b8/gallery/mwbvbhe8-d8o2s4.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/991a2afa-8abc-43d8-a7a9-e2374e67d2b8/gallery/mwbvbhe8-d8o2s4.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'QUE 101 is a 12-acre residential community by Unique Properties on Bharat Mata Road in Dhanori, north-east Pune, about 6 km from Pune airport. Phase I is registered with MahaRERA as PM1261012602127 (promoter ANNR Unique Realty LLP). The master plan shows 12 towers, A to L, around a 40,000 sq ft central park, with 21,000 sq ft of semi-covered and indoor amenities and a retail street along the main road. Homes include 2 BHK flats of 828 to 838 sq ft and 3 BHK flats of 963 to 1,110 sq ft, second-floor homes with private terraces, duplexes of 3, 4 and 5 BHK from 1,370 to 2,049 sq ft on the ground and upper-ground floors, and 3 BHK row houses of 2,201 and 2,210 sq ft with front and back yards (all total areas). Agreement values on the November 2026 cost sheets start at ₹80.03 lakh for a 2 BHK, ₹91.94 lakh for a 3 BHK flat, ₹1.58 crore for a duplex and ₹2.76 crore for a row house. The amenity list runs to more than 65 items, including a clubhouse with an air-conditioned gym, swimming and kids'' pools, pickleball and half-basketball courts, a pet park, co-working and business lounges, podcast and creator studios, a mini theatre, a salon and spa, and an ice-bath recovery zone. Homes get 600 x 1200 mm vitrified tiles, biometric main-door locks, glass balcony railings, a video door phone and AC points in the living room and main bedroom. Possession is planned for December 2028.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1261012602127"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹80.03 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Dhanori, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1261012602127", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Dhanori Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1261012602127', 9665, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-amorapolis', 'Amorapolis', 'amorapolis', 'b-krisna-nirmaan-skyscraper-llp', 'Dhanori', '₹68.39 L - ₹99.19 L', '₹68.39 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/cd6d53c1-cdb6-454a-b6d2-2a4fc40a4a86/gallery/mwbydpc9-6l1q7t.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/cd6d53c1-cdb6-454a-b6d2-2a4fc40a4a86/gallery/mwbydpc9-6l1q7t.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Amorapolis is a Nirman Greens residential community at Survey No. 12, Dhanori, Pune 411015, built in phases by Krisna Nirmaan Skyscraper LLP. Its earlier wings are registered with MahaRERA, and the newest, Wing I, is now on sale. Wing I''s typical floor plan has six homes a floor: two 2 BHK homes of 698 sq ft and four 3 BHK homes of 1,012 sq ft, each the carpet area plus an open balcony. The launch cost sheet also lists a 2 BHK Grand of 825 sq ft, which is not on the typical floor plan. Agreement values are ₹68.39 lakh for the 698 sq ft 2 BHK, ₹80.85 lakh for the 825 sq ft 2 BHK and ₹99.19 lakh for the 3 BHK; with 7% stamp duty, 5% GST and ₹31,000 registration, the totals come to ₹76.91 lakh, ₹90.86 lakh and ₹1.11 crore. The 2 BHK has a 15''6" x 16'' living and dining room and a sit-out; the 3 BHK has a 16''6" x 16''6" living and dining room, a kitchen with a utility area, a sit-out and a balcony. The developer''s renders show a clubhouse with a swimming pool, a basketball court, a children''s play area, landscaped gardens with an open-air stage, and a gated entrance, and it lists a surveillance system and 24x7 security. It places the project about 5 to 7 km from Pune International Airport and 6 to 8 km from Kharadi IT Park. Ask for Wing I''s MahaRERA registration and possession date before booking.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Sports Court", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹68.39 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Dhanori, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Dhanori Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 9797, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-smruti-garden', 'Smruti Garden', 'smruti-garden', 'b-smruti-developers', 'Kiwale', '₹76 L - ₹1.10 Cr', '₹76 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/2b8f970d-6ab2-4a1b-99dd-e5ca6ba33dd0/gallery/ms4ksnxm-c0g7p.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/2b8f970d-6ab2-4a1b-99dd-e5ca6ba33dd0/gallery/ms4ksnxm-c0g7p.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Smruti Garden in Kiwale is a thoughtfully planned residential project spread across 1 acre, featuring a single well-designed tower offering spacious 2 & 3 BHK homes starting from just ₹76 lakhs (negotiable). Ideal for modern families, the project combines comfortable living with good connectivity to key areas of Pune, making it a promising option for both end-users and investors seeking value and convenience.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100081081"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹76 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kiwale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100081081", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kiwale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100081081', 9768, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-stalwart-business-enclave', 'Stalwart Business Enclave', 'stalwart-business-enclave', 'b-stalwart-developers', 'Baner', '₹2.03 Cr - ₹9.51 Cr', '₹2.03 Cr', '["Office", "Showroom"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/edbd80d8-4bc4-41bc-8999-809af0344a9d/gallery/mtzmqeli-5bffdg.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/edbd80d8-4bc4-41bc-8999-809af0344a9d/gallery/mtzmqeli-5bffdg.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Stalwart Business Enclave by Kiran Creators & Developers is a 12-storey commercial landmark on the Aundh–Baner Link Road in Baner, near Jupiter Hospital, with premium corporate offices and exclusive showrooms for corporates, IT and consulting firms, doctors, CAs, lawyers, architects and brands. Offices range from about 995 to 3,515 sq ft (and larger combined spaces up to about 7,000 sq ft), and the ground floor has a premium showroom of 1,718 sq ft with a 22-ft double height and mezzanine and strong road frontage. The building has a grand double-height entrance lobby, tall ceilings, breakout zones and three dedicated parking levels (B1, B2 and lower ground) with ample two-wheeler parking and smooth entry and exit. The address links directly to Aundh, Balewadi, Pashan, Hinjawadi and the Mumbai–Bengaluru Highway, minutes from Balewadi High Street and the Baner commercial belt, with an expected rental yield of 8–9%. All-inclusive prices start from ₹2.03 Cr for an office and ₹9.51 Cr for the showroom; the booking amount is 10% of the agreement value. Possession is planned for December 2028. MahaRERA PC1260002600587.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PC1260002600587"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹2.03 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Office, Showroom"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Baner, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PC1260002600587", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Baner Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PC1260002600587', 20391, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-tej-midtown', 'Tej Midtown', 'tej-midtown', 'b-tejraj-group', 'Shivajinagar', '₹2.55 Cr - ₹3.20 Cr', '₹2.55 Cr', '["3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', 'December 2026', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/51d9ac0e-fce4-4d62-92ed-4c317ba01752/gallery/mvwj57mu-3kuy7j.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/51d9ac0e-fce4-4d62-92ed-4c317ba01752/gallery/mvwj57mu-3kuy7j.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/QQmMk6MksfNeJOsNyWH7z6Sry9x5MXzEGBPiWPLv.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp"]', 'Tej Midtown on Ganeshkhind Road in Modibaug, Shivajinagar, is an elite luxury residential tower offering ultra-spacious 3 BHK residences. Designed with grand 11-foot clear ceilings, sound-insulated glass, and multi-tier smart home security.', '["Prime Modibaug Ganeshkhind Road Address", "11-Foot Clear Ceiling Heights", "Soundproof Acoustic Double-Glazed Windows", "Private Elevator Access", "100% Zero Brokerage Purchase"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100052300"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹2.55 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "December 2026"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Shivajinagar, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100052300", "Shivajinagar Premium Residential Belt", "Direct Builder Sales Mandate"]', 'P52100052300', 21500, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-38-daffodils', '38 Daffodils', '38-daffodils', 'b-38-developers', 'Baner', '₹39.75 L', '₹39.75 L', '["Studio"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', 'November 2028', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/060d4b73-861b-4946-a14a-f4cdbd228afb/gallery/mwc04zj6-7e49ma.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/060d4b73-861b-4946-a14a-f4cdbd228afb/gallery/mwc04zj6-7e49ma.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', '38 Daffodils is a building of pre-leased, fully furnished studio apartments by Bluepearl (Blue Pearl Realty) at Sr. No. 38, Pancard Club Road, Baner, opposite Ambrosia Galaxy and behind Costa Blanca Society. It is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002500765, with a proposed completion date of November 2028. The building has 84 studios on six floors, 14 to a floor, each of 200 sq ft (16.58 sq m of carpet and 1.96 sq m of service area), with a 12''5" x 14''8" room and a 7''3" x 5''3" toilet. Studios come with beds and mattresses, wardrobes, a smart TV and TV unit, study tables and chairs, an air conditioner, a geyser, lights and fans, and the brochure lists a lounge, an indoor games room, a cafeteria, a gym and a theatre room. Each studio is sold as an investment at ₹39.75 lakh, described as all-inclusive, and leased to the co-living operator Dweller Pro, which the brochure says is legally obliged to pay the rent directly to owners: ₹18,000 a month at the start, rising 15% after three years and 5% a year from the fourth, on a 10-year (5+5) lease with a five-year lock-in. The brochure puts ten years'' rent at ₹26.70 lakh and quotes an average return of 7.40%. By its drive times, SmartWorks and Amar Madhuban Tech Park are 1 to 2 minutes away, Balewadi High Street 5 minutes and Hinjewadi IT Park 10 minutes.', '["Gymnasium"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002500765"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹39.75 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Studio"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "November 2028"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Baner, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002500765", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Baner Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002500765', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-codename-vybe', 'Codename Vybe', 'codename-vybe', 'b-ranawat-group', 'Anand Nagar', 'Price on Request', 'Price on Request', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/fe3ecf58-88a1-48db-8f0a-9127bff57588/gallery/mwc0rswd-7idamn.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/fe3ecf58-88a1-48db-8f0a-9127bff57588/gallery/mwc0rswd-7idamn.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Codename Vybe, also called the Luxury Riverine Collection, is a pre-launch residential project at Anand Nagar on Sinhagad Road, marketed by Ranawat Group with Welworth Realty. It has no MahaRERA registration number yet, and the developer has not published prices, a possession date, the land area or the number of towers; until it is registered, it cannot legally be booked or sold. Plans released so far cover A Building, floors 1 to 11: five 3 BHK layouts of 1,121, 1,198, 1,215, 1,244 and 1,285 sq ft of carpet and a 1,746 sq ft 4 BHK, 53 homes in all. Each typical floor has five homes around one lift lobby with four lifts, one of them a fire lift; the 2nd and 7th are refuge floors, each with one 4 BHK. Every home has a dry balcony off the kitchen and a pooja space, each 3 BHK has three toilets, and up to three bedrooms get walk-in wardrobes. The presentation promises more than 20 amenities and names an infinity-edge pool, a main pool, a clubhouse, a fitness centre, a temple, net cricket, rooftop amenities and a jogging track. Specifications include vitrified flooring, a modular kitchen with a chimney and piped gas, aluminium sliding windows, a digital main-door lock, USB-C points in bedrooms and 2 kV DG backup per flat. Room sizes come from working drawings and may change.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "Price on Request"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Anand Nagar, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Anand Nagar Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-mangalam-momento', 'Mangalam Momento', 'mangalam-momento', 'b-mangalam-landmarks', 'Moshi', '₹69.50 L - ₹96.61 L', '₹69.50 L', '["2 BHK", "2.5 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ee3d3709-ccba-444e-b44c-94c656b58362/gallery/mwbyso1b-ag04mv.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ee3d3709-ccba-444e-b44c-94c656b58362/gallery/mwbyso1b-ag04mv.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Mangalam Momento is a two-tower residential project by Mangalam Landmarks on the Pune–Nashik Highway in Moshi, beside Moshi Fire Station and near Bharat Mata Chowk. It is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002601445, with Preetam Prakash Associates as the promoter, and possession is planned for December 2031. Wings A and B rise to the 29th floor, with ten homes a floor in Wing A and twelve in Wing B, and are built with aluminium formwork. Homes are 2 BHK of 748, 799 and 911 sq ft, 2.5 BHK of 931 sq ft and 3 BHK of 996, 1,016 and 1,041 sq ft, each the carpet area plus dry and open balconies. Prices start at ₹69.50 lakh for the 748 sq ft 2 BHK, about ₹9,300 per sq ft. Amenities are grouped into zones: a pool with a kids'' pool and deck, a pickleball court and a multipurpose half court, a party lawn with a stage and amphitheatre seating, a children''s play area, a senior citizens'' court, a temple and an oxygen park, a yoga and meditation lawn, an exercise yard and a multipurpose hall. Homes get 600 x 1200 mm tiles, wooden-finish flooring in the master bedroom, Jaquar fittings and a video door phone. The brochure puts Bliss Hospital and a Reliance mall 1 km away, Talawade IT Park and Bhosari MIDC 7 km and Pune airport 17 km.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002601445"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹69.50 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 2.5 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Moshi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002601445", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Moshi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002601445', 9291, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-godrej-skyline-commercial', 'Godrej Skyline Commercial', 'godrej-skyline-commercial', 'b-godrej', 'Mundhwa', '₹3.41 Cr - ₹7.57 Cr', '₹3.41 Cr', '["Shop"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/682acbe6-1523-4751-96d3-668325f5cf39/gallery/mwbzrrrt-b3tpsu.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/682acbe6-1523-4751-96d3-668325f5cf39/gallery/mwbzrrrt-b3tpsu.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Godrej Skyline Commercial is the high-street retail podium of Godrej Skyline, the Godrej Properties project on Ghorpadi–Mundhwa Road in Koregaon Park Annexe, Mundhwa, registered with MahaRERA as PM1260002400007. The shops sit at the base of the residential towers, along a 30 m DP road and an 18 m DP road, with more than 150 feet of retail frontage, an entrance lobby with marble flooring and a loading and unloading bay for goods. Ground-floor shops have a mezzanine within an 8.4 m (27.5 ft) floor-to-floor height; the first retail floor is 4.2 m high. The current inventory lists 13 shops: eight on the ground floor, of 750 to 1,203 sq ft of RERA carpet including the mezzanine, at agreement values of ₹4.24 crore to ₹6.80 crore, and five on the first retail floor, of 808 to 1,551 sq ft, at ₹3.41 crore to ₹7.57 crore. That works out to about ₹51,650 to ₹56,560 per sq ft on the ground floor and ₹42,200 to ₹49,400 on the first floor. Shops get vitrified flooring, toughened glass doors, a glass facade with allotted signage space, a centralised AC provision and a high-speed internet provision, with basement parking for cars and scooters and EV provision. Possession is planned for November 2029.', '["Covered Parking", "EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002400007"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹3.41 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Shop"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mundhwa, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002400007", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mundhwa Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002400007', 45477, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-luxton-by-saheel-commercial', 'Luxton by Saheel Commercial', 'luxton-by-saheel-commercial', 'b-luxton-developers', 'Wakad', '₹1.95 Cr - ₹4.78 Cr', '₹1.95 Cr', '["Shop", "Office", "Showroom"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bc16413d-ccb5-44a6-af16-228c1ca63cf9/gallery/mwc0gptg-11z3av.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bc16413d-ccb5-44a6-af16-228c1ca63cf9/gallery/mwc0gptg-11z3av.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Luxton by Saheel Commercial is the retail and office block of Luxton by Saheel, a mixed-use project by Saheel Properties at Survey No. 111/1/2, next to Indira School near Shani Mandir Road in Wakad. It is registered with MahaRERA as PM1260002502043, with Neev Sai Developers as the promoter. The ground floor has 15 double-height showrooms, each with a mezzanine: 758, 789 and 909 sq ft of carpet including the mezzanine, priced from ₹4.78 crore. The first floor has 15 shops of 452 to 522 sq ft, from ₹1.95 crore, and a typical office floor holds six offices of 628 to 1,225 sq ft, with prices on request. Most shops have a 12''3" frontage and a 37''6" depth. The brochure describes a transit-oriented development with double-height glass storefronts, seamless access, multi-level commercial architecture and a catchment of more than 1,500 families nearby, on a 100-ft main road close to schools, colleges and the IT parks. It pitches the spaces at cafés, restaurants, clinics, wellness, professional services and lifestyle brands. Possession is planned for June 2030.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002502043"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.95 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Shop, Office, Showroom"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002502043", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002502043', 43141, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-arkaa-galaxy', 'Arkaa Galaxy', 'arkaa-galaxy', 'b-agarwal-and-bhondve-buildcon', 'Ravet', '₹68.46 L - ₹1.17 Cr', '₹68.46 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/d84e8031-0038-46c2-8600-bde888988008/gallery/mwc1qjyd-3efmmg.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/d84e8031-0038-46c2-8600-bde888988008/gallery/mwc1qjyd-3efmmg.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Arkaa Galaxy is a residential project by Agarwal and Bhondve Buildcon LLP in Ravet, behind the PCMC water tank near Chandrabhaga Corner Lane. It is registered with MahaRERA as P52100045836, with completion proposed for April 2029. On a 3,000 sq m plot, two towers rise 14 storeys above a ground floor and two parking levels, with separate entry and exit gates, and are joined at the top by a connected rooftop of about 3,500 sq ft holding a lawn, a party and play area, an open theatre, a jogging area, an open fitness area and a lounge. The brochure counts 108 2 BHK homes in Wings A and B. The current cost sheet lists 2 BHK homes of 745, 754 and 781 sq ft at agreement values of ₹68.46 lakh, ₹69.19 lakh and ₹71.69 lakh, and a single 1,273 sq ft 3 BHK (B-702) at ₹1.17 crore. Every flat gets an inverter backup, and the building has DG backup for the lifts and common areas, CCTV, a video door phone, solar water heating, rainwater harvesting and an organic waste converter. Homes have vitrified tiles throughout, a granite kitchen platform, aluminium sliding windows with mosquito mesh, a folding door to the living-room balcony and AC provision in the living room and master bedroom.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100045836"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹68.46 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100045836", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100045836', 9189, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-the-crown-highstreet', 'The Crown Highstreet at Ace Ayodhya', 'the-crown-highstreet', 'b-the-skies-group', 'Thergaon', '₹1.17 Cr - ₹3.79 Cr', '₹1.17 Cr', '["Shop", "Showroom"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1a5ae56c-c292-41e3-bb5e-b67d61edcac1/gallery/mwc2713d-3srwqt.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1a5ae56c-c292-41e3-bb5e-b67d61edcac1/gallery/mwc2713d-3srwqt.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'The Crown Highstreet is the retail podium of Ace Ayodhya, the four-tower residential project by Jhamtani Group and Shree Venkateshwara Group on the 45-metre Aundh–Ravet BRTS road near Dange Chowk, Thergaon. It is registered with the homes under MahaRERA PR1261012600416, with Ace Venkateshwara Realty as the promoter. The high street has 22 shops on the ground floor and 22 on the first, of 355 to 1,147 sq ft of carpet, plus seven showrooms of 1,983 to 5,678 sq ft over both floors, facing a high-street plaza along a 12-metre road. Agreement values on the current cost sheets work out to ₹37,500 per sq ft on the ground floor and ₹33,000 on the first: from ₹1.33 crore for a 355 sq ft ground-floor shop and ₹1.17 crore for the same size upstairs, up to ₹4.30 crore for a 1,147 sq ft ground-floor shop. Showroom prices are on request. The renders show a colonnaded concourse beneath the towers, and the plans show lift lobbies and a commercial ramp to the basement. Possession is planned for December 2030.', '["Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1261012600416"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.17 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Shop, Showroom"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Thergaon, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1261012600416", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Thergaon Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1261012600416', 32969, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-serenopolis', 'Serenopolis', 'serenopolis', 'b-nirman-greens', 'Tathawade', '₹80.62 L - ₹97.75 L', '₹80.62 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/24ca7459-95bd-4594-85b9-4b2d720268ff/gallery/mwc1i5m1-1nxgpq.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/24ca7459-95bd-4594-85b9-4b2d720268ff/gallery/mwc1i5m1-1nxgpq.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Serenopolis is a single 14-storey tower of 121 homes by Nirman Greens in Nirman District, Tathawade, where it joins the developer''s Astropolis and Cosmopolis. It stands on Link Road in Ashok Nagar, next to Sharayu Toyota, with commercial spaces at its base, and is registered with MahaRERA as P52100080004, with completion proposed for April 2029. It offers 2 BHK homes of 757 and 779 sq ft from ₹80.62 lakh and 3 BHK homes of 921 sq ft from ₹97.75 lakh (base prices; about ₹90.61 lakh and ₹1.09 crore all inclusive). More than 35 amenities are spread over three levels: a jogging track and a reception lobby on the ground; a swimming pool, kids'' pool, gym, indoor games area and yoga deck on the podium; and a party lawn, stage, open-air cinema, kids'' and toddlers'' play areas, a star-gazing deck and senior citizens'' seating on the terrace. Homes get Italian-finish vitrified flooring, full-height bedroom windows, a modular kitchen with a chimney, a gas leak detector and sprinklers, AC in the master bedroom, AC points in every room and a digital main-door lock. By the brochure''s drive times, Pulse Hospital, JSPM College and the Mumbai–Bengaluru highway are 3 minutes away and a metro station and Phoenix Mall of the Millennium 10 minutes.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100080004"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹80.62 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100080004", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100080004', 10649, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-city-one-panache-commercial', 'City One Panache Commercial', 'city-one-panache-commercial', 'b-city-one', 'Ravet', '₹80.59 L - ₹22.48 Cr', '₹80.59 L', '["Shop", "Office"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6afd9e53-566c-495c-8534-7ef6714229a9/gallery/mwbwamia-8f90y4.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6afd9e53-566c-495c-8534-7ef6714229a9/gallery/mwbwamia-8f90y4.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'City One Panache Commercial is the shop and office podium of City One Panache 2.0, a 26-storey tower in Sector 29 of the Pradhikaran area of Ravet, Pimpri-Chinchwad, registered with MahaRERA as PM1260002600510. The ground floor has 28 shops, numbered 1 to 29 (there is no shop 2), wrapped around a commercial parking court, with road frontage on three sides; the developer''s price list groups them as main-road, EVM and garden facing. Shops 1 to 21 come with a mezzanine and shops 22 to 29 without one. Carpet areas run from 191 to 663 sq ft, and the price list of 27 September 2026 prices them from ₹80.59 lakh (191 sq ft, garden facing) to ₹5.02 crore (663 sq ft, main road). Two offices of 4,460 sq ft each face the main road at ₹22.48 crore apiece. The ground floor plan keeps the residential entrance, lobby and lifts separate from the shops, with ramps to a basement and a parking level. The developer puts EuroKids preschool 2 minutes away, Ojas Multispeciality Hospital in Ravet 3 minutes, the Sant Tukaram Maharaj bridge 4 minutes, PCCOE and Akurdi railway station 5 minutes, Oxycare Superspeciality Hospital 6 minutes, Orchids The International School 10 minutes, and Aditya Birla Hospital and Lokmanya Hospital Chinchwad about 15 minutes away. Possession is planned for December 2028.', '["Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002600510"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹80.59 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Shop, Office"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002600510", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002600510', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-ace-ayodhya', 'Ace Ayodhya', 'ace-ayodhya', 'b-over-40-curated-lifestyle-amenities', 'Thergaon', '₹39 L - ₹92 L', '₹39 L', '["1 BHK", "2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f0b24c37-657e-4713-a35f-c1b0d9e96998/gallery/mrpbpbt9-5sv0q6.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f0b24c37-657e-4713-a35f-c1b0d9e96998/gallery/mrpbpbt9-5sv0q6.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Ace Ayodhya by Jhamtani Group and Shree Venkateshwara Group is a grand 5-acre residential township located in Thergaon, Pune, right off the 45-meter Aundh-Ravet BRTS corridor and minutes from Dange Chowk.
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-kuber-antonia', 'Kuber Antonia', 'kuber-antonia', 'b-kuber-properties', 'Wakad', '₹84.56 L', '₹84.56 L', '["2 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/904e6ae3-ea42-409c-b46e-8c879b2294b7/gallery/mvv4kyb7-21nuz.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/904e6ae3-ea42-409c-b46e-8c879b2294b7/gallery/mvv4kyb7-21nuz.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Kuber Antonia is a residential project by Kuber Properties, with Bhandare Associates as joint-venture partner, behind Hotel Tip Top International and beside Yashwin Encore in Wakad, close to Bhumkar Chowk and the Mumbai-Bengaluru highway. It offers only 2 BHK homes of 730 sq ft (637 sq ft of RERA carpet plus 93 sq ft of balconies), five to a typical floor with two lifts. On the B building cost sheet, a 2 BHK costs ₹84.56 lakh as agreement value, including ₹5.25 lakh of infrastructure charges, or about ₹95 lakh with stamp duty, GST and registration. Each home has a 16''0" x 10''6" living and dining room with a balcony, an 8''0" x 10''4" kitchen with a dry balcony, a 14''0" x 10''6" master bedroom with its own bathroom and balcony, a 10''0" x 10''0" second bedroom and a second bathroom. At ground level there are a clubhouse with the Power Club co-working space, a swimming pool, a jacuzzi, a jogging track, a barbecue zone, a deck, a party lawn and pergolas, and the rooftop deck, more than 100 feet above the ground, adds a yoga and meditation area, an open gym, board games, gazebos, a party lawn, a children''s play area and a senior citizens'' sit-out. Homes come with 800 x 800 mm vitrified flooring, American Standard sanitaryware and Grohe fittings, split AC points in the living room and both bedrooms, a video door phone, solar hot water and 24x7 security with CCTV. The project is registered with MahaRERA as P52100035197, with possession planned for April 2027.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100035197"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹84.56 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100035197", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100035197', 11583, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-balaji-oriana-world', 'Balaji Oriana World', 'balaji-oriana-world', 'b-balaji-builders', 'Tathawade', '₹1.48 Cr', '₹1.48 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e0bddd57-1189-435c-9a61-82e7913baff8/gallery/mvhn571w-66kq18.jpg', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e0bddd57-1189-435c-9a61-82e7913baff8/gallery/mvhn571w-66kq18.jpg', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Oriana World is a residential project by Balaji Builders in Ashok Nagar, Tathawade, Pune 411033, near Bhumkar Chowk Road. The development is planned as five towers of basement, ground, podium and 25 floors on roughly 5 acres; the first MahaRERA phase, Buildings D and E, covers two towers and 315 homes on 1.53 acres. Apartments listed under that phase are 2 BHK of about 734 to 929 sq ft carpet and 3 BHK of about 1,070 sq ft carpet. Prices differ between sources, so the site shows price on request; contact the Pune Home team for the current rate card. Amenities include a swimming pool, clubhouse, gymnasium, kids'' play area, jogging track, multipurpose sports court, yoga lawn, landscaped garden, CCTV and power backup, with podium and basement parking. Listings place the Mumbai-Bengaluru Highway within about a kilometre, Vision One Mall about 2 km away and Chinchwad railway station roughly 7 to 8 km away. The project is registered with MahaRERA under P52100080096 with a proposed completion of 31 December 2028.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100080096"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.48 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100080096", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100080096', 20163, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-pride-world-city-montreal', 'Pride World City Montreal', 'pride-world-city-montreal', 'b-pride-purple', 'Charoli', '₹1.49 Cr - ₹2.08 Cr', '₹1.49 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/d9c0b86f-9488-44d4-ae7e-3a967766730a/gallery/mvv3sv7b-4lv9b6.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/d9c0b86f-9488-44d4-ae7e-3a967766730a/gallery/mvv3sv7b-4lv9b6.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Pride World City Montreal is a cluster of duplex homes in Pride Group''s 400-acre Pride World City township at Charholi Budruk in north-east Pune. On about 10 acres, it is planned as eight towers of 28 floors with about 900 homes, each a true two-floor duplex with a double-height living room and an internal staircase. It is registered with MahaRERA as P52100053279 for towers A to D, due in December 2027, and P52100077138 for towers E and H, due in December 2028. The duplexes on offer are 3 BHK of about 1,352 to 1,357 sq ft from about ₹1.49 crore and 4 BHK of about 1,919 to 1,949 sq ft from about ₹2.08 crore (indicative all-inclusive prices, September 2026); 2 BHK duplexes of about 1,010 sq ft were also offered. Homes have smart home automation and superior specifications, and the more than 40 amenities include a mini Olympic pool, a clubhouse with a lounge, multipurpose hall, gym and indoor games, aerobics and zumba, a yoga zone, a futsal court, a mini cricket ground, an amphitheatre, a jogging track and children''s play areas.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area", "Amphitheatre"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100053279"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.49 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Charoli, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100053279", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Charoli Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100053279', 11020, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-legacy-wakad-new-launch', 'Legacy Wakad New Launch', 'legacy-wakad-new-launch', 'b-legacy-lifespaces', 'Wakad', '₹90 L - ₹1.40 Cr', '₹90 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/8394e5dc-7d40-49e2-91d1-9e2213a3a9ed/gallery/mvcpkd09-iqw96.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/8394e5dc-7d40-49e2-91d1-9e2213a3a9ed/gallery/mvcpkd09-iqw96.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Legacy Lifespaces is launching a premium residential project in Wakad, Pune, offering modern homes with world-class amenities, contemporary design, and a comfortable lifestyle in a prime location.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹90 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 12000, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-55-twilight', '55 Twilight', '55-twilight', 'b-blue-pearl-group', 'Baner', '₹37.50 L', '₹37.50 L', '["Studio"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/84580f53-f3be-4a1b-94b5-c387737e5da0/gallery/mwc182b1-6xmrng.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/84580f53-f3be-4a1b-94b5-c387737e5da0/gallery/mwc182b1-6xmrng.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', '55 Twilight is a seven-storey building of 56 studio apartments by Blue Pearl at No. 55, Baner Annex Road, before Nyati Emerald and near Nanaware Chowk in Baner, with frontage on a 24-metre DP road. Each floor has eight studios of 200 sq ft, each with a 14''4" x 12''8" room, a 4''9" x 7''1" toilet, a kitchenette counter, a study corner and a balcony. The studios are sold unfurnished for self-use, at a launch price of ₹37.50 lakh. The developer and its partner Dweller Pro offer help with property management, renting and short-stay (Airbnb) operator tie-ups for owners who want to let their studio, and the brochure suggests rents of up to ₹35,000 a month, marked as indicative. It lists a gym, a cafeteria and an indoor games room, shown with stock images. The project is marketed as "MahaRERA compliant" but no registration number is printed, and no possession date has been published. By the brochure''s drive times, Nanaware Chowk and the Mumbai–Bengaluru highway are a minute away, Amar Madhuban Tech Park 2 minutes, Balewadi High Street 5 minutes, and Hinjewadi IT Park and Baner metro 10 minutes.', '["Gymnasium"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹37.50 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Studio"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Baner, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Baner Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-pride-world-city-wellington', 'Pride World City Wellington', 'pride-world-city-wellington', 'b-three-lifts', 'Charoli', '₹1.16 Cr - ₹1.26 Cr', '₹1.16 Cr', '["3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/681ee323-40a2-43c6-aa6b-b1b628b41ded/gallery/mvv3sx8p-fro66f.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/681ee323-40a2-43c6-aa6b-b1b628b41ded/gallery/mvv3sx8p-fro66f.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Pride World City Wellington is one of the largest clusters in Pride Group''s 400-acre Pride World City township at Charholi Budruk in north-east Pune: about 12 acres and 14 towers of three podium levels and 23 floors, with only six apartments a floor served by three lifts. The towers stand around an expansive 7-acre podium with the cluster''s amenities, among them a clubhouse with a swimming pool, children''s play areas, gazebos and a cricket ground. Wellington is built in phases; the developer lists MahaRERA registrations P52100031008, P52100045786, P52100048477, P52100052379 and P52100054534, and the latest phases, E-H-J-K and F-G, are due in December 2027. The current offer is 3 BHK homes in two sizes, 3 BHK L of about 1,056 sq ft from about ₹1.16 crore and 3 BHK XL of about 1,156 sq ft from about ₹1.26 crore (indicative all-inclusive prices, August 2026); earlier phases also had 2 BHK and 4 BHK homes. Homes have smart, spacious layouts and premium finishes.', '["Clubhouse", "Sports Court", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100052379"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.16 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Charoli, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100052379", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Charoli Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100052379', 10984, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-new-launch-highness-wakad', 'New Launch Highness Wakad', 'new-launch-highness-wakad', 'b-binary-infrastructures', 'Wakad', '₹1.21 Cr - ₹2.09 Cr', '₹1.21 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ccb891cd-2a8e-4ea7-be32-f82930b0bf1e/gallery/mryv0mv8-f5iven.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ccb891cd-2a8e-4ea7-be32-f82930b0bf1e/gallery/mryv0mv8-f5iven.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Highness is a premium new residential launch in Wakad by Binary Infrastructures, spread across 2.5 acres with two elegant towers offering spacious 3 & 4 BHK apartments. Designed for upscale urban living, the project features 50+ modern lifestyle amenities, quality specifications, and a well-planned gated community in one of Pune’s fastest-growing locations, Wakad.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002502183"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.21 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002502183", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002502183', 12448, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-excellaa-polaris', 'Excellaa Polaris', 'excellaa-polaris', 'b-excellaa-realty', 'Bavdhan', '₹2.59 Cr - ₹3.10 Cr', '₹2.59 Cr', '["4 BHK", "4.5 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6d2e5940-bda2-446e-8ec4-a961da61284a/gallery/mvwk6dct-8va6z1.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6d2e5940-bda2-446e-8ec4-a961da61284a/gallery/mvwk6dct-8va6z1.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Excellaa Polaris is a single-tower luxury project near Ambrosia Resort in Bavdhan Khurd, Bavdhan, Pune, close to Chandani Chowk, by Excellaa Realty as part of its Autograph Collection. It is registered with MahaRERA as P52100080233 and possession is planned for December 2030. The tower rises 27 residential floors above three podium levels on a 2-acre plot, with six homes on each floor. Homes are marketed as 4.25 and 4.75 BHK: the 4.25 BHK has four bedrooms and a maid''s zone in 1,781 to 1,800 sq ft of carpet including balconies, and the 4.75 BHK adds a staff quarter with its own toilet in 1,887 to 1,946 sq ft. Every home has two master suites with walk-in wardrobes, a living and dining room of up to 24 by 15 feet, a service deck off the kitchen, imported marble flooring and a 3.27 m slab-to-slab height. Prices start at ₹2.59 Cr for the 4.25 BHK and ₹3.10 Cr for the 4.75 BHK. Over 45 amenities across 50,000 sq ft include a rooftop climatised infinity pool at 321 ft, a ballroom, sky lounge, golf terrace, sports pavilion, health studio, business centre and cafe.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100080233"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹2.59 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "4 BHK, 4.5 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Bavdhan, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100080233", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Bavdhan Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100080233', 14542, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-krisala-riverside', 'Krisala Riverside', 'krisala-riverside', 'b-krisala', 'Wakad', '₹99 L - ₹1.90 Cr', '₹99 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', 'December 2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/87e7f1a3-7eec-46eb-8c85-2f6047e38451/gallery/mwc2r2a3-4mlk77.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/87e7f1a3-7eec-46eb-8c85-2f6047e38451/gallery/mwc2r2a3-4mlk77.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/QQmMk6MksfNeJOsNyWH7z6Sry9x5MXzEGBPiWPLv.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp"]', 'Krisala Riverside on the Wakad–Bhosari BRTS corridor in Wakad is an architectural masterpiece designed by Hafeez Contractor. Situated right beside 41 Presidency Tower and near Ganga Asmi, it features riverfront promenades, double-height club lounges, and high-spec homes.', '["Designed by Architect Hafeez Contractor", "On Wakad-Bhosari BRTS Corridor", "Double-Height Luxury Entrance Lobbies", "Rooftop Infinity Leisure Deck", "Zero Commission Direct Deal"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100052418"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹99 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "December 2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad BRTS Road, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100052418", "Hafeez Contractor Architecture", "Wakad Prime Arterial Road"]', 'P52100052418', 12800, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-santiago-moonrise', 'Santiago Moonrise', 'santiago-moonrise', 'b-santiago-realty', 'Chikhali', '₹55 L', '₹55 L', '["2 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a29ec45e-adb5-4102-8301-1359013fc422/gallery/mwbu7slc-a0l7qs.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a29ec45e-adb5-4102-8301-1359013fc422/gallery/mwbu7slc-a0l7qs.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Santiago Moonrise is a residential tower of 2 BHK homes by Santiago Realty at Gat No. 13 on Dehu–Alandi Road in central Chikhali, Pimpri-Chinchwad, registered with MahaRERA as P52100080764 (promoter Shree Datta Developers). The typical floor plan shows six homes a floor, flats 101 to 606, around a lift and a 1.5 m wide corridor. The homes are about 693 sq ft of carpet area and start at ₹55 lakh, and most layouts have two balconies, one off the living room and one off the main bedroom. Homes get 600 x 600 mm vitrified flooring, a quartz kitchen platform with a steel sink, Jaguar or Cera bathroom fittings, Legrand or equivalent switches, three-track aluminium windows with mosquito mesh, an AC point in the main bedroom and inverter backup in each flat. The amenities are on the roof: a lawn and party area, a children''s play area, a mandir, an open gym, meditation and senior citizens'' courts, gazebo and outdoor co-working seating, a barbecue counter and kite-flying and stargazing areas. The building adds CCTV, a video door phone, generator backup, fire fighting, rainwater harvesting and a bus and cab pick-up point. The brochure puts D-Mart, City Pride School, SNBP International School and the district court 5 to 10 minutes away, and Talawade MIDC, Bhosari MIDC and Spine City Mall 10 to 15 minutes away. Possession is due in April 2028.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Co-working Lounge", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100080764"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹55 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Chikhali, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100080764", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Chikhali Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100080764', 7936, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-yoo-one', 'YOO One', 'yoo-one', 'b-dasscon-realty', 'NIBM', '₹3.01 Cr - ₹3.69 Cr', '₹3.01 Cr', '["3.5 BHK", "4.5 BHK"]', 'Ready to Move', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7544fa37-d446-4c0f-b468-f46524919acb/gallery/mwevqe85-503eob.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7544fa37-d446-4c0f-b468-f46524919acb/gallery/mwevqe85-503eob.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'YOO One is a luxury residential project at NIBM, Pune, by Dasscon Realty, the luxury development arm of the construction company Tricon, with interiors by Sussanne Khan for YOO, the international design brand. The 6.75-acre development looks over about 200 acres of reserved forest. This listing covers Tower 2, Serenity: a 21-storey tower with four homes on each floor, registered with MahaRERA as PR1262022600430 (YOO One Phase II), with a RERA completion date of April 2030. Serenity has 3.5 BHK homes of 1,689 and 1,694 sq ft from ₹3.01 Cr and 4.5 BHK homes of 2,103 and 2,333 sq ft from ₹3.69 Cr, all inclusive; sizes are RERA carpet plus balcony. Every home has a servant''s room with its own toilet and a utility balcony, a living and dining room opening onto a private deck, floor-to-ceiling windows and a 3.375 m floor-to-floor height, and the forest-facing bedrooms look over the reserve. Buyers get space for a VRF/VRV air-conditioning system, a fingerprint digital lock and freedom to personalise their interiors, plus two car parks per home. The amenities include a 1.5-acre rooftop with a restaurant, sky bar, infinity-edge pool, spa, indoor and outdoor gyms and an amphitheatre; about an acre of podium amenities with pickleball and multipurpose courts, a mini golf course and a kids'' play area; and an 8,500 sq ft clubhouse. A show flat is ready to visit.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Ready to Move"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1262022600430"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹3.01 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3.5 BHK, 4.5 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "NIBM, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1262022600430", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "NIBM Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1262022600430', 17821, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-codename-district-studio', 'Codename District Studio', 'codename-district-studio', 'b-a-lift-and-a-fire-lift', 'Tathawade', '₹26.36 L - ₹40.06 L', '₹26.36 L', '["Studio"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3f30183c-dee9-474d-aa2e-283b5b964ca4/gallery/mwc1yu9z-32chh9.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3f30183c-dee9-474d-aa2e-283b5b964ca4/gallery/mwc1yu9z-32chh9.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Codename District Studio, sold as Smarto Tower, is a building of studio apartments in Pune. Each typical floor has nine studios along a 1.5 m passage, served by a lift and a fire lift, and the cost sheet lists nine studio types from 202 to 307 sq ft of carpet. Each studio has a room of about 10''6" wide and 14''7" to 18'' long, a toilet, a kitchenette counter and a small balcony. Agreement values run from ₹26.36 lakh for the 202 sq ft studio to ₹40.06 lakh for 307 sq ft. With 7% stamp duty, 1% GST and ₹31,000 registration, the totals are ₹28.78 lakh to ₹43.58 lakh; GST is charged at the 1% affordable-housing rate because each studio is small and priced under ₹45 lakh. The cost sheet we have was valid until 30 October 2026, so ask for the current one. The material does not give the site address, a MahaRERA registration number or a possession date; get all three before paying anything.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹26.36 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Studio"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 13050, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-k-pune-bavdhan', 'K Pune', 'k-pune-bavdhan', 'b-tayal-corp', 'Bavdhan', '₹1.30 Cr - ₹1.98 Cr', '₹1.30 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '31 July 2029', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6fea60cd-7889-4d14-94ee-e56af9f959a1/gallery/mweuxot5-2uipt2.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6fea60cd-7889-4d14-94ee-e56af9f959a1/gallery/mweuxot5-2uipt2.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'K Pune is a residential project by Tayal Corp under its K Better Homes brand at Sr. No. 45/1 and 45/2, Bavdhan, about 1.7 km from Chandni Chowk. Spread over 10 acres, it has seven towers of 21 storeys, a high street of 62 showrooms and landscape design by Landscape Tectonix of Bangkok. Phase II (buildings C, D and E) is registered with MahaRERA as P52100077301, with VMC Landmark Realty LLP as the promoter and a proposed completion date of 31 July 2029; Phase I is registered as P52100047630. The current cost sheet lists 3 BHK homes of 1,116 sq ft in buildings C and D and 1,251 and 1,361 sq ft in building E, and 4 BHK homes of 1,708 sq ft in building E, sizes that include the balconies. Agreement values start at ₹1.30 crore for a 1,116 sq ft 3 BHK and ₹1.975 crore for the 4 BHK, rising by ₹50,000 for each higher floor band. Amenities include a two-level cascading pool with a leisure pool, a clubhouse with a multipurpose hall and crèche, a multi-sport court, a kids'' play area, a step amphitheatre, terrace gardens, a co-working space, a reading space, a games zone and a sports and wellness area, with four levels of car parking. Homes get an Aluform structure, gypsum-finished walls, UPVC windows with mosquito mesh, solar-heated water and AC points in the living room and master bedroom.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100077301"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.30 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "31 July 2029"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Bavdhan, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100077301", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Bavdhan Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100077301', 11648, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-vtp-codename-never-before-west', 'VTP Codename Never Before West', 'vtp-codename-never-before-west', 'b-vtp-luxe', 'Mahalunge', '₹3.60 Cr - ₹4.82 Cr', '₹3.60 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/d19a8bbe-9e37-4dbf-a9fc-76590fd6a791/gallery/mvhz2yqd-eaboou.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/d19a8bbe-9e37-4dbf-a9fc-76590fd6a791/gallery/mvhz2yqd-eaboou.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'VTP Codename Never Before West is an upcoming VTP Luxe project of duplex ''villas in the sky'' in VTP''s Township Codename Blue Waters at Mahalunge (Baner Next), West Pune, on the Mula riverfront beside Earth 1 by VTP Luxe. The tentative master plan shows four 36-storey towers with 18 lower and 18 upper villa levels and a landscaped riverside promenade. Homes come in four duplex types: Privé Villa and Privé Villa Max (3 BHK, about 1,835 and 2,044 sq ft carpet) and Aristo Villa and Aristo Villa Max (4 BHK with a servant room, about 2,453 and 2,531 sq ft). Every villa has a private lift, a double-height living room of about 21 ft, a puja area, marble flooring in the living and dining, a whirlpool bath in the master washroom and smart home controls. Each tower has a grand drop-off and a double-height entrance lobby, and every floor a double-height lift lobby. Amenities include a private clubhouse, swimming pool, steam and sauna, gym, putt-putt golf, box cricket, kids'' play area, a multipurpose court, a tennis court, an open-air event lawn and generous parking for large cars. Residents also get township facilities such as high-street shopping, a school, sports academies and landscaped zones. Indicative prices start at about ₹3.60 Cr. The project is in pre-launch: it is not yet registered with MahaRERA and no possession date has been announced.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹3.60 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mahalunge, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mahalunge Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 19618, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-arvaana', 'Arvaana', 'arvaana', 'b-kundan', 'Balewadi', '₹3.46 Cr - ₹3.65 Cr', '₹3.46 Cr', '["4 BHK", "4.5 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/8f30251d-2a71-4822-b50e-d56af0eef85d/gallery/mwev2ocq-dgorvp.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/8f30251d-2a71-4822-b50e-d56af0eef85d/gallery/mwev2ocq-dgorvp.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Arvaana is a single residential tower in Balewadi, Pune, by Kundan Spaces, with only two homes on each floor. The tower rises three basements, a ground floor and 33 floors on a plot of about one acre, for 66 homes in all, and is open on the east and west sides. It is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002600277, and the developer gives possession as December 2030. There are two home types. The 4.5 BHK homes measure 2,235 to 2,269 sq ft of total carpet area and have four bedrooms, a double-height family room, a sit-out, a servant''s room with its own toilet, a dry balcony and a store. The 4 BHK homes, 2,147 and 2,160 sq ft, have the same four bedrooms with a double-height sit-out in place of the family room. Floors are 11 ft high, each typical floor is served by four lifts, power backup covers the whole building and every home gets three car parks. Agreement values start at ₹3.46 Cr for the 4 BHK and ₹3.60 Cr for the 4.5 BHK; with stamp duty, registration and GST the packages are about ₹3.87 Cr to ₹4.09 Cr. The amenity floor at the top holds a temperature-controlled covered pool with a kids'' pool, a mini theatre, a co-working room, an indoor games room and a green lounge, and the roof has a party deck and a viewing deck. The site is on a 30 m road, about two minutes from Balewadi High Street, with Baner, Aundh, Pimpri-Chinchwad and the Mumbai-Bengaluru highway close by.', '["Gymnasium", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002600277"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹3.46 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "4 BHK, 4.5 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Balewadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002600277", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Balewadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002600277', 16100, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-vtop-velesta', 'VTOP Velesta', 'vtop-velesta', 'b-vtop-spaces', 'Punawale', '₹81 L - ₹1.08 Cr', '₹81 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Ready to Move', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e5f322d4-5af4-4386-95f4-9858807fdc3d/gallery/mwevqikj-7c7wfj.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e5f322d4-5af4-4386-95f4-9858807fdc3d/gallery/mwevqikj-7c7wfj.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'VTOP Velesta is a new launch of 2 and 3 BHK homes in Punawale, Pune, by VTOP Spaces, on the 100 ft DP road that runs from Punawale towards Jambhe and Hinjawadi, about 600 m from the Mumbai-Bengaluru highway. It is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002601596, with a RERA completion date of December 2030. On a 3.11-acre site it has two 29-storey towers with only six homes on each floor and four lifts, built with aluminium formwork (Mivan). There are three home sizes: a 2 BHK of 710 sq ft, a larger 2 BHK of 790 sq ft and a Smart 3 BHK of 952 sq ft, each figure being carpet area plus balcony. Every home has a dedicated pooja space, which the developer calls "BHK P". Prices start at ₹81 lakh for the 710 sq ft home, ₹90 lakh for the 790 sq ft home and ₹1.08 Cr for the 3 BHK on floors 1 to 10, rising by ₹3 lakh for each higher band of floors. The amenities shown in the layout are ready to use: a clubhouse, swimming pool, amphitheatre, play area, multipurpose court, box cricket and a Ganesh temple, along with an indoor games room, co-working space, library, creche, gym and guest rooms. A sample flat is ready to visit.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Ready to Move"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002601596"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹81 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002601596", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002601596', 11408, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-18-magnitude', '18 Magnitude', '18-magnitude', 'b-gd-square-spaces', 'Punawale', '₹75.21 L - ₹1.23 Cr', '₹75.21 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e15cd083-ae07-4325-a450-25bf2e8a9fe5/gallery/mvgyqfx3-c7yqyo.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e15cd083-ae07-4325-a450-25bf2e8a9fe5/gallery/mvgyqfx3-c7yqyo.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', '18 Magnitude is a residential project by GD Square Spaces at Punawale (Kate Wasti), Pune 411033, next to 18 Latitude Mall. It is planned as four towers of ground plus two podium levels plus 14 floors on about 2.35 acres, with 486 apartments listed under MahaRERA. Homes are 2 BHK with carpet areas of 685 to 857 sq ft and 3 BHK of 1,130 to 1,135 sq ft. Asking prices on property portals in October 2026 start at ₹75.21 L for a 2 BHK and ₹1.23 Cr for a 3 BHK; confirm the current price sheet with the sales team. Amenities listed include a gymnasium, kids'' play area, amphitheatre, yoga zone, jogging track, multipurpose play court, multipurpose lawn, co-working spaces and two-level parking. Nearby, 18 Latitude Mall is about 180 m away, the Mumbai-Bengaluru highway about 1 km and Akurdi railway station about 5 km. The project is registered under MahaRERA number P52100052534, with possession due in December 2028.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100052534"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹75.21 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100052534", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100052534', 10979, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-108-rohit-astera', '108 Rohit Astera', '108-rohit-astera', 'b-rohit-infra', 'Punawale', '₹85 L - ₹1.60 Cr', '₹85 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/322d07a0-6385-4d77-8780-aeec2575abe7/gallery/msua2uw5-9cimze.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/322d07a0-6385-4d77-8780-aeec2575abe7/gallery/msua2uw5-9cimze.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Rohit Astera by Rohit Infra is a premium residential project in Punawale, Pune, featuring 2, 3, and 4 BHK luxury apartments across six 22-story towers on 4 acres. With over 25 amenities, including a clubhouse, landscaped gardens, and recreational spaces, it offers modern living at its finest. Strategically located, it ensures excellent connectivity to schools, hospitals, malls, and IT hubs, making it the perfect blend of comfort, style, and convenience.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100080292"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹85 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100080292", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100080292', 11184, 'Verified', 'Pune');
