on Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002600993", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002600993', 14849, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-chandrarang-the-embercrest', 'Chandrarang The Embercrest', 'chandrarang-the-embercrest', 'b-chandrarang-group', 'Wakad', '₹1.85 Cr - ₹2.80 Cr', '₹1.85 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ef1f4368-50f7-47d6-9f9c-54729ba24adf/gallery/mrrrj96u-2995as.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ef1f4368-50f7-47d6-9f9c-54729ba24adf/gallery/mrrrj96u-2995as.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Chandrarang Embercrest in Wakad is a landmark of luxury, offering exquisitely crafted 3 & 4 BHK signature residences designed for elite living. Sprawled across expansive open spaces with ultra-low density, the project features three magnificent towers and over 60 world-class amenities that redefine comfort and exclusivity. With its premium architecture, serene environment, and unmatched lifestyle offerings, Chandrarang Embercrest stands as a symbol of sophistication and modern elegance in the heart of Wakad.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002501760"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.85 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002501760", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002501760', 14487, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-tapovan-moshi', 'Tapovan', 'tapovan-moshi', 'b-life-spaces-realty', 'Moshi', '₹53.01 L - ₹68.95 L', '₹53.01 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '30 April 2029', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7961ad75-4a1a-477e-a5ef-29a8b2422b2c/gallery/mwevkifz-70hrok.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7961ad75-4a1a-477e-a5ef-29a8b2422b2c/gallery/mwevkifz-70hrok.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Tapovan is a residential tower by Life Spaces Realty at Gat No. 253 on the Moshi–Alandi Road, near Vedshree Tapovan in Moshi, registered with MahaRERA as PM1260002501333 with a proposed completion date of 30 April 2029. It is a mixed-use building: shops on the ground floor and offices on the second, with 2 BHK and 3 BHK homes from the 1st to the 14th floor and refuge floors at the 7th and 12th. The 2 BHK homes measure 722 to 739 sq ft and cost ₹53.01 lakh to ₹54.16 lakh, and the 3 BHK homes measure 896 to 924 sq ft and cost ₹66.44 lakh to ₹68.95 lakh, as agreement values. The rooftop has a children''s play area, a toddlers'' play area, an open gym, a yoga deck, a party area, a gazebo and senior citizens'' sit-outs, a sunset deck and an acupressure walkway. The tower has a road-facing elevation with toughened glass, and homes get an earthquake-resistant RCC frame with AAC block walls, vitrified tiles throughout, a black pearl granite kitchen counter with a stainless steel sink, sliding aluminium windows with mosquito nets, solar hot water in the master bathroom and an AC point in the master bedroom. By the brochure, MIT College and the Shri Gajanan Maharaj temple are 5 minutes away, Moshi bus stop 8 minutes, and Alandi and DMart 10 minutes.', '["Gymnasium", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area", "Yoga Deck"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002501333"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹53.01 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "30 April 2029"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Moshi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002501333", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Moshi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002501333', 7342, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-sai-kripa', 'Sai Kripa', 'sai-kripa', 'b-sai-nisarg-landmark', 'Ravet', '₹1.06 Cr - ₹1.09 Cr', '₹1.06 Cr', '["3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/609dca63-0f91-4e39-9c90-d3d97ab38d32/gallery/mvu255jt-g29cd4.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/609dca63-0f91-4e39-9c90-d3d97ab38d32/gallery/mvu255jt-g29cd4.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Sai Kripa by Krishna Rama Developer is a boutique residential building on Plot No. 415, Sector 29, Ganesh Nagar, Ravet, in the Pradhikaran area of Pimpri-Chinchwad, facing a 10.5 m road. Six residential floors hold just 36 homes, all 3 BHK and six to a floor: 1,053 sq ft homes (938 sq ft carpet plus 115 sq ft of balconies) and 1,085 sq ft homes (970 sq ft carpet plus 115 sq ft of balconies). Every home has three bedrooms, two of them with attached toilets, a living room opening onto a 12 ft balcony, a dining area and a kitchen with a dry balcony; the first-floor homes also open onto terraces. The rooftop is given over to amenities: a gym, a lawn, a yoga deck, a jogging track around the edge, a kids'' play area, an indoor games room and club house, and a multipurpose hall with a pantry and stage. Homes come with a 35 mm main door with a biometric lock, a video door bell, UPVC windows and balcony doors, 600 x 1200 mm vitrified tiles, Jaquar or Hindware fittings, geyser provision in every bathroom and AC provision in the living room and all bedrooms, and the building has high-speed lifts, an EV charging point and solar power generation. The eight shops on the ground floor are listed separately as Sai Kripa Commercial. D. Y. Patil Dnyanshanti School, PCCOE, DMart Ravet, Global Hospital, Akurdi railway station and the Pradhikaran gardens are about 5 minutes away, Chinchwad station about 12 and the old Mumbai-Pune highway and NH-48 about 10. Agreement values start from ₹1.06 crore for a 3 BHK (about ₹1.19 crore including GST, stamp duty and registration). Possession is planned for December 2030 (RERA completion date April 2031). MahaRERA PM1260002500965.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Jogging Track", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area", "Yoga Deck", "EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002500965"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.06 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002500965", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002500965', 10085, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-sai-mehar', 'Sai Mehar', 'sai-mehar', 'b-sai-nisarg-landmark', 'Punawale', '₹85 L', '₹85 L', '["2 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/53072ad6-018a-492a-886f-bd13cbab5610/gallery/mrujy6q6-5hjkck.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/53072ad6-018a-492a-886f-bd13cbab5610/gallery/mrujy6q6-5hjkck.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Sai Mehar Punawale is a thoughtfully planned residential project offering premium 2 BHK homes in a boutique single-tower development spread across 0.27 acres. Designed for comfortable urban living, the project combines modern amenities, excellent connectivity, and a peaceful neighborhood, with homes starting from ₹85 Lakhs.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002502253"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹85 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002502253", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002502253', 11740, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-estofa-one-home', 'Estofa One Home', 'estofa-one-home', 'b-estofa-realty', 'Hinjewadi', '₹58 L - ₹1 Cr', '₹58 L', '["1 BHK", "2 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/dbe6d4d7-22d8-411f-ac8e-0c297a741dec/gallery/mvj3dtph-e0p9h9.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/dbe6d4d7-22d8-411f-ac8e-0c297a741dec/gallery/mvj3dtph-e0p9h9.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Estofa One Home is a pre-launch residential project by Estofa Realty, a Goyal & Planedge initiative, near Kasturi Chowk in Hinjawadi, Pune. It is planned as a single tower of 24 floors above two basements and a stilt level, with a recreational floor and a G+1 clubhouse set in landscaped open space. The project is built around compact 1 BHK suites of 416 sq ft total carpet area (386 sq ft RERA carpet plus a 30 sq ft balcony), each with a living and dining room, kitchen, bedroom, two toilets and a balcony. A limited series of combined 2 BHK flats joins two suites into one 839 sq ft home with a walk-in wardrobe and a 20-foot balcony. Pre-launch prices start at ₹58 lakh for a 1 BHK suite (₹58–60 lakh), and the combined 2 BHK flats are priced at about ₹1–1.06 crore. The location suits IT professionals and investors looking for rental demand: Shivaji Chowk metro station is about 2 minutes away, Infosys, Wipro and IBM about 5 minutes, and D-Mart, Xion Mall and Grand Highstreet within 3–4 minutes. The project is not yet RERA registered; the registration number and possession date will be added once they are announced.', '["Clubhouse", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹58 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "1 BHK, 2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Hinjewadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Hinjewadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 13942, 'Verified', 'Pune');
