, "value": "₹1.89 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 11454, 'Verified', 'Pune');
