": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹64 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Shop"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Pimpri, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Pimpri Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune');
