RA ID", "value": "PR1260002602057"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.05 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002602057", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002602057', 13291, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-kings-grace', 'King''s Grace', 'kings-grace', 'b-krishna-rrealty', 'Rahatani', '₹1.15 Cr - ₹1.69 Cr', '₹1.15 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/92685a0d-2bbc-4399-bf68-87ff551065bc/gallery/mvfck3l0-9s42q5.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/92685a0d-2bbc-4399-bf68-87ff551065bc/gallery/mvfck3l0-9s42q5.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'King''s Grace by Krishna Rrealty is a new residential address in Rahatani, near Kokane Chowk on the Pimple Saudagar–Rahatani border in Pimpri-Chinchwad. It has two wings: B wing with 2 BHK homes of 781 and 809 sq ft, and A wing with 3 BHK homes of 1,095 to 1,148 sq ft (usable area, i.e. carpet plus balcony and terrace; RERA carpet 704–1,009 sq ft). Showrooms sit at ground level and parking is on two basement levels, with one covered car park for every home. The 3 BHK homes on the typical floors include a walk-in wardrobe, and the building has a gym and a kids'' play area. Sparsh Hospital, Synergy Heart Institute and SNBP International School are about 1 km away, Kokane Chowk and Shivar Chowk within 1.5 km, the Aundh–Ravet BRTS road about 2 km and Wakad about 4 km, with Hinjewadi Phase 1 about 7 km away. Agreement values start from ₹1.15 Cr for a 2 BHK (₹14,700 per sq ft of usable area) on a construction-linked payment plan with a ₹5 lakh booking amount. MahaRERA PR1260002602278; RERA completion date December 2029.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002602278"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.15 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Rahatani, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002602278", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Rahatani Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002602278', 14700, 'Verified', 'Pune');
