": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Rahatani, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100055677", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Rahatani Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100055677', 12396, 'Verified', 'Pune');
