67 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Office"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Nigdi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52000045602", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Nigdi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52000045602', 19420, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-the-arena', 'The Arena', 'the-arena', 'b-mahalaxmi-group', 'Pimpri', '₹1.20 Cr - ₹2.44 Cr', '₹1.20 Cr', '["2 BHK", "2.5 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b5e9e221-ff42-4c33-8998-e12cd4689935/gallery/mrp9pp2f-68is5w.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b5e9e221-ff42-4c33-8998-e12cd4689935/gallery/mrp9pp2f-68is5w.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'The Arena by Mahalaxmi Group is a residential project in Pimpri, at the heart of Pimpri-Chinchwad''s established urban belt. It offers a versatile mix of 2, 2.5, 3 and 4 BHK homes with carpet areas from 830 to 1,682 sq ft, suiting everyone from young families to those wanting expansive premium living. Residents benefit from Pimpri''s mature social infrastructure and excellent connectivity — the Pune Metro, PCMC civic amenities, schools, hospitals and retail hubs are all close at hand, with easy access to the Mumbai–Pune Expressway. Prices start from ₹1.15 Crore, with possession scheduled for December 2030. Enquire for floor plans, pricing and availability.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.20 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 2.5 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Pimpri, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Pimpri Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 14457, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-truespace-prima-altiora', 'Truespace Prima Altiora', 'truespace-prima-altiora', 'b-truespace', 'Wakad', '₹1.05 Cr - ₹1.50 Cr', '₹1.05 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/91e54192-3706-40ab-9bdd-76ae599d129d/gallery/muckf6xb-53r7zr.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/91e54192-3706-40ab-9bdd-76ae599d129d/gallery/muckf6xb-53r7zr.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Truespace Prima Altiora is a residential project by Truespace, part of Atharva Enterprises, a Pune-based developer with over 15 years of experience and 500+ families housed. The project is positioned in Wakad, one of Pune''s fast-growing residential and IT-adjacent corridors, offering strong connectivity to Hinjewadi IT Park, Baner, and the Mumbai-Pune Expressway. Like other Truespace "Prima" developments, it is expected to feature well-planned 2BHK/3BHK configurations with modern amenities such as lifts, fire safety systems, security, and rainwater harvesting, designed for urban comfort and convenience.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002602057"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.05 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002602057", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002602057', 13291, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-nexus-skydale', 'Nexus Skydale', 'nexus-skydale', 'b-nexus-group', 'Punawale', '₹73.91 L - ₹1.40 Cr', '₹73.91 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3f5cde23-0711-4d66-bf8a-15b8ed16d1d3/gallery/mvgypv2r-3xk6hd.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3f5cde23-0711-4d66-bf8a-15b8ed16d1d3/gallery/mvgypv2r-3xk6hd.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Nexus Skydale is a residential project by Nexus Group at Pandhare Wasti Road, Kate Wasti, Punawale, Pune, planned on about 4 acres with high-rise towers of up to 21 floors and roughly 650 homes. It offers 2, 3 and 4 BHK apartments; the developer lists carpet areas of about 677 to 691 sq ft for 2 BHK, 933 to 944 sq ft for 3 BHK and 1,332 sq ft for the 4 BHK, and some listings show larger variants. Asking prices on property portals in October 2026 start at ₹73.91 L for a 2 BHK, ₹99 L for a 3 BHK and ₹1.33 Cr for a 4 BHK; confirm the current price sheet with the sales team. Amenities include a swimming pool, gymnasium, clubhouse, landscaped garden, kids'' play area, jogging track, yoga lawn and 24x7 security with CCTV. NH48 is about 900 m away, Mukai Chowk BRT station about 4.1 km, Akurdi railway station about 4.5 km and Vision One Mall in Wakad about 3.5 km. The project is registered with MahaRERA under P52100055009, with possession targeted for December 2027.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100055009"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹73.91 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100055009", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100055009', 10917, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-skylish-vaastuu', 'Skylish Vaastuu', 'skylish-vaastuu', 'b-skylish-bluediamond-innfrracon', 'Pimpri', 'Price on Request', 'Price on Request', '["2 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f26fa0df-240e-434d-a8d3-5b906c62f914/gallery/mvgynds1-z2owo.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f26fa0df-240e-434d-a8d3-5b906c62f914/gallery/mvgynds1-z2owo.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Skylish Vaastuu is a 2 BHK residential project by Skylish Bluediamond Innfrracon in Pimpri, Pimpri-Chinchwad, Pune, registered with MahaRERA under P52100079170. It stands on Survey No. 144P, CTS No. 6015 (6020) P, Pimpri Waghere (PIN 411018), on a plot of about 2,257 sq m (0.56 acre) and is planned as 64 homes. The 2 BHK layouts have a RERA carpet area of roughly 559 to 656 sq ft. Listed amenities include a gymnasium, jogging track, children''s play area, landscaped garden, rainwater harvesting, CCTV surveillance, 24x7 security and power backup. Listed prices differ from source to source, so the price is on request; contact the Pune Home sales team for the current rate and available units. According to Square Yards, the Vastu Udyog bus stop is about 100 m away, Chavan Hospital about 180 m, the Old Pune-Mumbai Highway about 1.5 km and Bhosari Business Center about 2.2 km, while NoBroker places Pimpri Metro Station about 1 km away. The MahaRERA registration is dated 12 February 2025 and the proposed completion date is 31 May 2027, so the project is under construction.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100079170"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "Price on Request"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Pimpri, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100079170", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Pimpri Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100079170', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune');
