ice", "value": "₹66 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mamurdi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002600597", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mamurdi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002600597', 9256, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-mahakal-shivratna', 'Mahakal Shivratna', 'mahakal-shivratna', 'b-road', 'Ravet', 'Price on Request', 'Price on Request', '["2 BHK"]', 'Ready to Move', 'Residential', '30 June 2025', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/971a27a7-2ca1-49aa-ba47-7c19565a97c9/cover/mvgys14z-1gy57z.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/971a27a7-2ca1-49aa-ba47-7c19565a97c9/cover/mvgys14z-1gy57z.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Mahakal Shivratna is a small residential building in Ravet, Pune, on a plot at Sr. No. 215, Plot No. 6, off the BRT Road, pincode 412101. It is listed under Mahakal Builders & Developers and is registered with MahaRERA as P52100055201, with a proposed completion date of 30 June 2025. Most property portals describe it as ready to move. The project sits on about 0.32 acres (roughly 1,303 sq m) and is reported to have 20 apartments, all in 2 BHK layouts with carpet areas of about 645 to 744 sq ft. Listed features include 24x7 security, CCTV cameras, power backup, a children''s play area and a Vastu-compliant design. Ravet is the first township after the Mumbai-Pune Expressway and lies close to Punawale, Tathawade, Nigdi and Pimpri Chinchwad, with Hinjewadi reachable by road. Portals quote different prices for the same flats, so the price is shown on request. Check the RERA number on the MahaRERA website and confirm current availability with the sales team before you decide.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Ready to Move"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100055201"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "Price on Request"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "30 June 2025"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100055201", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100055201', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune');
