ue": "₹1.10 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Balewadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100026421", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Balewadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100026421', 13142, 'Verified', 'Pune');
