00004039"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹5.68 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "Feb 2016"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Balewadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100004039", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Balewadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100004039', 28216, 'Verified', 'Pune');
