 {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002601641"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹95 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kiwale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002601641", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kiwale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002601641', 12450, 'Verified', 'Pune');
