 Price", "value": "₹87 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100052385", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100052385', 11054, 'Verified', 'Pune');
