, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kiwale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kiwale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 9871, 'Verified', 'Pune');
