bel": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100033654"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹79 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "Feb 2026"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100033654", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100033654', 11033, 'Verified', 'Pune');
