rations", "value": "2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Baner, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100024756", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Baner Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100024756', 11837, 'Verified', 'Pune');
