4 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Office, Shop"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100079597", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100079597', 18338, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-maheshwaram-vrinda', 'Maheshwaram Vrinda', 'maheshwaram-vrinda', 'b-the-developer', 'Ravet', '₹86.83 L - ₹1.23 Cr', '₹86.83 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7c15740e-3e56-49b7-86ad-3f50e9c2761e/gallery/mvfc1lsm-5ci80s.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7c15740e-3e56-49b7-86ad-3f50e9c2761e/gallery/mvfc1lsm-5ci80s.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Maheshwaram Vrinda by Maheshwaram Associates (Maheshwaram Realty Group) is a mixed residential and commercial project near the ISKCON Temple in Pradhikaran, Ravet, Pune 412101, on about 1.7 acres at Sr. No. 189/2. The MahaRERA filing lists 143 units, including shops, and the developer''s plans show two wings, A and B. Homes are 2 BHK with carpet areas of 756 and 772 sq ft and 3 BHK with 978 and 1,079 sq ft. Asking prices on property portals in October 2026 start at ₹86.83 L for a 2 BHK and ₹1.12 Cr for a 3 BHK; confirm the current price sheet with the sales team. Amenities shown by the developer include an indoor gym, kids'' play area, basketball court with gazebo, yoga and meditation deck, mini golf, rock climbing wall, party lawn, co-work space and indoor games. Listings place PCCOE and Venkatesh Hospital about 0.7 to 0.8 km away, D-Mart about 1.4 km, Basant Plaza about 1.9 km and the Pune-Mumbai highway about 3.8 km. The project is registered with MahaRERA as P52100078935, with proposed completion on 31 December 2030.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100078935"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹86.83 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100078935", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100078935', 11485, 'Verified', 'Pune');
