, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1261012502656", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1261012502656', 12332, 'Verified', 'Pune');
