", "value": "Ready to Move"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PC1261012500615"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹52 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Office, Shop"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PC1261012500615", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PC1261012500615', 21940, 'Verified', 'Pune');
