rect Starting Price", "value": "₹78 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100079038", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100079038', 11206, 'Verified', 'Pune');
