052727"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.14 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Balewadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100052727", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Balewadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100052727', 13118, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-73-park', '73 PARK', '73-park', 'b-73-developers', 'Kiwale', '₹54 L - ₹76 L', '₹54 L', '["1 BHK", "2 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/d24fbac3-1f80-4607-a825-09126356f890/gallery/mv0tn4pa-2z51de.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/d24fbac3-1f80-4607-a825-09126356f890/gallery/mv0tn4pa-2z51de.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', '73 PARK is a 1 and 2 BHK residential project in Kiwale, Pune, listed as “Siddhhidata 73 Park” on 99acres. Its price is shown only as “on request,” and I couldn’t find the RERA number, carpet areas, possession date or construction status. Kiwale itself is well connected, near the Mumbai-Pune Expressway, about 12 km from Talawade IT Park and 29 km from the airport. Similar 1 and 2 BHK projects there start around ₹41 to 48 lakh. Ask the sales team for the RERA number and the all-in price, and verify the RERA number on MahaRERA.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002601181"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹54 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "1 BHK, 2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kiwale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002601181", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kiwale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002601181', 11111, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-kohinoor-anantara', 'Kohinoor Avantara', 'kohinoor-anantara', 'b-kohinoor', 'Wakad', '₹89.90 L - ₹1.20 Cr', '₹89.90 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c1ebbb5a-44d9-40d9-94ba-39a17afb7802/gallery/mvfc3lk5-cadxtj.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c1ebbb5a-44d9-40d9-94ba-39a17afb7802/gallery/mvfc3lk5-cadxtj.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Kohinoor Avantara, also searched as Kohinoor Anantara, is a residential project by Kohinoor Group in Downtown Wakad, Pune, near Shani Mandir Road and Dattwadi. It spreads across 8.66 acres with eight towers rising above a podium, and the developer lists more than 80 amenities across eight themed zones. The homes are 2 BHK of about 704 to 803 sq ft and 3 BHK of about 956 to 1,087 sq ft carpet area. Listings quote all-inclusive prices from about Rs 89.9 lakh for the smallest 2 BHK to about Rs 1.38 crore for the largest 3 BHK, so please confirm current rates with the sales team. Highlights include a swimming pool and kids'' pool, gymnasium, clubhouse, squash and futsal courts, a cricket pitch, a forest lawn walkway and co-working spaces. The developer lists Vision One Mall about 2 minutes away, metro access about 3 minutes, Hinjewadi IT Park about 10 minutes and Phoenix Mall of the Millennium about 5 minutes. The project is registered with MahaRERA under number PR1260002501984, with possession due in March 2032.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002501984"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹89.90 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002501984", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002501984', 12769, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-7-cosmos', '7 Cosmos', '7-cosmos', 'b-cosmos-urban-realty', 'Pimple Nilakh', '₹1.66 Cr', '₹1.66 Cr', '["3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/2084d602-4687-43b2-ace1-2af77bde7e3d/gallery/mv6hzkmf-74n8dr.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/2084d602-4687-43b2-ace1-2af77bde7e3d/gallery/mv6hzkmf-74n8dr.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', '7 Cosmos is a small, under-construction 3 BHK project by Cosmos Urban Realty LLP in Ingawale Nagar, Pimple Nilakh, near Visoka Aurum Petals and Brahmavrind Housing Society. It has just 12 units, with possession due in December 2028, and its RERA number is P52100055958, which you can verify on the MahaRERA site. The premium may reflect the small, low-density project. One portal marks the 3 BHK as sold out, but that page looks outdated, so confirm current availability with the builder. Before committing, get the exact carpet area, floor and all-in cost (GST, stamp duty, parking), check the construction progress in MahaRERA’s quarterly updates, verify title and approvals, and confirm which banks have approved the project for loans.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100055958"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.66 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Pimple Nilakh, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100055958", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Pimple Nilakh Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100055958', 14561, 'Verified', 'Pune');
