bel": "Micro-Market", "value": "Baner, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100051475", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Baner Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100051475', 18691, 'Verified', 'Pune');
