rting Price", "value": "₹38 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 1 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100080431", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100080431', 8315, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-eh-towers-commercial', 'EH Towers Commercial', 'eh-towers-commercial', 'b-eh-developers', 'Tathawade', '₹25.02 L - ₹10.89 Cr', '₹25.02 L', '["Shop", "Office"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/2f5ab14e-ab29-40f3-941d-8b954612d18f/gallery/mwc3conf-7rrdfv.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/2f5ab14e-ab29-40f3-941d-8b954612d18f/gallery/mwc3conf-7rrdfv.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'EH Towers Commercial is the shops-and-offices wing of EH Towers, the mixed-use project by Engineers Horizon on the Mumbai–Pune bypass (NH-48) in Jeevan Nagar, Tathawade. It is registered with MahaRERA as P52100079038, with EH Reality LLP as the promoter. Above three basement parking levels, the ground floor has seven double-height shops, six of them with a mezzanine, facing the highway; the first floor has ten shops and the second twenty. Offices fill the 3rd to 8th floors, 25 to a typical floor, from 119 to 677 sq ft, some with attached washrooms. A restaurant unit of 3,127 sq ft with a formed terrace sits on the 7th floor, and a second restaurant unit opens onto terrace seating on the 8th. The current cost sheet prices offices at ₹14,000 per sq ft of saleable area and shops at ₹18,000 on the second floor, ₹25,000 on the first and ₹35,000 on the ground, with saleable area 1.5 times the carpet. Agreement values start at ₹25.0 lakh for a 119 sq ft office and ₹28.8 lakh for a 107 sq ft second-floor shop. The brochure lists lifts and escalators, a separate service entry, sprinklers and fire alarms, CCTV in common areas, generator backup, a common washroom on each floor, rainwater harvesting and an STP. Possession is planned for December 2027.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Power Backup", "Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100079038"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹25.02 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Shop, Office"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100079038", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100079038', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune');
