 "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100078503", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100078503', 11281, 'Verified', 'Pune');
