 "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹64 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100054752", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100054752', 9696, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-aster-park-residences', 'Aster Park Residences', 'aster-park-residences', 'b-wakadkar-associate', 'Jambe', '₹41 L - ₹56 L', '₹41 L', '["1 BHK", "2 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/98204206-d13b-4b07-906b-eb11aaba666a/gallery/muxw567j-do2fjo.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/98204206-d13b-4b07-906b-eb11aaba666a/gallery/muxw567j-do2fjo.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Aster Park (listed as Wakadkar Aster Park) is a residential project by Wakadkar Associates in Jambe, Mulshi, Pune, offering 1 BHK and 2 BHK flats. It''s a small, 0.8-acre, G+8 high-rise development with 10+ lifestyle amenities such as a gym, indoor games, yoga and meditation decks, and a children''s play area. Its MahaRERA number is P52100028092, covering 81 units, and it sits close to Punawale Multispeciality Hospital and Vision One Mall. Many listings still show a December 2024 possession date, but the RERA record shows a proposed completion of 31 December 2028, so confirm the timeline and pricing with the builder and on the MahaRERA site before booking.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100028092"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹41 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "1 BHK, 2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Jambe, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100028092", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Jambe Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100028092', 8506, 'Verified', 'Pune');
