HK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Aundh, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100030465", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Aundh Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100030465', 16854, 'Verified', 'Pune');
