e", "value": "₹56 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002502244", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002502244', 9982, 'Verified', 'Pune');
