ng Price", "value": "₹1.24 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Thergaon, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100053285", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Thergaon Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100053285', 10535, 'Verified', 'Pune');
