 team. The developer has a solid track record in Pune, with multiple delivered and under-construction projects across areas like Kothrud, Sinhagad Road, Mundhwa, and Ambegaon, and Bavdhan itself is a well-established residential micro-market with strong connectivity.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1261012601412"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.07 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Bavdhan, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1261012601412", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Bavdhan Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1261012601412', 13665, 'Verified', 'Pune');
