ing Price", "value": "₹1.24 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 2.5 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Chinchwad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100056031", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Chinchwad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100056031', 14171, 'Verified', 'Pune');
