el": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.60 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Balewadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002502483", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Balewadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002502483', 15594, 'Verified', 'Pune');
