": "Configurations", "value": "Studio"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002502428", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002502428', 13122, 'Verified', 'Pune');
