bel": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹54 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "1 BHK, 2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kiwale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002500470", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kiwale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002500470', 11320, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-ajwani-prissa-pratham', 'Ajwani Prissa Pratham', 'ajwani-prissa-pratham', 'b-ajwani-developers', 'Wakad', '₹1.12 Cr - ₹1.70 Cr', '₹1.12 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9caa7b33-d668-4189-b6bf-cf105a9ae1ed/gallery/mvf42mhg-2mrw30.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9caa7b33-d668-4189-b6bf-cf105a9ae1ed/gallery/mvf42mhg-2mrw30.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Ajwani Prissa Pratham is a residential project by Ajwani Developers, part of the Ajwani Group, in Wakad, Pune, near Akshara Lane and Santosh Nagar. It is planned on about 3 acres as three towers of up to 27 storeys, with roughly 71 percent open space, three-side open homes and five lifts per tower. The homes are 2 BHK of 812 to 864 sq ft carpet area and 3 BHK of 1,111 to 1,177 sq ft carpet area. Asking prices on property portals in October 2026 start at ₹1.12 Cr for a 2 BHK and ₹1.42 Cr for a 3 BHK; confirm the current price sheet with the sales team. Podium and ground-level amenities include an infinity pool, party lawn, treehouse, pickleball court, pergola seating, stargazing corner and terrace play area, with four levels of car parking. The Mumbai-Bangalore Highway is about 800 metres away, Euro School about 700 metres, Decathlon 1.6 km and Phoenix Mall of the Millennium 2.3 km. The project is registered with MahaRERA under number PM1261012501933; confirm the possession date with the sales team and on the MahaRERA portal before booking.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1261012501933"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.12 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1261012501933", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1261012501933', 13793, 'Verified', 'Pune');
