Rainwater Harvesting", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Covered Parking", "EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100078743"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.10 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Office"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100078743", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100078743', 30219, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-kohinoor-wakad-downtown', 'Kohinoor Downtown', 'kohinoor-wakad-downtown', 'b-kohinoor', 'Wakad', '₹1.18 Cr - ₹1.65 Cr', '₹1.18 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4179c154-ccad-4f97-8c34-322d3cb2f974/gallery/mvfbfbvh-9n7u0x.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4179c154-ccad-4f97-8c34-322d3cb2f974/gallery/mvfbfbvh-9n7u0x.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Kohinoor Downtown is a residential project by Kohinoor Group in Wakad, Pune, near Shani Mandir Road and Dattwadi. The developer''s own website presents it as Kohinoor Regalia Towers in Downtown Wakad. It has two towers on a plot of about 3.5 acres as listed by the developer, with a B+G+4 podium+21 floor structure and homes from the 8th floor. The homes are 2 BHK of about 740 to 798 sq ft carpet area and 3 BHK of about 1,076 sq ft carpet area. Listings show starting prices of about Rs 1.18 crore for 2 BHK and Rs 1.65 crore for 3 BHK, so please confirm current rates with the sales team. Amenities include a covered infinity-edge swimming pool, gymnasium, spa, jacuzzi, mini theatre, co-working spaces, kids'' zones and a jogging track. The Mumbai-Bangalore Highway is about 450 metres away, Bhumkar Chowk about 1 km, Hinjewadi Phase 1 IT Park about 3 to 4 km and Phoenix Mall of the Millennium about 2 km. The project is registered with MahaRERA under number PR1260002500271, with possession due in June 2030.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002500271"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.18 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002500271", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002500271', 15945, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-kohinoor-satori', 'Kohinoor Satori', 'kohinoor-satori', 'b-kohinoor', 'Mahalunge', '₹1.40 Cr - ₹2.99 Cr', '₹1.40 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK", "4.5 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4171187c-4154-4224-bb36-819a03add6a9/gallery/mtsfd6jj-45jf27.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4171187c-4154-4224-bb36-819a03add6a9/gallery/mtsfd6jj-45jf27.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Kohinoor Satori is a premium twin-tower residential project by Kohinoor Group, located in New Baner, Mahalunge, Pune. Offering spacious 3, 4, and 4.5 BHK apartments, the project blends luxury, serenity, and modern amenities to create a refined living experience. With excellent connectivity to Hinjewadi IT Park, Pune-Mumbai Expressway, and key urban conveniences, Kohinoor Satori promises a well-connected, elegant lifestyle in one of Pune’s most sought-after neighborhoods.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100066472"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.40 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK, 4.5 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mahalunge, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100066472", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mahalunge Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100066472', 12488, 'Verified', 'Pune');
