e": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Thergaon, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100077052", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Thergaon Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100077052', 11675, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-aurelia', 'Aurelia', 'aurelia', 'b-shitole-properties', 'Rahatani', '₹1.25 Cr', '₹1.25 Cr', '["3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/8f242be2-cc75-49c7-b614-a46cdf840e6a/gallery/mvfbfp93-aec27h.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/8f242be2-cc75-49c7-b614-a46cdf840e6a/gallery/mvfbfp93-aec27h.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Aurelia by Shitole Properties is a residential apartment building in Rahatani, Pimpri-Chinchwad, Pune 411017, on a plot of about 925.64 sq m (roughly 0.22 acre) at S. No. 32/2B, CTS No. 1742 (part). The project is a single tower with 15 apartments, presented by the developer as 3 BHK homes; listed carpet areas run from about 795 to 849 sq ft, with a saleable area near 1,009 sq ft. Asking prices on property portals in October 2026 start at ₹1.25 Cr for a 3 BHK; confirm the current price sheet with the sales team. Amenities include an open-air gym, a children''s play area, a terrace garden, secure covered parking, CCTV with 24x7 security, rainwater harvesting and a solar PV system for common areas. Listings place a school and a hospital about 400 m away, Kalewadi Main Road about 500 m, and PCMC metro station about 4 km. The project is registered with MahaRERA as P52100077244 on 31 July 2024, with proposed completion on 31 December 2026.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100077244"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.25 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Rahatani, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100077244", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Rahatani Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100077244', 12388, 'Verified', 'Pune');
