": "₹99 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Pimple Nilakh, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100025516", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Pimple Nilakh Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100025516', 12724, 'Verified', 'Pune');
