 "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹77 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "June 2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kiwale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100077942", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kiwale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100077942', 10039, 'Verified', 'Pune');
