₹73 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Shop, Showroom"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1261012501027", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1261012501027', 29795, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-jhamtani-ace-abode', 'Jhamtani Ace Abode', 'jhamtani-ace-abode', 'b-jhamtani-group', 'Kiwale', '₹57 L - ₹94 L', '₹57 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/954d77d4-ee97-472d-83ae-3e6b7abc2676/gallery/ms8y6dam-3q0psa.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/954d77d4-ee97-472d-83ae-3e6b7abc2676/gallery/ms8y6dam-3q0psa.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Jhamtani Ace Abode in Upper Ravet spans across a vast land area of 13,950 sq.m with a saleable area of 6,50,000 sq.ft, housing 600+ thoughtfully designed units across 7 wings of 13 stories each. Offering a blend of 2 and 3 BHK configurations, the project features elegant colonial-style architecture and boasts 40+ premium amenities, including a Sky Garden and Sky Lounge on the top terrace of two buildings.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P521000341771"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹57 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kiwale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P521000341771", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kiwale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P521000341771', 8272, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-akshara-mayfair', 'Akshara Mayfair', 'akshara-mayfair', 'b-garve-developers-is-a-2', 'Tathawade', '₹91 L - ₹1.41 Cr', '₹91 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhtlfdp-amhhyv.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhtlfdp-amhhyv.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Akshara Mayfair by Garve Developers is a 2.25-acre residential development in the heart of Tathawade, behind G.G. International School and Hotel Raaga Imperio at Newale Wasti, close to the Aundh–Ravet BRTS Road and the Mumbai–Bengaluru Highway. Two towers, A and B, rise B1 + B2 + ground + 21 storeys with just eight homes per floor and about 350 residences in all – a boutique, mostly-3 BHK community – served by four passenger lifts and a dedicated fire/service lift in each tower. Homes are spacious 2 BHK of 773 sq ft, 3 BHK Classic of 942 sq ft and 3 BHK Premium of 1,200 sq ft carpet area; the 3 BHK Premium has walk-in wardrobes and a separate dining area. More than 40 lifestyle amenities are spread across about an acre in three zones: a Courtyard Retreat with a semi-covered canopy pool, kids'' pool, community lawn, party deck, multiplay court, yoga pavilion and garden pavilions; a Leisure Retreat with a grand entrance lobby, multipurpose hall, indoor gym and business/conference room; and a rooftop Skyline Retreat with an open-air cinema, pickleball court, sky work pods, wellness deck, green gym, barbeque area, hammock and swing garden and a sunrise and star-gazing deck. The building adds smart water metering, solar integration and an IoT backbone. G.G. International School is within walking distance, with daily essentials, Wakad and Hinjewadi a short drive away. All-inclusive prices start from ₹91 Lakh for a 2 BHK, ₹1.12 Cr for a 3 BHK Classic and ₹1.41 Cr for a 3 BHK Premium. Possession is planned for December 2029; MahaRERA registration is awaited.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹91 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'MahaRERA Registered', 11772, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-sky-sanctum', 'Sky Sanctum', 'sky-sanctum', 'b-talreja-group', 'Wakad', '₹99 L - ₹2.20 Cr', '₹99 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/10c3740f-6e27-4f29-8a05-d413d82016fd/gallery/mvghp3d6-fejg8r.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/10c3740f-6e27-4f29-8a05-d413d82016fd/gallery/mvghp3d6-fejg8r.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Sky Sanctum is a two-tower high-rise residential project at Bhujbal Chowk, Wakad, Pune 411057, near The Address Commercia. It is presented by Talreja Group together with Ailsinghani Group, and the MahaRERA registration is held under Mohar Lifespaces LLP. The towers rise to about 32 storeys and offer 2, 3 and 4 BHK homes. The floor plans released so far show 2 BHK homes with carpet areas of about 735 to 841 sq ft and 3 BHK homes of about 1,017 to 1,033 sq ft, excluding balconies, while listings quote a 4 BHK of around 1,636 sq ft including balconies. Asking prices on property portals in October 2026 start at ₹99 L for a 2 BHK, ₹1.45 Cr for a 3 BHK and ₹2.2 Cr for a 4 BHK; confirm the current price sheet with the sales team. Amenities include a swimming pool with infinity edge, indoor and open gyms, a badminton court, a sky lounge, a co-working space, a home theatre, a play zone and a jogging track. The developer lists Phoenix Mall of the Millennium, Xion Mall and Euro School about five minutes away, and Infosys Phase 1 and Balewadi High Street about ten minutes away. The project is registered under MahaRERA number P52100079426 with possession set for December 2028.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100079426"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹99 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100079426", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100079426', 13469, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-shree-raman-legacy', 'Shree Raman Legacy', 'shree-raman-legacy', 'b-shree-samarth-developers', 'Tathawade', '₹98 L - ₹1.90 Cr', '₹98 L', '["3 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', 'December 2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e2c03437-2fdf-4d51-8f6a-1f999e5b0898/gallery/ms4gar5v-dvjab2.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e2c03437-2fdf-4d51-8f6a-1f999e5b0898/gallery/ms4gar5v-dvjab2.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Shree Raman Legacy in Tathawade is a boutique residential project by Shree Samarth Developers, offering 6 exclusive 3 BHK apartments across 0.5 acres. Launched in December 2024 with possession by December 2027, the project features modern amenities and a prime location near key schools, hospitals, and transit hubs, ideal for a peaceful urban lifestyle.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100078522"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹98 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "December 2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100078522", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100078522', 10315, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-sentosa-harico-divaam', 'Sentosa Harico Divaam', 'sentosa-harico-divaam', 'b-sentosa-developer', 'Kiwale', '₹70.90 L - ₹1.04 Cr', '₹70.90 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/fdfe6b42-b23c-49e2-af72-c67e82aa3cd6/gallery/mryz8bwa-fst5ju.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/fdfe6b42-b23c-49e2-af72-c67e82aa3cd6/gallery/mryz8bwa-fst5ju.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Sentosa Harico Divaam is a premium new-launch residential project in Kiwale, Pune, spread across a vast 6-acre land parcel and featuring 5 iconic towers of 24 floors each. The project offers thoughtfully designed luxurious 2 & 3 BHK apartments, blending contemporary architecture with spacious layouts and elegant finishes. With 40+ world-class amenities, Codename Divine is crafted to deliver an elevated lifestyle, combining comfort, convenience, and modern urban living in one of Pune’s fast-growing', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002502389"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹70.90 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kiwale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002502389", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kiwale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002502389', 9792, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-tulip-infinity-evana', 'Tulip Infinity Evana', 'tulip-infinity-evana', 'b-tulip-realty', 'Punawale', '₹1.35 Cr - ₹2.03 Cr', '₹1.35 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/94e84ecd-6ac0-4293-b200-d9fd3d97d668/gallery/mvwi0031-16qxmt.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/94e84ecd-6ac0-4293-b200-d9fd3d97d668/gallery/mvwi0031-16qxmt.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Tulip Infinity Evana is a high-rise residential project at Rasikwadi, Punawale, Pune, by Varma Corp (the new name of the Tulip Group) with S.M. Group as joint-venture partner. It is registered with MahaRERA as P52100078470 under the name Infinity Evana, with a revised completion date of 30 October 2029. The 6-acre site has four towers of 41 floors above a ground and four-level podium, and about 2 acres of open space. The towers face the Pawana river, and the site is about 200 metres from the Mumbai-Bengaluru highway service road near the Pawana river bridge at Ravet. Wings C and D have 2 BHK homes of 799 and 845 sq ft and 3 BHK homes of 1,054 and 1,126 sq ft. Wing A has 3 BHK homes of 1,150, 1,210 and 1,269 sq ft and a 1,482 sq ft 4 BHK. Wing B is a 4 BHK-only tower with two homes of 1,477 and 1,481 sq ft on each floor and three lifts. The developer''s 2026 price sheet starts at ₹1.35 Cr for the 1,054 sq ft 3 BHK and ₹2.03 Cr for the 4 BHK. Amenities include a covered pool and an infinity-edge pool, gym, squash court, mini theatre, spa, co-working space, pickleball court, multipurpose turf and a pet park. The shops and offices in the road-facing podium are listed separately as Tulip Infinity Evana Commercial.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100078470"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.35 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100078470", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100078470', 16896, 'Verified', 'Pune');
