label": "Configurations", "value": "Shop"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Akurdi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100080358", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Akurdi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100080358', 15933, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-sentosa-edge', 'Sentosa Edge', 'sentosa-edge', 'b-sentosa-developer', 'Punawale', '₹85.77 L - ₹1.28 Cr', '₹85.77 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/850377d9-38b6-4267-88da-eed7d19f924c/gallery/mvf42z4p-bwtdn0.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/850377d9-38b6-4267-88da-eed7d19f924c/gallery/mvf42z4p-bwtdn0.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Sentosa Edge is an under-construction residential project by Sentosa Developers on Pandhare Wasti Road in Punawale, Pimpri-Chinchwad, Pune 411033, registered under MahaRERA as PM1260002501839. It offers 2 BHK homes of 741 and 826 sq ft carpet area and 3 BHK homes of 942, 1,048 and 1,114 sq ft carpet area in towers planned as basement, podium, ground and 23 floors. Listed prices run from about Rs 85.77 lakh for a 2 BHK to about Rs 1.28 crore for the largest 3 BHK, all-inclusive, and should be confirmed with the sales team. Amenities include a swimming pool with a kids'' pool, indoor and outdoor gym, multipurpose sports court, jogging track, yoga room, library, co-working lounge, clubhouse, banquet hall and landscaped gardens. The Mumbai-Pune highway is about 1 to 2 km away, Latitude Mall and Punawale hospitals are about 1 km away, Adhira International School is under 1 km away and Wakad Chowk metro is about 4 km away. RERA possession is June 2030, and construction was reported about 5 percent complete in February 2026.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002501839"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹85.77 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002501839", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002501839', 11574, 'Verified', 'Pune');
