Highway is about 2 km away, Zudio about 2.3 km, D-Mart about 4.5 km and Hinjewadi IT Park roughly 7 minutes by road. The project is registered with MahaRERA under number PR1260002501412, with possession due in December 2029.', '["Gymnasium", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002501412"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹87.99 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002501412", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002501412', 11012, 'Verified', 'Pune');
