A ID", "value": "P52100077822"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.15 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Pimple Gurav, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100077822", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Pimple Gurav Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100077822', 14162, 'Verified', 'Pune');
