 "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Rahatani, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100047901", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Rahatani Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100047901', 10273, 'Verified', 'Pune');
