 {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹99 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Hinjewadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1261012600728", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Hinjewadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1261012600728', 12992, 'Verified', 'Pune');
