 ID", "value": "P52100053687"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.99 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Office"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Baner, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100053687", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Baner Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100053687', 25158, 'Verified', 'Pune');
