"Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Moshi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100051495", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Moshi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100051495', 11736, 'Verified', 'Pune');
