, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100049608", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Baner Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100049608', 20675, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-rahul-altimus', 'Rahul Altimus', 'rahul-altimus', 'b-rahul-constructions', 'Baner', '₹1 Cr - ₹4 Cr', '₹1 Cr', '["Office", "Shop"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b5236d63-4f77-4715-9807-55a151a88f96/gallery/ms365ffd-bvnqx8.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b5236d63-4f77-4715-9807-55a151a88f96/gallery/ms365ffd-bvnqx8.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Rahul Altimus in Baner is a premium commercial development offering well-designed shops and offices on a 1-acre land parcel with a single iconic tower featuring G + M + 2P + 11 floors. Strategically located in one of Pune’s most sought-after business hubs, the project is crafted to deliver high visibility, efficient layouts, and a modern commercial environment that caters to diverse business needs. Ideal for growing enterprises and retail brands, Rahul Altimus promises a distinguished presence and excellent connectivity in the vibrant Baner locality.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Covered Parking", "EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PC1260002501180"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Office, Shop"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Baner, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PC1260002501180", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Baner Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PC1260002501180', 20920, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-neco-park-central', 'Neco Park Central', 'neco-park-central', 'b-neco-developers', 'Kharadi', '₹1.19 Cr - ₹2.39 Cr', '₹1.19 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "3.5 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3c62297e-cf76-40e6-be1b-9863a18f21a4/gallery/mvhqtpdg-2wwccl.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3c62297e-cf76-40e6-be1b-9863a18f21a4/gallery/mvhqtpdg-2wwccl.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Neco Park Central by Vasupujya Corporation is an IGBC Platinum pre-certified residential project off Old Mundhwa Road in Kharadi, East Pune, behind BG Tatva Society and near Bollywood Multiplex. The site sits in one of the greenest pockets of Kharadi, beside Oxygen Park, a public playground and reserved gardens, within PMC limits and about 400 m from the proposed 30 m DP road. On a land parcel of about 2.5 acres, three wings rise 18 storeys above three levels of parking, with 2, 3, 3.5 and 4 BHK homes of 849 to 1,865 sq ft (carpet plus balcony) and a 60 ft entrance boulevard. Amenities are spread over three levels: a clubhouse with party lawn, amphitheatre, cricket/football ground, badminton/basketball court, outdoor gym, jogging track, children''s play area, pet zone and senior citizens'' sit-out at ground level; a podium with a swimming pool and baby pool, landscaped lawn, gymnasium, yoga and meditation room, indoor games room, co-working space and toddlers'' creche; and a rooftop community lounge. Green features include solar hot water, rooftop solar PV for common areas, rainwater harvesting, an STP that recycles water for flushing and gardening, and heat-insulating glass. Homes come with a smart lock on the main door, a video door phone, 600 x 1200 mm vitrified tiles, Jaquar/Kohler-class fittings and AC provision in every bedroom and the living room. Four proposed metro stations lie within about 2 km, and the IT parks of Kharadi, Viman Nagar, Yerwada, Mundhwa and Magarpatta are about 10 minutes away. All-inclusive prices start at ₹1.19 Cr for a 2 BHK with one car park. MahaRERA P52100077542.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100077542"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.19 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 3.5 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kharadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100077542", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kharadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100077542', 14016, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-tej-one', 'Tej One Baner', 'tej-one', 'b-tej-developers', 'Baner', '₹2 Cr - ₹3 Cr', '₹2 Cr', '["Office"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9b89ecb7-3a53-4303-a13c-abd308864b9d/gallery/mtznhj4w-n0ml0.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9b89ecb7-3a53-4303-a13c-abd308864b9d/gallery/mtznhj4w-n0ml0.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Tej One in Baner is a premium commercial project offering modern office spaces and showrooms on a 1-acre land parcel with 1 well-planned tower. Designed for businesses seeking a prime location in West Pune, the project features contemporary architecture, excellent connectivity, and high-visibility commercial spaces, with prices starting from ₹2 Cr onwards.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1262022501416"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹2 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Office"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Baner, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1262022501416", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Baner Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1262022501416', 15384, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-vtp-flamante', 'VTP Flamante', 'vtp-flamante', 'b-vtp', 'Manjari Khurd', '₹1.30 Cr - ₹3.10 Cr', '₹1.30 Cr', '["2 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/890f823d-cfcf-45fe-930d-de268253086f/gallery/mvhz3d5m-ae6hxl.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/890f823d-cfcf-45fe-930d-de268253086f/gallery/mvhz3d5m-ae6hxl.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'VTP Flamante (Flamante by VTP Luxe) is a large residential project by VTP Realty in New Kharadi (Manjri), East Pune, part of the integrated Township Codename Pegasus. Spread over about 6 acres with around 2 acres of open space, it has six towers of 33 residential floors above parking and about 1,057 homes, with four or six apartments per floor. Homes on offer include 2 BHK apartments of about 850 sq ft carpet from Rs 1.30 Cr and 4 BHK apartments of about 1,794 sq ft carpet at Rs 3.10 Cr. Residences come with smart-home features, a digital lock, large marble-finish vitrified tiles, large windows and balconies with toughened-glass railings. The amenities hub includes an infinity-edge swimming pool, a clubhouse and multipurpose hall, an indoor gym, squash and lawn tennis courts, net cricket, a multipurpose court, a kids'' pool and play areas, a skating rink, an amphitheatre, jogging and cycling tracks, a meditation lawn and a work-from-home zone with outdoor work spaces under solar canopies. Residents also get township amenities such as sports academies, a township club and a school. EON IT Park is about 3.4 km away, WTC 3.8 km, the Pune-Nagar Highway 3.5 km and the airport about 9.5 km. Possession is planned from March 2028. MahaRERA: P52100051826 (Phase 1) and P52100055365 (Phase 2).', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100051826"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.30 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Manjari Khurd, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100051826", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Manjari Khurd Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100051826', 15294, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-hill-crest', 'PK Hillcrest', 'hill-crest', 'b-pk-group', 'Pimple Saudagar', 'Price on Request', 'Price on Request', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ffa48e6f-5069-4aed-8dfe-6745fdfa4c6b/gallery/mvfc2w3y-8gi6u6.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ffa48e6f-5069-4aed-8dfe-6745fdfa4c6b/gallery/mvfc2w3y-8gi6u6.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'PK Hillcrest is a residential project by PK Group on Jarvari Road, near PK International School, in Pimple Saudagar, Pune 411027. The development rises to G+22 floors with Wing A and Wing B, and offers 3 BHK homes with 975 to 980 sq ft of carpet area and 4 BHK homes with 1,438 sq ft of carpet area, according to the project website. Prices are not published, so the site shows price on request. Amenities include a clubhouse, an infinity pool with a shallow pool, a double-height gym, an indoor games room, a party lawn, a multi-play court, a toddlers'' play zone, guest rooms and a co-working space. PK International School is about 180 m away, Lotus Hospital about 600 m, Kokane Chowk about 900 m and 18 Degree Mall about 1.7 km. Wakad is about 5.5 km from the site. The project is registered with MahaRERA under number P52100045782, with a RERA possession date of November 2027. Contact the Pune Home team to book a site visit or request the current price sheet.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100045782"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "Price on Request"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Pimple Saudagar, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100045782", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Pimple Saudagar Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100045782', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-park-eden', 'Park Eden', 'park-eden', 'b-park-developers', 'Kharadi', '₹1.99 Cr - ₹3.33 Cr', '₹1.99 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Ready to Move', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjeb4h9-a0m0kn.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjeb4h9-a0m0kn.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Park Eden is a luxury residential project in Kharadi, Pune, by Purple Corp (Pride Purple) in association with iDO Realty, marketed as "Real Kharadi". Five towers rise around a central clubhouse and podium amenity level with landscaped gardens, a swimming pool and open activity zones. The towers offer 3 BHK homes (Elite 1,121 sq ft, Prime 1,204 sq ft, Prime+ 1,234 sq ft, Maxima 1,350 sq ft) and 4 BHK Imperia homes of 1,743 sq ft, shown as total carpet area including balconies. All-inclusive packages start at ₹1.99 crore for a 3 BHK and ₹3.33 crore for a 4 BHK. Homes come with 800 x 1600 mm vitrified flooring, a Flexi Room option, chef-ready kitchens with branded hardware, five-star-feel bathrooms with glass cubicles and geysers, a digital door lock with biometric and numeric access, and home automation with voice-control provision. Amenities include a teen zone with arcade gaming, golf simulator and ice hockey, kids zones, a business zone, a banquet hall, gym, swimming pool and kids pool, amphitheatre, jogging and cycling tracks and a sports zone with badminton, squash, padel and net cricket. Gera Commerzone is 2.6 km away, International Tech Park 3.5 km, EON IT Park 3.8 km and the Ahmednagar Highway 2 km. Park Eden Phase I is registered with MahaRERA (PR1260002502005) with a RERA completion date of February 2031.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Ready to Move"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002502005"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.99 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kharadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002502005", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kharadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002502005', 17752, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-vtp-velvet-villas', 'VTP Velvet Villas', 'vtp-velvet-villas', 'b-vtp-group', 'Manjari Khurd', '₹6.20 Cr - ₹10.75 Cr', '₹6.20 Cr', '["3 BHK", "5 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9c79e20a-0998-4a0c-8c95-e44548567e67/gallery/mvhz6j4n-a981is.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9c79e20a-0998-4a0c-8c95-e44548567e67/gallery/mvhz6j4n-a981is.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Velvet Villas by VTP Luxe is an exclusive gated enclave of just 43 independent villas on a 5-acre land parcel inside VTP Realty''s 165+ acre Township Codename Pegasus in New Kharadi, Pune, near WTC and EON IT Park. About an acre is kept as open space. Each villa rises ground + 1 floor with a private top terrace, in three types: Type 1 and Type 2 three-bedroom villas of 2,164 and 2,725 sq ft carpet, and Type 3 five-bedroom villas of 3,670 sq ft carpet, each with its own landscaped front and back gardens and a servant''s room. Interiors feature Italian marble flooring, grand double-height living and dining areas overlooking the front garden, and a master suite with a walk-in wardrobe and a skylight above the jacuzzi. The enclave has a palm-lined entry boulevard, a clubhouse with multipurpose hall and indoor gym, a heated swimming pool and children''s pool, a multi-sport court, outdoor gym, children''s play area, barbeque zone, senior citizen plaza and a party lawn with stage, plus multi-tier security and access to township amenities. Holy Angels Convent School is next door, Phoenix Market City and Amanora Mall are about 10 km away and the airport about 11 km. Prices start from ₹6.20 Cr. Agreement possession is December 2026. MahaRERA P52100031829 (Phase 1) and P52100047370 (Phase 2).', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100031829"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹6.20 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 5 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Manjari Khurd, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100031829", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Manjari Khurd Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100031829', 28650, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-godrej-aqua-vista', 'Godrej Aqua Vista', 'godrej-aqua-vista', 'b-godrej', 'Mundhwa', 'Price on Request', 'Price on Request', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/73ec855a-b670-4a04-954a-b91deaf3272d/gallery/mvjff0lj-11f9n6.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/73ec855a-b670-4a04-954a-b91deaf3272d/gallery/mvjff0lj-11f9n6.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Godrej Aqua Vista is a riverfront residential development by Godrej Properties in Keshav Nagar, Pune, along the Mula Mutha river, developed with Oxford Group. It is planned across 7 acres with 7 towers, of which about 2.5 acres are given to amenities: 50+ amenities, three clubhouses, two infinity swimming pools, a 300 m riverside promenade and a grand clubhouse of 1,486 sq m. Phase A (Towers 12 to 15) is yet to launch, while Phase B has Towers 16, 17 and 18, with Towers 16 and 17 open for sale. Tower 16 offers 2 BHK homes of 726 to 752 sq ft and 3 BHK homes of 974 to 1,240 sq ft (RERA area including exclusive areas), with about 200 apartments and 8 flats per floor. Tower 17 offers 1 and 2 BHK homes, with about 222 apartments and 9 flats per floor. Seasons Mall and Amanora Mall are about 4 km away, EON IT Park 5 km, Magarpatta Cybercity 5.4 km and World Trade Center 5.6 km. The project is registered with MahaRERA (PM1260002500389) with a RERA completion date of July 2032. Prices are on request.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002500389"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "Price on Request"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mundhwa, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002500389", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mundhwa Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002500389', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-vimal-twin-towers', 'Vimal Twin Towers', 'vimal-twin-towers', 'b-kate-promoters-and-developers', 'Pimple Saudagar', 'Price on Request', 'Price on Request', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3766f451-d050-4db0-a6f8-194ef4abaa3a/gallery/mvghrbu5-6gq1o0.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3766f451-d050-4db0-a6f8-194ef4abaa3a/gallery/mvghrbu5-6gq1o0.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Vimal Twin Towers is a 2 and 3 BHK residential project by Kate Promoters and Developers at S.No. 176/2/1, Shiv Sai Lane, on the Pimple Saudagar and Rahatani border in Pimpri-Chinchwad, Pune 411027. The A Wing is a ten-floor building with two lifts, and the master plan also shows a B building and a proposed C building. The developer''s area statement lists 2 BHK homes of 755 sq ft total carpet (about 550 sq ft RERA carpet, plus enclosed balcony and terrace) and 3 BHK homes of 1,033 to 1,043 sq ft total carpet. Listed prices disagree between portals, so the price is on request; please contact the sales team for the current rate card. Amenities include a landscaped garden, children''s play area, jogging track, senior citizen area, party lawn, covered parking, rainwater harvesting, a solar water system and generator backup for common areas. The brochure lists Pimpri about 1 km, Wakad and Nasik Phata about 2 km each, Aundh 3.5 km and Hinjewadi 4 km away. The A Wing is registered with MahaRERA under P52100054177, with possession due by 31 October 2026.', '["Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100054177"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "Price on Request"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Pimple Saudagar, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100054177", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Pimple Saudagar Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100054177', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-austin-ira', 'Austin Ira', 'austin-ira', 'b-austin-realty', 'Mamurdi', '₹43 L - ₹82.50 L', '₹43 L', '["1 BHK", "2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7209ca11-27c7-4930-b99c-5a1a8035c2a9/gallery/mvjem7f5-2fs1d7.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7209ca11-27c7-4930-b99c-5a1a8035c2a9/gallery/mvjem7f5-2fs1d7.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Austin Ira is a residential project by Austin Realty in Mamurdi, Pune, spread across 4.5 acres on MCA Road near Mukai Chowk and beside the MCA Pune Stadium. It offers 2 BHK Premium homes of 621 sq ft, 2 BHK Luxury homes of 671 sq ft and 3 BHK Premium homes of 840 sq ft carpet area, along with 1 BHK homes of 450 sq ft, with zero-wastage layouts, large windows for light and cross ventilation, and reserved hill views. More than 50 amenities include a clubhouse, covered swimming pool with pool deck, gymnasium and open gym, multipurpose court, net cricket, jogging track, amphitheatre seating, kids'' and toddler play areas, yoga and meditation zone, indoor games zone, fragrance garden and party lawn. Prices start at ₹65 lakh for a 2 BHK Premium, ₹69 lakh for a 2 BHK Luxury and ₹82.5 lakh for a 3 BHK Premium. Mamurdi sits at the junction of the Mumbai–Pune Expressway and NH-48, about 5 minutes from the expressway, 15 minutes from Hinjawadi and 20 minutes from Baner and Balewadi. Austin Ira is registered with MahaRERA (PM1260002601545) with a RERA completion date of December 2031.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002601545"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹43 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mamurdi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002601545", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mamurdi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002601545', 9555, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-sai-ratan', 'Sai Ratan', 'sai-ratan', 'b-sai-nisarg-landmark', 'Ravet', '₹77 L - ₹1.03 Cr', '₹77 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3266ed23-72ff-41aa-9c4b-6bcd594ab0c8/gallery/mvhthrdh-8tggr3.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3266ed23-72ff-41aa-9c4b-6bcd594ab0c8/gallery/mvhthrdh-8tggr3.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Sai Ratan is a new mixed-use project in Sector 29, Ravet Pradhikaran, by Sai Associates with Krishna Rama Developer and Ratan Homes. Its terracotta-and-grey building has 21 double-height shops with mezzanines along a 10.5 m road and three residential wings (A, B and C) above – 102 homes in all: 2 BHK of 777 sq ft and 3 BHK of 1,020 sq ft (carpet plus balcony). Amenities include a gymnasium, indoor games room, banquet hall, rooftop party lawn, landscaped rooftop sit-outs and a children''s play area. Homes get a 35 mm main door with a biometric lock, a video door bell, UPVC windows and balcony doors, 600 x 1200 mm vitrified tiles, Jaquar/Hindware fittings, geysers in every bathroom and AC provision in the living room and all bedrooms; the building has EV charging and solar power. D. Y. Patil Dnyanshanti School, PCCOE, DMart Ravet, Global Hospital and Akurdi railway station are about 5 minutes away, with the old Mumbai–Pune Highway and NH-48 about 10 minutes. Agreement values start from ₹77 L for a 2 BHK (about ₹86.5 L including GST, stamp duty and registration). MahaRERA PM1260002600399.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area", "EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002600399"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹77 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002600399", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002600399', 9909, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-l-axis', 'L Axis', 'l-axis', 'b-pharande-spaces', 'Moshi', '₹1.09 Cr - ₹2.04 Cr', '₹1.09 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Ready to Move', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/01d2e9f1-dad0-43fa-8906-61a24bfcd0dd/gallery/mvfc64td-5k9jp8.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/01d2e9f1-dad0-43fa-8906-61a24bfcd0dd/gallery/mvfc64td-5k9jp8.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'L Axis by Pharande Spaces is a large residential community on Spine Road, Sector 6, PCNTDA, Moshi, Pimpri-Chinchwad, spread over about 11 acres and built in phases and clusters, with the earlier phases already occupied. The current phases offer 2, 3 and 4 BHK apartments in high-rise towers using Mivan technology, with 40% open space and a four-tier security system. Carpet areas listed by the developer are 819 to 835 sq ft for 2 BHK, 1,121 to 1,290 sq ft for 3 BHK and 1,479 sq ft for 4 BHK. Asking prices on property portals in October 2026 start at ₹1.09 Cr for a 2 BHK, ₹1.51 Cr for a 3 BHK and ₹2.04 Cr for a 4 BHK; confirm the current price sheet with the sales team. Amenities include a swimming pool, a fitness centre, an amphitheatre, a basketball court, games rooms and a senior citizen area. Spine City Mall is about 1.1 km away, Talawade IT Park about 10 km and PCMC Metro station about 8.4 km. Phase III Cluster B is registered under MahaRERA number P52100077434, with possession targeted for December 2029.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Ready to Move"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100077434"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.09 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Moshi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100077434", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Moshi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100077434', 13308, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-mantra-melange', 'Mantra Melange', 'mantra-melange', 'b-mantra-properties', 'Kharadi', '₹1.22 Cr - ₹1.72 Cr', '₹1.22 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/320265b2-aa9a-48cb-b5e9-150455175a36/gallery/mvjc0yi3-d2qb7x.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/320265b2-aa9a-48cb-b5e9-150455175a36/gallery/mvjc0yi3-d2qb7x.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Mantra Melange is a riverside residential project by Mantra Properties in Kharadi Riverside, Wadgaon Sheri, Pune, on the banks of the Mula Mutha river. The development spreads over 8.75 acres, with a master layout of 11 landmark towers. The current launch brings 6 new towers with only 4 homes per floor, offering 2 BHK and 3 BHK apartments. A 2 BHK has a usable area of 843 or 882 sq ft (759 or 799 sq ft RERA carpet) and a 3 BHK has 1,110 or 1,177 sq ft (1,019 or 1,043 sq ft RERA carpet). Prices start at ₹1.22 crore for a 2 BHK and ₹1.61 crore for a 3 BHK. Residents get a podium with a swimming pool, amphitheatre, play area and open cafeteria, and a clubhouse with a gym, library, crèche, music room, tuition room, yoga and Zumba studios, co-working space, podcast room, indoor games and a guest bedroom. The location is 5 minutes from Magarpatta and Seasons Mall, 7 minutes from World Trade Center Kharadi and about 20 minutes from Pune airport and the railway station. Mantra Melange is registered with MahaRERA under project name Mantra Kharadi Phase 1 (P52100079582), with a RERA completion date of April 2030.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Library", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area", "Amphitheatre"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100079582"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.22 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kharadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100079582", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kharadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100079582', 14472, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-shaligram-ravet', 'Shaligram The Mile', 'shaligram-ravet', 'b-shaligram-buildcon', 'Ravet', '₹1.38 Cr - ₹1.92 Cr', '₹1.38 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bed8b526-3c8c-426b-8e44-cf65c659dbbe/gallery/mvhovzr5-s99wh.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bed8b526-3c8c-426b-8e44-cf65c659dbbe/gallery/mvhovzr5-s99wh.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Shaligram The Mile by Shaligram Group is a single landmark tower on the Aundh–Ravet BRTS Road in Ravet – the first high-rise you see entering Pune from Mumbai. On a 1.75-acre plot, it rises B2 + B1 + G + 36 floors with only 202 signature residences: 3 BHK homes of 1,124 to 1,301 sq ft and 4 BHK homes of 1,465 and 1,560 sq ft carpet area. Homes have a 10.5 ft floor-to-floor height, full-height glass façades, walk-in wardrobes, private sky decks and Vaastu-compliant layouts. Amenities are spread over three levels: a ground realm with gardens, gazebos, a jogging track, an amphitheatre, a kids'' play area and a multipurpose banquet hall; an indulgence level with a swimming pool and deck, baby pool, jacuzzi, gym, crèche and indoor games lounge; and a rooftop sky experience with a café, mini theatre, library and co-working area, yoga and meditation deck, sky walkway and stargazing deck. Ojas Multispecialty Hospital is about 2 minutes away, Global Hospital about 4 minutes, and Elpro City Square, Phoenix Mall of the Millennium and D-Mart Ravet about 10 minutes away. Launch prices start from ₹1.38 Cr for a 3 BHK and ₹1.80 Cr for a 4 BHK. MahaRERA PR1260002601415; RERA completion date December 2031.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002601415"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.38 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002601415", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002601415', 12277, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-codename-light', 'Codename Light', 'codename-light', 'b-esson-landmarks', 'Mundhwa', '₹93 L - ₹1.22 Cr', '₹93 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1d95631a-ef8e-4793-b94f-12fd3ff1902a/gallery/mvjeyoq9-3nr91v.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1d95631a-ef8e-4793-b94f-12fd3ff1902a/gallery/mvjeyoq9-3nr91v.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Codename Light is a Vastu-compliant residential project in Keshav Nagar, Mundhwa, Pune, by Esson Landmarks, Unitary Properties and Suyog Group, on Keshav Nagar Road near Renuka Mata Mandir. Spread across 4.5 acres, it is planned around three elegantly rising towers with about 1.1 acres of lifestyle and amenity space. The homes are 2 BHK of 775 to 787 sq ft and 3 BHK of 993 to 995 sq ft (total carpet area including balconies), with wide balconies and efficient layouts that let in natural light. A 2 BHK comes with one car park and a 3 BHK with two. Indicative all-inclusive prices start at ₹93 lakh for a 2 BHK and ₹1.22 crore for a 3 BHK. More than 35 amenities include a rooftop swimming pool with vanishing edge and water cascade, kids pool, clubhouse and banquet hall, gym, yoga and Zumba rooms, spa and salon, amphitheatre and movie amphitheatre, temple court, party lawn, Miyawaki forest, play court and children''s play areas. The upcoming Keshav Nagar–Kharadi bridge is about 7 minutes away, Koregaon Park 10 minutes, Magarpatta City 12 minutes, EON IT Park 15 minutes and Pune Airport 20 minutes. The project is registered with MahaRERA as LIORA (PR1261012501453), valid until 31 March 2029.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1261012501453"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹93 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mundhwa, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1261012501453", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mundhwa Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1261012501453', 12000, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-mangalam-starview', 'Mangalam Starview', 'mangalam-starview', 'b-mangalam-landmarks', 'Kiwale', '₹80 L - ₹1.02 Cr', '₹80 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/62c4f82a-4e0d-43ed-bb38-e8ccdf9df558/gallery/mvez09ey-de6zrx.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/62c4f82a-4e0d-43ed-bb38-e8ccdf9df558/gallery/mvez09ey-de6zrx.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Premium 2 & 3 BHK Apartments in Kiwale, Pune
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-prime-pinnacle', 'Prime Pinnacle', 'prime-pinnacle', 'b-viraj-corp', 'Wakad', '₹68 L - ₹2.23 Cr', '₹68 L', '["Smart Office", "Premium Office"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bfe0548a-333b-47f4-bf68-d1bebe86d984/gallery/mvghqa3t-4dghew.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bfe0548a-333b-47f4-bf68-d1bebe86d984/gallery/mvghqa3t-4dghew.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Prime Pinnacle is a Grade A commercial tower by Viraj Corp on Datta Mandir Road in Wakad, Pune 411057, which the developer describes as the tallest commercial building in Wakad. The project is a single 15-storey tower offering boutique offices with glass partitions and doors, a grand double-height entrance lobby, high-speed elevators, a washroom in every unit and a rooftop cafeteria. Smart offices have a carpet area of 346 to 752 sq ft, while premium offices range from 1,277 to 2,489 sq ft, and each unit gets its own three-phase meter with 24x7 DG backup. Parking is handled through a multi-level robotic car parking system, and the building has 24x7 security with an intercom facility, a fire hydrant system and two common conference rooms. Asking prices on property portals in October 2026 start at ₹68 L for a Smart Office and ₹2.23 Cr for a Premium Office; confirm the current price sheet with the sales team. According to the developer, Wakad Metro Station is about 5 minutes away, Hinjewadi 8 minutes, Balewadi 10 minutes and Cognizant H2 11 minutes. The project is registered under MahaRERA number P52100077826, with possession reported for September 2027.', '["Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100077826"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹68 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Smart Office, Premium Office"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100077826", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100077826', 19653, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-saheel-wakad-111', 'Luxton by Saheel', 'saheel-wakad-111', 'b-saheel-properties', 'Wakad', '₹1.06 Cr - ₹1.98 Cr', '₹1.06 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/adc7420a-f087-4832-b5b6-aaff3c37a461/gallery/mvfbi877-8s23ib.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/adc7420a-f087-4832-b5b6-aaff3c37a461/gallery/mvfbi877-8s23ib.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Luxton by Saheel is a residential project by Saheel Properties at Survey No. 111/1/2, next to Indira School, near Shani Mandir Road in Wakad, Pune. It is planned as three towers of about 30 floors on roughly 3 acres, with 2, 3 and 4 BHK homes. Carpet areas, including balconies as printed in the developer''s brochure, run from 753 to 859 sq ft for 2 BHK, 970 to 1,162 sq ft for 3 BHK and 1,457 sq ft for 4 BHK. Listed starting prices are about Rs 1.06 crore for 2 BHK, Rs 1.47 crore for 3 BHK and Rs 1.98 crore for 4 BHK; confirm final cost with the sales team. Highlights include a 4,000 sq ft entrance lobby, a rooftop club with a pool and aqua theatre, a gym, a yoga deck, a pickleball court, an open library and co-working space,. The developer lists the Mumbai-Bangalore Highway about one minute away, Hinjewadi IT Park and Phoenix Mall of the Millennium about ten minutes, and Baner-Balewadi High Street about fifteen minutes. MahaRERA number PM1260002502043; possession is listed for June 2030.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002502043"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.06 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002502043", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PM1260002502043', 14077, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-panoreeva-greens', 'Panoreeva Greens', 'panoreeva-greens', 'b-avirat-developers', 'Chinchwad', '₹1 Cr', '₹1 Cr', '["3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/17fc8bdb-26b0-4047-9313-5e050676841b/gallery/mvghw0ci-9m4jzc.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/17fc8bdb-26b0-4047-9313-5e050676841b/gallery/mvghw0ci-9m4jzc.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Panoreeva Greens is a riverside residential project by Avirat Developers at Survey No. 110, Walhekarwadi, Chinchwad, Pune 411033, beside the Pavana river and close to Chhatrapati Shivaji Chowk. Built on a land parcel of about 72,200 sq ft (roughly 1.66 acres), it is planned as five connected towers with rooftop amenity decks and around 300 apartments. The homes are 3 BHK residences with carpet areas of 864 sq ft and 903 sq ft, served by two lifts per wing with generator backup. Asking prices on property portals in October 2026 start at ₹1 Cr for a 3 BHK; confirm the current price sheet with the sales team. Amenities include a gymnasium, children''s play area, landscaped garden, EV charging points, a skywalk jogging track, a stargazing deck and an acupressure pathway. The developer''s brochure lists Aditya Birla Memorial Hospital about 4.4 km away, Bhosari MIDC about 4.5 km, Wakad IT Park about 5.5 km and the Hinjewadi IT hub about 10 km. The project is registered under MahaRERA number P52100078744, with possession scheduled for December 2028.', '["Gymnasium", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area", "EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100078744"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Chinchwad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100078744", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Chinchwad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100078744', 11574, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-elementis-oro', 'Elementis ORO', 'elementis-oro', 'b-adi-group', 'Nigdi', '₹1.50 Cr - ₹1.90 Cr', '₹1.50 Cr', '["3 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e40babf9-1772-489e-a6cb-625300ca3252/gallery/mvhmmyfa-azmrba.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e40babf9-1772-489e-a6cb-625300ca3252/gallery/mvhmmyfa-azmrba.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Elementis ORO by ADI Group is a new launch in Pradhikaran, Nigdi – the successor to the developer''s Elementis project in the same neighbourhood. It is a boutique community of two towers with exclusive 3 BHK residences of 1,318 and 1,438 sq ft carpet area. Homes are three-side open, with spacious kitchens and dedicated store rooms, walk-in wardrobes, large living-room balconies and sit-outs, and dry balconies off the kitchen. Every apartment has 24x7 DG power backup, and the building has multi-level security with 24x7 CCTV, lifts, a fire-fighting system, a children''s play area, closed car parking, a sewage treatment plant, rainwater harvesting and landscaped greens. Pradhikaran is one of Pimpri-Chinchwad''s planned residential sectors, with wide roads, gardens and established schools, hospitals and markets close by. Prices start from ₹1.50 Cr and go up to ₹1.90 Cr, with a flexi-payment plan available. The project is registered with MahaRERA under PR1260002601161, with a RERA completion date of December 2030.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002601161"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.50 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Nigdi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002601161", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Nigdi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002601161', 11380, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-unique-youtopia', 'Unique Youtopia', 'unique-youtopia', 'b-unique-properties', 'Kharadi', '₹1.01 Cr - ₹1.37 Cr', '₹1.01 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/725beed8-203a-4b2b-83e9-ac91408cc883/gallery/mvjd8guz-31y41y.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/725beed8-203a-4b2b-83e9-ac91408cc883/gallery/mvjd8guz-31y41y.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Unique Youtopia is a residential township in Central Kharadi, Pune, by Unique Properties in association with the Kodre family, on River Road. Phase IV, registered with MahaRERA as P52100080485, brings the A7 and A8 wings with 2 BHK homes of 748 to 761 sq ft and 3 BHK homes of 893 to 1,009 sq ft (total area including balconies). Prices start at about ₹1.01 crore for a 2 BHK and ₹1.22 crore for a 3 BHK, including one covered parking. The project spreads 45+ amenities over 5 recreation zones and more than 40,000 sq ft of open area: an infinity pool and clubhouse, indoor gym with AC, spa and steam room, party hall, badminton, table tennis and multipurpose courts, a cricket net, jogging and barefoot tracks, yoga cove, children''s play areas, a crèche, Wi-Fi workstations and a theatre area. Homes have 600 mm x 1200 mm vitrified flooring, smart biometric locks, video door phones and solar-heated water in all bathrooms. Zensar IT Park and World Trade Center are about 2 km away, EON IT Park 3 km, and Pune airport about 9 km. The RERA completion date for Phase IV is April 2029.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100080485"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.01 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kharadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100080485", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kharadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100080485', 13529, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-godrej-ivara', 'Godrej Ivara', 'godrej-ivara', 'b-godrej', 'Kharadi', '₹1.29 Cr - ₹3.19 Cr', '₹1.29 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/5792a6e0-c6da-4bc5-ab9b-a5bf7c84fb5d/gallery/mvhqju3k-4r5zbd.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/5792a6e0-c6da-4bc5-ab9b-a5bf7c84fb5d/gallery/mvhqju3k-4r5zbd.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'Godrej Ivara by Godrej Properties is a large-format community in Kharadi, Pune, a few minutes from EON Free Zone and the World Trade Center. Spread over about 12.8 acres with 11 towers (A to K), it offers 2, 3 and 4 BHK homes from 729 to 1,580 sq ft, with around 6 acres of open, landscaped greens. Amenities cover about 1 lakh sq ft across two clubhouses and a landscaped podium: a 10,000 sq ft gym with CrossFit and strength zones beside a yoga and wellness spa with a temperature-controlled jacuzzi, a 20,000 sq ft co-working space with quiet pods, meeting "war rooms", hot desks and private enterprise suites, a 10,000 sq ft Mediterranean-themed café with indoor and alfresco dining, two banquet halls, indoor badminton and squash courts, a library, a crèche, a wellness and spa area, a lagoon-style lap pool with jacuzzi and kids'' pool, a floating deck with water features, an amphitheatre, multi-play, pickleball, half-basketball and box-cricket courts, a skate park, a pet park and an oval sports ground. Homes come with Kohler or equivalent sanitaryware, vitrified flooring, granite kitchen counters, sliding windows with mosquito mesh, a video door phone and solar water heating in the master bathroom, built to Godrej''s quality standards (IS 1786 and IS 13920 steel, M35 concrete and 1.5 m waterproofing in wet areas). EON Free Zone and the World Trade Center are about 0.5 km away, Commerzone about 1.4 km, Viman Nagar 8–12 minutes and Pune International Airport about 20 minutes. Prices start from ₹1.29 Cr for a 2 BHK (PLC and floor rise extra). MahaRERA PR1260002502426; RERA completion date December 2032.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002502426"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.29 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kharadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002502426", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kharadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002502426', 17695, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-vj-palladio-la-viento', 'VJ Palladio La Viento', 'vj-palladio-la-viento', 'b-vilas-javdekar', 'Mahalunge', '₹99.07 L - ₹1.52 Cr', '₹99.07 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e1c8ac64-4e65-460a-84c8-460f12548757/gallery/mvf7dh1w-4kkjja.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e1c8ac64-4e65-460a-84c8-460f12548757/gallery/mvf7dh1w-4kkjja.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp"]', 'VJ Palladio La Viento is a residential project by Vilas Javdekar Developers at Baner-Mahalunge, near VIBGYOR High School, Pune. Spread over about 3.78 acres with roughly 75% open area, it has two 27-storey towers with 194 apartments. Homes come in 2, 3 and 4 BHK layouts with carpet areas from about 708 sq ft (2 BHK) to 1,086 sq ft (4 BHK), with listed prices starting around Rs 99 lakh; please confirm current pricing with the sales team. The towers are planned for cross-ventilation and carry a curved facade. A three-storey, Spanish-villa style Club LaViento anchors over 40 amenities across six landscaped zones, including a swimming pool with kids'' pool, jogging track, multipurpose court, open gym, amphitheatre-style seating and a pets'' area. The site lies between Baner, Sus and Balewadi, about 2.2 km from D-Mart and 2.3 km from the Sus-Pashan bridge, with the Mumbai-Pune bypass flyover about 3.6 km away. It is registered with MahaRERA under PR1260002501182, with a registered completion date of December 2029.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002501182"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹99.07 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mahalunge, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002501182", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mahalunge Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'PR1260002501182', 13992, 'Verified', 'Pune');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-paranjape-blue-ridge-promenade', 'Paranjape Blue Ridge - The Promenade', 'paranjape-blue-ridge-promenade', 'b-paranjape', 'Hinjewadi', '₹1.80 Cr - ₹2.50 Cr', '₹1.80 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', 'December 2026', 'https://www.pscl.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/ANK440_7834a_LR.webp', 'https://www.pscl.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/ANK440_7834a_LR.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/5oObZb7synV62rPVYqZAbCYsgqNubnGbhVrvmYj8.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/neQCNkziS5bgoqGRmAb7yybVwaAKDFIUsnKt9779.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp"]', 'The Promenade by Paranjape Schemes is a luxury waterfront high-rise development in the iconic 138-acre Blue Ridge Township, Hinjewadi Phase 1, Pune. Rising 32 storeys along the serene Mula riverfront, these limited-edition 3 and 4 BHK residences offer private elevator foyers, floor-to-ceiling glass balconies, Italian marble finishes, and unhindered river panoramas.
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-paranjape-blue-ridge-altius', 'Paranjape Blue Ridge - The Altius', 'paranjape-blue-ridge-altius', 'b-paranjape', 'Hinjewadi', '₹1.95 Cr - ₹4.00 Cr', '₹1.95 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK", "5 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', 'December 2027', 'https://www.pscl.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Altius-scaled.webp', 'https://www.pscl.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Altius-scaled.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/OrO96DlQ1BdtwMK7CAwta4xb2E56lGlQ1N3qwfrF.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/WQDgrXOUlEW3lrJuTVXdijlc3HUZMVKaA76af70F.webp"]', 'The Altius (Tower 26) is the crown jewel architectural skyscraper within Paranjape Blue Ridge township in Hinjewadi, Pune. Soaring 36 storeys high, The Altius offers ultra-luxury 3, 4, and 5 BHK penthouses and grand residences designed for Pune''s corporate leadership and global CXOs.
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-paranjape-trident-towers', 'Paranjape Trident Towers', 'paranjape-trident-towers', 'b-paranjape', 'Hinjewadi', '₹43.00 L - ₹80.00 L', '₹43.00 L', '["1 BHK", "2 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', 'December 2026', 'https://www.pscl.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Trident-Tower-scaled.webp', 'https://www.pscl.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Trident-Tower-scaled.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/QUSiXbX1yIv3u1F0efgnLHyJgKsJfu0DIDG1r7Wi.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/elqlVrqhkL41pdaytkeF0xK9oc0oitS9ZctMJKZz.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/cu7T1exp3WjBAuIjjcAQclhBnDwVt0x1lCTQkwlS.webp"]', 'Trident Towers by Paranjape Schemes is a high-tech residential landmark located on the Hinjewadi-Wakad Link Road. Engineered with modern Mivan shuttering technology, these smart 1 & 2 BHK homes are crafted specifically for young IT and engineering professionals.
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-paranjape-forest-trails-highgardens', 'Paranjape Forest Trails - Highgardens', 'paranjape-forest-trails-highgardens', 'b-paranjape', 'Bavdhan', '₹87.00 L - ₹1.71 Cr', '₹87.00 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', 'July 2028', 'https://www.pscl.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Highgardens-scaled.webp', 'https://www.pscl.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Highgardens-scaled.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/LRk6ujgc4OZvne3hIg9Oy1w5Ybq2LhGzE9FyFTTw.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/cu7T1exp3WjBAuIjjcAQclhBnDwVt0x1lCTQkwlS.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/jnS1qblkmU2CpmWs6iYIug0TT9I1JmRAEizQVMsP.webp"]', 'Highgardens is a premier hillside residential enclave inside the celebrated 190+ acre Forest Trails Township in Bhugaon, just minutes from Bavdhan and Chandani Chowk. Highgardens introduces private terrace garden residences that seamlessly blend indoor luxury with lush Sahyadri nature.
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city) VALUES ('p-paranjape-forest-trails-canopy', 'Paranjape Forest Trails - The Canopy', 'paranjape-forest-trails-canopy', 'b-paranjape', 'Bavdhan', '₹83.00 L - ₹1.21 Cr', '₹83.00 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', 'December 2029', 'https://www.pscl.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Canopy-1-scaled.webp', 'https://www.pscl.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Canopy-1-scaled.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ugU2mSy6BbqdiWgd8BB1RXRyQnRK5gqL2KtUlB81.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/cu7T1exp3WjBAuIjjcAQclhBnDwVt0x1lCTQkwlS.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp"]', 'The Canopy (Sector R48) is a 24-storey high-rise biophilic residential tower nestled inside the 190-acre Forest Trails Township in Bhugaon, minutes from Bavdhan, Pune. Designed to sit under the verdant canopy of 34,000+ forest trees, every apartment offers cross ventilation and unobstructed valley perspectives.
