RA ID", "value": "P52100022499"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.10 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, Duplex"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "Ready to Move"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Upper Kharadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100022499", "Upper Kharadi Prime Growth Hub", "100% Brokerage Free Purchase", "ChildCentric® Signature Infrastructure"]', 'P52100022499', 15500, 'Verified', 'Pune');
